(1760725, 240401, 35602, '<td valign="top">When I looked at the picture, I thought how much the handles looked like ears listening.  Nice use of descending composition, but I think it might have worked better if where the handles ended you put the pot.  The writing on whatever that far subject is isn''t clear enough to give me any idea what you were trying to frame with the handles.</td>', 'When I looked at the picture, I thought how much the handles looked like ears listening.  Nice use of descending composition, but I think it might have worked better if where the handles ended you put the pot.  The writing on whatever that far subject is isn''t clear enough to give me any idea what you were trying to frame with the handles.', '2005-10-05 09:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760728, 239581, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not liking this one very much.  The expression on the model is not attractive, and I must be stupid but am not sure the significance to the composition of the skull and crossbones.  The focus is excellent, though, and the colors and lighting are very good.</td>', 'Not liking this one very much.  The expression on the model is not attractive, and I must be stupid but am not sure the significance to the composition of the skull and crossbones.  The focus is excellent, though, and the colors and lighting are very good.', '2005-10-05 09:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
