(1760739, 240373, 35602, '<td valign="top">Felt the lights were too distracting.  I think a better light, perhaps flash covered with a handkerchief, would have improved the subject of the person in the corner.</td>', 'Felt the lights were too distracting.  I think a better light, perhaps flash covered with a handkerchief, would have improved the subject of the person in the corner.', '2005-10-05 09:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
