(1761105, 239510, 31403, '<td valign="top">I mean this in the nicest way possible - <br/> <br/>what is this a photo of?  the coffee sign?  then the rest of the information is only visually distracting - is it a photo of people enjoying coffee?  then I would suggest that there is too much information above the people to draw any attention to them.<br/> <br/>If you ask what it is that you are shooting, and then simplify the photo with framing, and cropping in post production, you''ll have a stonger photo that conveys a simple message that the voting folks, and other viewers will understand.<br/> <br/>As it is, it''s a snapshot with no real subject of focus.  See how that works?  I hope this helps, it''s a discussion I have with my beginning photo students all the time, but it''s hard to tell how it will be taken online - know what I mean.<br/> <br/>Keep pushing that button - :-)</td>', 'I mean this in the nicest way possible -  what is this a photo of?  the coffee sign?  then the rest of the information is only visually distracting - is it a photo of people enjoying coffee?  then I would suggest that there is too much information above the people to draw any attention to them. If you ask what it is that you are shooting, and then simplify the photo with framing, and cropping in post production, you''ll have a stonger photo that conveys a simple message that the voting folks, and other viewers will understand. As it is, it''s a snapshot with no real subject of focus.  See how that works?  I hope this helps, it''s a discussion I have with my beginning photo students all the time, but it''s hard to tell how it will be taken online - know what I mean. Keep pushing that button - :-)', '2005-10-05 11:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761107, 240346, 32084, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  It is too small, the date stamp has to go, and it needs sharpness.  This is a super beginning and with a little more work could be super.</td>', 'Great idea.  It is too small, the date stamp has to go, and it needs sharpness.  This is a super beginning and with a little more work could be super.', '2005-10-05 11:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761108, 237831, 31403, '<td valign="top">tough shot with that backlighting - you did a nice job.  maybe use a bounce card to fill in those shadows a little and bring more detail to the foreground?  nice photo</td>', 'tough shot with that backlighting - you did a nice job.  maybe use a bounce card to fill in those shadows a little and bring more detail to the foreground?  nice photo', '2005-10-05 11:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761110, 240259, 15574, '<td valign="top">I have never seen a lizard in a coffee shop, but hey, I could be going to the wrong ones.</td>', 'I have never seen a lizard in a coffee shop, but hey, I could be going to the wrong ones.', '2005-10-05 11:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761113, 240579, 15574, '<td valign="top">Geez, that guy really loves his coffee.</td>', 'Geez, that guy really loves his coffee.', '2005-10-05 11:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761114, 240280, 31403, '<td valign="top">really cool idea - just a touch more light from above and this is a a much stronger photo for me - I love the graphic/abstract nature of it - great work!  7</td>', 'really cool idea - just a touch more light from above and this is a a much stronger photo for me - I love the graphic/abstract nature of it - great work!  7', '2005-10-05 11:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
