(1761118, 240292, 31403, '<td valign="top">love everything about this - something really worth focusing on in that narrow focus range would put me over the top on this.  Glasses, a nice pen, but discarded sugar packets is a little disappointing.  The colors, focus, framing, exposure, layout, love love love it.  This is great work - 7</td>', 'love everything about this - something really worth focusing on in that narrow focus range would put me over the top on this.  Glasses, a nice pen, but discarded sugar packets is a little disappointing.  The colors, focus, framing, exposure, layout, love love love it.  This is great work - 7', '2005-10-05 11:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
