(1762141, 239949, 21362, '<td valign="top">I like it, but it would be even better with someone sitting there.</td>', 'I like it, but it would be even better with someone sitting there.', '2005-10-05 16:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762143, 239126, 42984, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to find v ery much attractive here.  There are possibilities for this image but ti does raise some questions first.  Why B&amp;W?  Coffee thru a straw?  Wat message is trying to be communicated?  Try this again with some side light, good depth of field and maybe if you want black and white, boost the contrast up to try for some dramatic effects</td>', 'It''s hard to find v ery much attractive here.  There are possibilities for this image but ti does raise some questions first.  Why B&W?  Coffee thru a straw?  Wat message is trying to be communicated?  Try this again with some side light, good depth of field and maybe if you want black and white, boost the contrast up to try for some dramatic effects', '2005-10-05 16:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762146, 239050, 21362, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections.</td>', 'I like the reflections.', '2005-10-05 16:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762151, 239231, 21362, '<td valign="top">A most unusual coffee cup...I like the curve of the book echoing the curves of the cup/saucer thing.</td>', 'A most unusual coffee cup...I like the curve of the book echoing the curves of the cup/saucer thing.', '2005-10-05 16:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762156, 239231, 42984, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is interesting.  Love the shapes, this image *does* love the almost B&amp;W and the simplicity is attractive.  I can''t make up my mind about the composition, something is "off" a little but I can''t decide what that is.  The book is a key element in the contrast of shapes so its not that although I feel the cup may be too centreed in frame.  A major niggle though (looses at least a point) is that you haven''t rotated the image to get your horizon level.</td>', 'Ok, this is interesting.  Love the shapes, this image *does* love the almost B&W and the simplicity is attractive.  I can''t make up my mind about the composition, something is "off" a little but I can''t decide what that is.  The book is a key element in the contrast of shapes so its not that although I feel the cup may be too centreed in frame.  A major niggle though (looses at least a point) is that you haven''t rotated the image to get your horizon level.', '2005-10-05 16:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762164, 238181, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I expected to see that in "Beverages".  This just feel over lit.  The light is flat and gives the cloth too much significance in the image.  I''m trying to imagine it on a dark background,</td>', 'Great idea, I expected to see that in "Beverages".  This just feel over lit.  The light is flat and gives the cloth too much significance in the image.  I''m trying to imagine it on a dark background,', '2005-10-05 16:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762169, 240280, 42984, '<td valign="top">So simple yet so effective.  I believe that this demonstrates the strength of good composition. The light is smooth, low  and interesting and the overall effect of the black areas gives the image its strength</td>', 'So simple yet so effective.  I believe that this demonstrates the strength of good composition. The light is smooth, low  and interesting and the overall effect of the black areas gives the image its strength', '2005-10-05 16:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762171, 238736, 40977, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Really enjoy the soft tone and approach you took with this image.  Great job -- should ribbon</td>', 'Excellent.  Really enjoy the soft tone and approach you took with this image.  Great job -- should ribbon', '2005-10-05 16:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762173, 238211, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great image.....love the use of b/w and the border works well to complete the look. Nicely done.</td>', 'Great image.....love the use of b/w and the border works well to complete the look. Nicely done.', '2005-10-05 16:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762175, 239049, 40977, '<td valign="top">Really nicely done....soft focus and captures the moment.  Well done.</td>', 'Really nicely done....soft focus and captures the moment.  Well done.', '2005-10-05 16:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762176, 239578, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea and a lot of work has gone into it.  If the intention of the message is "dirty and used" then your post-production needs to generate that.  As it is, the greyscales are smooth and even with no noise.  As a result, the message is lost and the image sort of fails to have the impact that is lurking there</td>', 'This is an interesting idea and a lot of work has gone into it.  If the intention of the message is "dirty and used" then your post-production needs to generate that.  As it is, the greyscales are smooth and even with no noise.  As a result, the message is lost and the image sort of fails to have the impact that is lurking there', '2005-10-05 16:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762178, 238114, 40977, '<td valign="top">Focus is amazing.  Love the shadowy effects - IMO you nailed this shot 100%.  Well Done :)</td>', 'Focus is amazing.  Love the shadowy effects - IMO you nailed this shot 100%.  Well Done :)', '2005-10-05 16:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
