(1762230, 240436, 21430, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and good capture of the lighting and all.<br/> <br/>  The only issue I have is the pose the model is in, it is very unnartural, people don''t normally get into that shape and drop a drink.</td>', 'Nice concept and good capture of the lighting and all.   The only issue I have is the pose the model is in, it is very unnartural, people don''t normally get into that shape and drop a drink.', '2005-10-05 16:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
