(1762260, 240063, 43434, '<td valign="top">Lovely .. I really like this ... but for the marks on the fork it would have scored much higher - unless there wre crumbs comming away from the fork.</td>', 'Lovely .. I really like this ... but for the marks on the fork it would have scored much higher - unless there wre crumbs comming away from the fork.', '2005-10-05 16:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762270, 240474, 43434, '<td valign="top">This is what my friend was looking for a great picture of a old fashioned coffee grinder.  But if it had been side on we both think it would be spactacular .. the stuff on the table is overpowering.</td>', 'This is what my friend was looking for a great picture of a old fashioned coffee grinder.  But if it had been side on we both think it would be spactacular .. the stuff on the table is overpowering.', '2005-10-05 16:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762272, 240194, 40868, '<td valign="top">You spelled it wrong.  "there is no x in espresso."  Otherwise, it''s a good picture - the wood on the right side is a bit distracting.</td>', 'You spelled it wrong.  "there is no x in espresso."  Otherwise, it''s a good picture - the wood on the right side is a bit distracting.', '2005-10-05 16:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762280, 240458, 43434, '<td valign="top">Very confusing ... can''t quite picture this dolly in a coffee shop.  Oh well...</td>', 'Very confusing ... can''t quite picture this dolly in a coffee shop.  Oh well...', '2005-10-05 16:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762281, 237467, 42984, '<td valign="top">Tough shot.  I really like the composition and effect of this but the depth of field is very very difficult to achieve unless you have a full commercial setup and very very small apertures at your disposal.  Overall, I find the image appealing but technically is wanting</td>', 'Tough shot.  I really like the composition and effect of this but the depth of field is very very difficult to achieve unless you have a full commercial setup and very very small apertures at your disposal.  Overall, I find the image appealing but technically is wanting', '2005-10-05 16:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762284, 238107, 42984, '<td valign="top">In a coffe shop?  Is this an out take from "Beverages"?</td>', 'In a coffe shop?  Is this an out take from "Beverages"?', '2005-10-05 16:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762285, 240419, 40868, '<td valign="top">I''d vote this a lot higher if I could see the whole word "starbucks"</td>', 'I''d vote this a lot higher if I could see the whole word "starbucks"', '2005-10-05 16:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762286, 239819, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a GREAT photo of a baseball...but what does it have to do with a coffee shop?  Did it fly thru the window while you were there?  ;^)  Just curious...I''m sure you must have some connection, but really, I don''t get it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a GREAT photo of a baseball...but what does it have to do with a coffee shop?  Did it fly thru the window while you were there?  ;^)  Just curious...I''m sure you must have some connection, but really, I don''t get it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-05 16:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762291, 240397, 40977, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  Love that you did something outside of the usual with the coffee beans &amp; you did it well.</td>', 'Very cool shot.  Love that you did something outside of the usual with the coffee beans & you did it well.', '2005-10-05 16:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762294, 240439, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great job...not only is the shot spot on in focus, but the design on the table makes it a stand out.</td>', 'Great job...not only is the shot spot on in focus, but the design on the table makes it a stand out.', '2005-10-05 16:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762298, 240367, 40977, '<td valign="top">Oh, but there is no such thing as soo much coffee (lol)  Crisp focus, great color and the shadow is amazing.  Well done.</td>', 'Oh, but there is no such thing as soo much coffee (lol)  Crisp focus, great color and the shadow is amazing.  Well done.', '2005-10-05 17:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762301, 240548, 40868, '<td valign="top">This picture is way too red, it''s distracting.</td>', 'This picture is way too red, it''s distracting.', '2005-10-05 17:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762304, 238671, 40977, '<td valign="top">There are some b/w photos that are pulling off the coffee shop angle, but IMO yours would have been better in color. The swirl in the cup is lost because of the lack on contrasting color...however, the focus is great and I personally really love the corner seat approach you took with this shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'There are some b/w photos that are pulling off the coffee shop angle, but IMO yours would have been better in color. The swirl in the cup is lost because of the lack on contrasting color...however, the focus is great and I personally really love the corner seat approach you took with this shot.  Nicely done.', '2005-10-05 17:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762308, 239510, 40977, '<td valign="top">I love the outdoor coffee shop, but in this shot the background craft fair is a bit distracting. Maybe a tighter shot/crop would have been better.  Regardless the focus is good and I like the overall feel.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I love the outdoor coffee shop, but in this shot the background craft fair is a bit distracting. Maybe a tighter shot/crop would have been better.  Regardless the focus is good and I like the overall feel.  Nicely done.', '2005-10-05 17:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762310, 239532, 42392, '<td valign="top">i just loved this thanks for the great view</td>', 'i just loved this thanks for the great view', '2005-10-05 17:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762314, 238189, 8455, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image, i wish it was larger... camera limitations?</td>', 'A beautiful image, i wish it was larger... camera limitations?', '2005-10-05 17:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762315, 237797, 40977, '<td valign="top">Cookies and Coffee - I''m on my way now.  Great idea for the challenge and the cup design is too cute.  Great use of color and spot on focus. Would rather have seen a table in lieu of the cloth to give it a bit more of a coffee shop feel - regardless nicely done.</td>', 'Cookies and Coffee - I''m on my way now.  Great idea for the challenge and the cup design is too cute.  Great use of color and spot on focus. Would rather have seen a table in lieu of the cloth to give it a bit more of a coffee shop feel - regardless nicely done.', '2005-10-05 17:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762317, 240294, 42984, '<td valign="top">Simple idea that maybe got to busy.  I like the humour and the quirkiness</td>', 'Simple idea that maybe got to busy.  I like the humour and the quirkiness', '2005-10-05 17:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762318, 240070, 42392, '<td valign="top">great colors. great picture.</td>', 'great colors. great picture.', '2005-10-05 17:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762323, 240579, 8455, '<td valign="top">I neeee eeddd more coooffff e e e e eee.  (-:</td>', 'I neeee eeddd more coooffff e e e e eee.  (-:', '2005-10-05 17:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762330, 240009, 40977, '<td valign="top">Which one of these are not like the others??  Great job.  Love the soft lighting/focus and think this was very well done.</td>', 'Which one of these are not like the others??  Great job.  Love the soft lighting/focus and think this was very well done.', '2005-10-05 17:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762333, 240348, 40977, '<td valign="top">Nice - Like the shadows and crisp focus.  Your composition was just right (imo) not too tight and not too far back.  Great job.</td>', 'Nice - Like the shadows and crisp focus.  Your composition was just right (imo) not too tight and not too far back.  Great job.', '2005-10-05 17:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762338, 240473, 42984, '<td valign="top">Oh this is a superb submission for this challenge - the first I''ve seen so far that attempts to capture the subject.  The title, the composition, the light, the awesome DOF, the intervention of the rail and its detail work and your post production colouring ... all are just remarkable.  I''ll stick my neck out and say Ribbon.</td>', 'Oh this is a superb submission for this challenge - the first I''ve seen so far that attempts to capture the subject.  The title, the composition, the light, the awesome DOF, the intervention of the rail and its detail work and your post production colouring ... all are just remarkable.  I''ll stick my neck out and say Ribbon.', '2005-10-05 17:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762339, 240400, 40977, '<td valign="top">An Original - Crisp color and focus.  Simple and Creative.  Well Done</td>', 'An Original - Crisp color and focus.  Simple and Creative.  Well Done', '2005-10-05 17:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762346, 239532, 40977, '<td valign="top">Woodie has been busy starting a new business I see.....  Always creative and technically on.  Nice job.</td>', 'Woodie has been busy starting a new business I see.....  Always creative and technically on.  Nice job.', '2005-10-05 17:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762350, 240197, 40977, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, but the focus seems a bit off.  The colors are eye catching and if they were a bit more crisp would really be an outstanding shot.  Still good and well done.</td>', 'Love the idea, but the focus seems a bit off.  The colors are eye catching and if they were a bit more crisp would really be an outstanding shot.  Still good and well done.', '2005-10-05 17:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762353, 240411, 40977, '<td valign="top">Like the close up of the fill lines instead of the obvious. Simple and Nicely Done --7--</td>', 'Like the close up of the fill lines instead of the obvious. Simple and Nicely Done --7--', '2005-10-05 17:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762359, 240121, 40977, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The colors, image, and focus.  The shadow at the bottom is a bit distracting.  Great job with the shots in the background adding to all the contrasting colors.  Well Done.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The colors, image, and focus.  The shadow at the bottom is a bit distracting.  Great job with the shots in the background adding to all the contrasting colors.  Well Done.', '2005-10-05 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762362, 240539, 42984, '<td valign="top">Very very good.  Simplistic, clean and interesting with the leaves from overhead. Tghe dappled light on the paintwork just balances it nicely.   I know you can''t do anything about the car''s reflection, it''s going to bug some people.  If the image would look better without it (jury''s still out), in a commercial shoot we would have a massive black cloth stretched onto a frame behind the camera amd that would ill the reflection.</td>', 'Very very good.  Simplistic, clean and interesting with the leaves from overhead. Tghe dappled light on the paintwork just balances it nicely.   I know you can''t do anything about the car''s reflection, it''s going to bug some people.  If the image would look better without it (jury''s still out), in a commercial shoot we would have a massive black cloth stretched onto a frame behind the camera amd that would ill the reflection.', '2005-10-05 17:16:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1762371, 237893, 42984, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve worked your light to get the best dramatic effect.  It''s somewhat let down by the composition which results in a bit of a ho-hum image where it is potentially not ho-hum at all.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve worked your light to get the best dramatic effect.  It''s somewhat let down by the composition which results in a bit of a ho-hum image where it is potentially not ho-hum at all.', '2005-10-05 17:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762384, 240582, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good and sharp (yay).  I like the beans glow.  I''m a bit unexcited by the composition although I can''t suggest how to improve it without messing around with it</td>', 'Good and sharp (yay).  I like the beans glow.  I''m a bit unexcited by the composition although I can''t suggest how to improve it without messing around with it', '2005-10-05 17:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762401, 240477, 45223, '<td valign="top">nice concept,good shot.</td>', 'nice concept,good shot.', '2005-10-05 17:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762407, 240175, 42984, '<td valign="top">Sweet.  the colouring and border are great.  That light coffee colour really works, especially where it is reflected in the handle and you held a fine DOF.  The composition is a bit off ,  be interesting if you played around with some thirds options.  I would suggest at least lowering the centre of the spoon to the horizontal thirds line.  I''m goign to score it well, but there is probably another point in there yet.</td>', 'Sweet.  the colouring and border are great.  That light coffee colour really works, especially where it is reflected in the handle and you held a fine DOF.  The composition is a bit off ,  be interesting if you played around with some thirds options.  I would suggest at least lowering the centre of the spoon to the horizontal thirds line.  I''m goign to score it well, but there is probably another point in there yet.', '2005-10-05 17:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762412, 239158, 45223, '<td valign="top">nice to look at.</td>', 'nice to look at.', '2005-10-05 17:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762419, 240293, 45223, '<td valign="top">looks like a publicity campaign.</td>', 'looks like a publicity campaign.', '2005-10-05 17:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762436, 240427, 41098, '<td valign="top">this is the only 10 I gave... the reflection is beautiful and the lighting is so vivid. I really like the crisp feel... great work.</td>', 'this is the only 10 I gave... the reflection is beautiful and the lighting is so vivid. I really like the crisp feel... great work.', '2005-10-05 17:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762440, 238783, 41098, '<td valign="top">when I think coffee shop... I think of the people watching. This photo is so great at capturing what I have in my head and still incorporating her drink :) Her face is so clear and smooth and the focus is great.</td>', 'when I think coffee shop... I think of the people watching. This photo is so great at capturing what I have in my head and still incorporating her drink :) Her face is so clear and smooth and the focus is great.', '2005-10-05 17:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762442, 240397, 41098, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed the unique creativity you added to this challenge... great work and good starburst on the sun</td>', 'I really enjoyed the unique creativity you added to this challenge... great work and good starburst on the sun', '2005-10-05 17:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762448, 240373, 45223, '<td valign="top">very well composed shot</td>', 'very well composed shot', '2005-10-05 17:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762451, 239938, 41098, '<td valign="top">I love to think you put all this on a plate and ontop a bed of popouri and made this... .such a beautiful picture with an earthy feel. Great work on the colors and the props.</td>', 'I love to think you put all this on a plate and ontop a bed of popouri and made this... .such a beautiful picture with an earthy feel. Great work on the colors and the props.', '2005-10-05 17:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762483, 240437, 42392, '<td valign="top">this is agreat picture-i smell blue ribbon do you.</td>', 'this is agreat picture-i smell blue ribbon do you.', '2005-10-05 17:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762515, 240363, 8178, '<td valign="top">Complementary colors? :) I would have liked to see sharper focus, but I like the cropping. Would be nice to see the cup having been used, like a lipstick print or residual coffee in it or something. JMO</td>', 'Complementary colors? :) I would have liked to see sharper focus, but I like the cropping. Would be nice to see the cup having been used, like a lipstick print or residual coffee in it or something. JMO', '2005-10-05 17:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762521, 240563, 8178, '<td valign="top">Good job on the lighting. Not sure I like the subject, a little too plain.</td>', 'Good job on the lighting. Not sure I like the subject, a little too plain.', '2005-10-05 18:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762530, 240401, 45445, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  Like the soft, fuzzy, faded look- exactally how I feel before I''ve had my morning coffee!</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  Like the soft, fuzzy, faded look- exactally how I feel before I''ve had my morning coffee!', '2005-10-05 18:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762542, 240517, 8178, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, nice crisp focus on the top donut. Makes me wanna run out and get one. I am not sure I like the composition, I would have cropped it differently, not sure how though...</td>', 'Great lighting, nice crisp focus on the top donut. Makes me wanna run out and get one. I am not sure I like the composition, I would have cropped it differently, not sure how though...', '2005-10-05 18:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762545, 240348, 45259, '<td valign="top">I love the falling!</td>', 'I love the falling!', '2005-10-05 18:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762550, 239996, 8178, '<td valign="top">I love candid shots! Good job on the B&amp;W. My favorite so far. The lady on the left is slightly OOF, I would try cropping her tighter and place the lady on the right closer to the middle, since she is in sharp focus and has such a great facial expression.</td>', 'I love candid shots! Good job on the B&W. My favorite so far. The lady on the left is slightly OOF, I would try cropping her tighter and place the lady on the right closer to the middle, since she is in sharp focus and has such a great facial expression.', '2005-10-05 18:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762557, 239938, 45259, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this photo</td>', 'I love the colors in this photo', '2005-10-05 18:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762559, 240400, 45259, '<td valign="top">drawing with beans is the best :)</td>', 'drawing with beans is the best :)', '2005-10-05 18:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762562, 240566, 8178, '<td valign="top">Hahaha! You are right on... Well executed.</td>', 'Hahaha! You are right on... Well executed.', '2005-10-05 18:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762563, 240363, 45259, '<td valign="top">The colors remind me of Amelie</td>', 'The colors remind me of Amelie', '2005-10-05 18:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762569, 240113, 45259, '<td valign="top">I really like the detail of the sugar grains</td>', 'I really like the detail of the sugar grains', '2005-10-05 18:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762571, 240437, 8178, '<td valign="top">I like the subject. Dirty nails of a homeless guy getting a refill. Would have been better if the whole thing was in better focus (instead of just the change).</td>', 'I like the subject. Dirty nails of a homeless guy getting a refill. Would have been better if the whole thing was in better focus (instead of just the change).', '2005-10-05 18:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762590, 240348, 45446, '<td valign="top">coffee definatly deserves a sepia tone and this is pulled off quite well. the only thing i would suggest to improve this perhaps would be to change the cropping to incorperate the smidgeon of cut off beans on the left side</td>', 'coffee definatly deserves a sepia tone and this is pulled off quite well. the only thing i would suggest to improve this perhaps would be to change the cropping to incorperate the smidgeon of cut off beans on the left side', '2005-10-05 18:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762592, 238736, 45446, '<td valign="top">i would have loved to see more of his face other wise i dont really consider it a portrait</td>', 'i would have loved to see more of his face other wise i dont really consider it a portrait', '2005-10-05 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762593, 240579, 45446, '<td valign="top">YES this is awesome! perfect mesh of humorous cup with humorous facial expression! NICELY DONE</td>', 'YES this is awesome! perfect mesh of humorous cup with humorous facial expression! NICELY DONE', '2005-10-05 18:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762595, 240141, 45446, '<td valign="top">love the B&amp;W but the exposure is just a little to much</td>', 'love the B&W but the exposure is just a little to much', '2005-10-05 18:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762596, 240259, 43434, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I would find this in a coffee shop.  Nice photo 1.</td>', 'I don''t think I would find this in a coffee shop.  Nice photo 1.', '2005-10-05 18:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762598, 239237, 43434, '<td valign="top">Slightly confused as to back room of what ... But is a great complementary colours shot.</td>', 'Slightly confused as to back room of what ... But is a great complementary colours shot.', '2005-10-05 18:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762599, 237797, 45446, '<td valign="top">cookies and coffee this is truely a scrumptious meal! i dont know how easily it could be accomplished but perhaps a less crinkled cloth would improve this</td>', 'cookies and coffee this is truely a scrumptious meal! i dont know how easily it could be accomplished but perhaps a less crinkled cloth would improve this', '2005-10-05 18:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762603, 240293, 45446, '<td valign="top">great shot for advertising and i love that solid white BG</td>', 'great shot for advertising and i love that solid white BG', '2005-10-05 18:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762606, 240566, 45446, '<td valign="top">simply fantastic in every way</td>', 'simply fantastic in every way', '2005-10-05 18:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
