(1762695, 239949, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a cozy quaint feel to it. The sepia filter really adds to the nostalgia. I want to just sashay over there, sit down and have a great mug of coffee!</td>', 'This has a cozy quaint feel to it. The sepia filter really adds to the nostalgia. I want to just sashay over there, sit down and have a great mug of coffee!', '2005-10-05 19:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
