(1762743, 239747, 37544, '<td valign="top">i am not that crazy about the color of the cup, but the detail and texture of the beans are great.</td>', 'i am not that crazy about the color of the cup, but the detail and texture of the beans are great.', '2005-10-05 20:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
