(1763213, 237485, 40355, '<td valign="top">Looks pixelated, like maybe you blew it up too big?   Otherwise, well done.</td>', 'Looks pixelated, like maybe you blew it up too big?   Otherwise, well done.', '2005-10-05 23:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763215, 240427, 35739, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I think the lady need to shave her arms!  LOL</td>', 'Nice.  I think the lady need to shave her arms!  LOL', '2005-10-05 23:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763217, 239995, 41800, '<td valign="top">You didn''t quite freeze the action but I know bad lighting in most coffee shops etc. Your composition although busy tends to be quite interesting. It''s nice to see some people actually get out of the house to meet a challenge, working with uncontrolable variables is a lot harder than woking at home or a studio. good on you.</td>', 'You didn''t quite freeze the action but I know bad lighting in most coffee shops etc. Your composition although busy tends to be quite interesting. It''s nice to see some people actually get out of the house to meet a challenge, working with uncontrolable variables is a lot harder than woking at home or a studio. good on you.', '2005-10-05 23:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763219, 240397, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is really neat!  Suppose it''s a coffee shop on the beach?  Big points here for a good shot and an original idea!</td>', 'This is really neat!  Suppose it''s a coffee shop on the beach?  Big points here for a good shot and an original idea!', '2005-10-05 23:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763221, 240121, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. I like how you caught the other pictures too. Its a bit dark on the bottom though.</td>', 'Interesting picture. I like how you caught the other pictures too. Its a bit dark on the bottom though.', '2005-10-05 23:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763225, 240197, 35739, '<td valign="top">I must be dumb! What is this? No deduct cause I can not figure this out though.  A little fuzzy, out of focus.</td>', 'I must be dumb! What is this? No deduct cause I can not figure this out though.  A little fuzzy, out of focus.', '2005-10-05 23:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763227, 239226, 41800, '<td valign="top">challenge met</td>', 'challenge met', '2005-10-05 23:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763233, 240133, 35739, '<td valign="top">Focus is a issue  here, Perhaps if you were not as close?</td>', 'Focus is a issue  here, Perhaps if you were not as close?', '2005-10-05 23:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763238, 240601, 35739, '<td valign="top">Thats what you get for not straining the coffee.  Not a real appealing image.</td>', 'Thats what you get for not straining the coffee.  Not a real appealing image.', '2005-10-05 23:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763239, 240508, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Puts a new twist on this instrument. Like all the blue tones.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Puts a new twist on this instrument. Like all the blue tones.', '2005-10-05 23:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763241, 237446, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t see anything I would find in a coffee shop.</td>', 'I don''t see anything I would find in a coffee shop.', '2005-10-05 23:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763244, 240482, 35739, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, wish it was a little more in focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, wish it was a little more in focus.', '2005-10-05 23:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763247, 238915, 45390, '<td valign="top">waaaooo!!!!  como le hiciste para hacer un café tan espumoso... se vé realmente bien! me gustó el ángulo y la composición y muy bien en blanco y negro porque lograste que el café tuviéra una textura realmente atractiva</td>', 'waaaooo!!!!  como le hiciste para hacer un café tan espumoso... se vé realmente bien! me gustó el ángulo y la composición y muy bien en blanco y negro porque lograste que el café tuviéra una textura realmente atractiva', '2005-10-05 23:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763258, 237446, 35739, '<td valign="top">OK???? Whats up here??  I can only stare at this image for so long.  What is the connection?  Perhaps its the view outside a coffee shop?  No deduction for not knowing the connection.  The image is not very clear.  Perhaps B/W?</td>', 'OK???? Whats up here??  I can only stare at this image for so long.  What is the connection?  Perhaps its the view outside a coffee shop?  No deduction for not knowing the connection.  The image is not very clear.  Perhaps B/W?', '2005-10-05 23:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763260, 238935, 45390, '<td valign="top">mmm! this photo made me want some capuccino and made me hungy I like the composition and light</td>', 'mmm! this photo made me want some capuccino and made me hungy I like the composition and light', '2005-10-05 23:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763262, 240197, 39349, '<td valign="top">Creative shot, colorful, but a tad out of focus and I''m sorry but I''m really not sure what I''m looking at. There''s a burnt out spot on the blue subject that is distracting.</td>', 'Creative shot, colorful, but a tad out of focus and I''m sorry but I''m really not sure what I''m looking at. There''s a burnt out spot on the blue subject that is distracting.', '2005-10-05 23:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763268, 239581, 35739, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Good expression on the model.  OK how did you do this?</td>', 'Nice.  Good expression on the model.  OK how did you do this?', '2005-10-05 23:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763270, 238396, 39349, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. I think it would be more powerful if the table post was offset more to the left or right. Good contrast of color, one little hot spot on the left shoe but a creative approach to this challenge.</td>', 'I like this shot. I think it would be more powerful if the table post was offset more to the left or right. Good contrast of color, one little hot spot on the left shoe but a creative approach to this challenge.', '2005-10-05 23:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763273, 239949, 45390, '<td valign="top">very nice place and pic I think b and white works very nice ... the contrast, and bright is equilibrated I like it very much... where,s this lovely corner?<br/></td>', 'very nice place and pic I think b and white works very nice ... the contrast, and bright is equilibrated I like it very much... where,s this lovely corner?', '2005-10-05 23:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763275, 240197, 40355, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite seem to figure out what I''m looking at here....</td>', 'I can''t quite seem to figure out what I''m looking at here....', '2005-10-05 23:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763284, 240595, 45390, '<td valign="top">you should sell this pic to starbuks... I like it very much .....may be the light from the cup is a litlle artificial</td>', 'you should sell this pic to starbuks... I like it very much .....may be the light from the cup is a litlle artificial', '2005-10-05 23:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763286, 240294, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is a classic.  I hope it gets a ribbon.  10 from me</td>', 'This is a classic.  I hope it gets a ribbon.  10 from me', '2005-10-05 23:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763294, 240482, 40355, '<td valign="top">Soft, and you came close to washing out the highlights.</td>', 'Soft, and you came close to washing out the highlights.', '2005-10-05 23:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763303, 240401, 45390, '<td valign="top">i like the idea creative</td>', 'i like the idea creative', '2005-10-05 23:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763305, 240060, 40355, '<td valign="top">very moody and somehow emotive.  I get all sorts of images in my head when I look at this...like where it is and what''s happening in the next room.  Very cool, well done!  10</td>', 'very moody and somehow emotive.  I get all sorts of images in my head when I look at this...like where it is and what''s happening in the next room.  Very cool, well done!  10', '2005-10-05 23:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763311, 239129, 40355, '<td valign="top">really like the use of B&amp;W here, it''s strong.  Very nice tonal range...</td>', 'really like the use of B&W here, it''s strong.  Very nice tonal range...', '2005-10-05 23:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763319, 239741, 40355, '<td valign="top">Too much empty space, it detracts from the shot...</td>', 'Too much empty space, it detracts from the shot...', '2005-10-05 23:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763324, 240120, 40355, '<td valign="top">Neat effect.  Not sure how you achieved it, but it works!  8</td>', 'Neat effect.  Not sure how you achieved it, but it works!  8', '2005-10-05 23:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763327, 238915, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful study in b/w can''t find anything that is wrong here.....just makes me want to brew some bean up! ;)</td>', 'Beautiful study in b/w can''t find anything that is wrong here.....just makes me want to brew some bean up! ;)', '2005-10-05 23:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763330, 240595, 39349, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting in the cup. You know, the more I look at this the more I like it, you''ve really used your imagination on this one, BRAVO! I''m giving it a 10.</td>', 'Interesting lighting in the cup. You know, the more I look at this the more I like it, you''ve really used your imagination on this one, BRAVO! I''m giving it a 10.', '2005-10-05 23:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763331, 240601, 41574, '<td valign="top">What the hell coffee shop do you go to?</td>', 'What the hell coffee shop do you go to?', '2005-10-05 23:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763332, 240367, 39349, '<td valign="top">Or NEVER! Nice shot, good DOF.</td>', 'Or NEVER! Nice shot, good DOF.', '2005-10-05 23:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763334, 239726, 41574, '<td valign="top">...Is that cream?</td>', '...Is that cream?', '2005-10-05 23:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763335, 240474, 40355, '<td valign="top">The shadow in the back is distracting.  Maybe bounce your light next time?</td>', 'The shadow in the back is distracting.  Maybe bounce your light next time?', '2005-10-05 23:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763337, 240063, 40355, '<td valign="top">Well, at least it''s not another shot of coffee beans!  Nicely done.</td>', 'Well, at least it''s not another shot of coffee beans!  Nicely done.', '2005-10-05 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763338, 240259, 41574, '<td valign="top">Uh...did you even try to stick to the topic? Even the photograph, per se, is just OK.</td>', 'Uh...did you even try to stick to the topic? Even the photograph, per se, is just OK.', '2005-10-05 23:46:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1763339, 240545, 39349, '<td valign="top">Hiiiiiiii Peet. I''m Steve and I have an addiction to coffee to, but I''ll be damned if I''m giving it up! hahahaha!<br/> <br/>Okay, great shot, beautiful b/w study.</td>', 'Hiiiiiiii Peet. I''m Steve and I have an addiction to coffee to, but I''ll be damned if I''m giving it up! hahahaha! Okay, great shot, beautiful b/w study.', '2005-10-05 23:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763340, 238142, 41574, '<td valign="top">I little focus might have been nice. Also, I like your idea, but the shot just doesn''t work very well.</td>', 'I little focus might have been nice. Also, I like your idea, but the shot just doesn''t work very well.', '2005-10-05 23:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763344, 240084, 39349, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot, wonderful contrast and detail.</td>', 'Nice macro shot, wonderful contrast and detail.', '2005-10-05 23:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763345, 239532, 40355, '<td valign="top">really nice.  Crisp, well set-up, and of course, it''s got a Woody.</td>', 'really nice.  Crisp, well set-up, and of course, it''s got a Woody.', '2005-10-05 23:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763348, 238962, 39349, '<td valign="top">mmmmmm yummy! Great motion capture, not sure about the bubble in the upper left....seems to take away from the sugar cube and splash down.</td>', 'mmmmmm yummy! Great motion capture, not sure about the bubble in the upper left....seems to take away from the sugar cube and splash down.', '2005-10-05 23:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763351, 239531, 39349, '<td valign="top">Dang, I wish this wasn''t out of focus. I think you have the makings of a nice candid shot here but the blur is just taking a lot away from this shot.</td>', 'Dang, I wish this wasn''t out of focus. I think you have the makings of a nice candid shot here but the blur is just taking a lot away from this shot.', '2005-10-05 23:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763353, 240508, 41574, '<td valign="top">I like that you went for something other than a cup of coffee. Also, it''s a clever use of blue. That said, I think your depth-of-field could have been higher.</td>', 'I like that you went for something other than a cup of coffee. Also, it''s a clever use of blue. That said, I think your depth-of-field could have been higher.', '2005-10-05 23:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763354, 240363, 39349, '<td valign="top">WOW! This was a surprise I didn''t see coming! Wonderful vibrant colors nice job!</td>', 'WOW! This was a surprise I didn''t see coming! Wonderful vibrant colors nice job!', '2005-10-05 23:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763355, 240415, 40355, '<td valign="top">Oh, come on!  Who buys tea at a coffee shop?  ;)   Nice shot, well done!</td>', 'Oh, come on!  Who buys tea at a coffee shop?  ;)   Nice shot, well done!', '2005-10-05 23:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763358, 239747, 41574, '<td valign="top">It''s not very creative, but the clarity is excellent, and it meets the demands of the challenge. Overall, commendable work.</td>', 'It''s not very creative, but the clarity is excellent, and it meets the demands of the challenge. Overall, commendable work.', '2005-10-05 23:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763360, 239995, 41574, '<td valign="top">The motion doesn''t really work.</td>', 'The motion doesn''t really work.', '2005-10-05 23:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763364, 240394, 41574, '<td valign="top">OK, now this is a creative, fun picture. I like it a lot.</td>', 'OK, now this is a creative, fun picture. I like it a lot.', '2005-10-05 23:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763366, 238915, 41574, '<td valign="top">Technically sound, but not very exciting.</td>', 'Technically sound, but not very exciting.', '2005-10-05 23:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763368, 239237, 39349, '<td valign="top">Image is tilted a tad to the left. Still nice contrast going on in the shot.</td>', 'Image is tilted a tad to the left. Still nice contrast going on in the shot.', '2005-10-05 23:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763369, 240439, 41574, '<td valign="top">I think a "half-and-half" (no pun intended) composition might have proved more interesting (i.e., having had each subject take an equal amount of space).</td>', 'I think a "half-and-half" (no pun intended) composition might have proved more interesting (i.e., having had each subject take an equal amount of space).', '2005-10-05 23:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763370, 240280, 39349, '<td valign="top">I really love what you''ve captured in this shot. I wish I had thought of this! Wonderful job. Not much of anything going wrong here.</td>', 'I really love what you''ve captured in this shot. I wish I had thought of this! Wonderful job. Not much of anything going wrong here.', '2005-10-05 23:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763373, 237665, 41574, '<td valign="top">By no means should this shot have been submitted in this challenge. I don''t mean to be harsh, but could you not see that this shot is horribly out of focus? If it was an "artistic intention," I must say, it looks more like an accident, than it does intentional.</td>', 'By no means should this shot have been submitted in this challenge. I don''t mean to be harsh, but could you not see that this shot is horribly out of focus? If it was an "artistic intention," I must say, it looks more like an accident, than it does intentional.', '2005-10-05 23:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763375, 240117, 41574, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2005-10-05 23:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763378, 240363, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, real clean shot, prob. would had done well in the complementary color challenge too.</td>', 'Nice composition, real clean shot, prob. would had done well in the complementary color challenge too.', '2005-10-05 23:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763380, 240175, 39349, '<td valign="top">I almost said, I would have liked this if the background was true white but then I caught the border and thought, It''s mocha tones. I hope this is what you were going for as that is the impression I get when I look at your great entry. Only flaw I can see is maybe some sensor dust in the middle right hand side of the shot.</td>', 'I almost said, I would have liked this if the background was true white but then I caught the border and thought, It''s mocha tones. I hope this is what you were going for as that is the impression I get when I look at your great entry. Only flaw I can see is maybe some sensor dust in the middle right hand side of the shot.', '2005-10-05 23:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763381, 239741, 39349, '<td valign="top">Awesome! Lovin the swirl!</td>', 'Awesome! Lovin the swirl!', '2005-10-05 23:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763382, 240060, 41574, '<td valign="top">I get the "feel" you were going for, but it''s just too dark.</td>', 'I get the "feel" you were going for, but it''s just too dark.', '2005-10-05 23:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763385, 238967, 40355, '<td valign="top">Myself, I think a far tighter crop would have been stronger here.  take off even the corners of the wood platter, so you see most the it''s edge and a bit of table still, but the focus is up close on the coffee.</td>', 'Myself, I think a far tighter crop would have been stronger here.  take off even the corners of the wood platter, so you see most the it''s edge and a bit of table still, but the focus is up close on the coffee.', '2005-10-05 23:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763387, 240502, 41574, '<td valign="top">This is a brilliant shot. I love seeing intelligent use of contrast in black-and-white photographs, and you''ve certainly given me something about which to be pleased. Great work!</td>', 'This is a brilliant shot. I love seeing intelligent use of contrast in black-and-white photographs, and you''ve certainly given me something about which to be pleased. Great work!', '2005-10-05 23:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763389, 240113, 41574, '<td valign="top">I''m in the mood for some sugar...</td>', 'I''m in the mood for some sugar...', '2005-10-05 23:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763392, 240116, 41574, '<td valign="top">Great incorporation of "life" and "routine" into your image.</td>', 'Great incorporation of "life" and "routine" into your image.', '2005-10-05 23:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763393, 239726, 39349, '<td valign="top">Oh wow! I''m really diggin this shot. Cream swirls are interesting and create wonderful  movement. 10 from me.</td>', 'Oh wow! I''m really diggin this shot. Cream swirls are interesting and create wonderful  movement. 10 from me.', '2005-10-06 00:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763394, 237467, 41574, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why you cut out so much of the coffee. I assume you were trying to be "spontaneous," but I feel you''ve ended up being unsuccessfully "artsy."</td>', 'I''m not sure why you cut out so much of the coffee. I assume you were trying to be "spontaneous," but I feel you''ve ended up being unsuccessfully "artsy."', '2005-10-06 00:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763397, 240400, 37875, '<td valign="top">(don''t know if this posted the last time)<br/>love the photo design.  the white background and lighting, however, bleach out your beans, and that detracts from the photo''s impact for me.</td>', '(don''t know if this posted the last time)love the photo design.  the white background and lighting, however, bleach out your beans, and that detracts from the photo''s impact for me.', '2005-10-06 00:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763399, 240397, 37544, '<td valign="top">WONDERFUL! WONDERFUL!!!</td>', 'WONDERFUL! WONDERFUL!!!', '2005-10-06 00:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763405, 240550, 41574, '<td valign="top">Coffee beans in a cup? I LIKE it!</td>', 'Coffee beans in a cup? I LIKE it!', '2005-10-06 00:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763406, 239996, 37875, '<td valign="top">i think the waitress''s smile does it for me!  i love this photo.  nice b&amp;w, too.</td>', 'i think the waitress''s smile does it for me!  i love this photo.  nice b&w, too.', '2005-10-06 00:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763408, 237467, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the feel of this composition.  like the b&amp;w tones, too.  nicely done!</td>', 'like the feel of this composition.  like the b&w tones, too.  nicely done!', '2005-10-06 00:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763410, 237451, 41574, '<td valign="top">Though it has too much of a "snapshot" quality, its "real, street" quality manages to save it...a bit.</td>', 'Though it has too much of a "snapshot" quality, its "real, street" quality manages to save it...a bit.', '2005-10-06 00:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763412, 240120, 37875, '<td valign="top">for some reason, the graininess of this photo really appeals to me.  it''s a photo i wish i could be inside of--great ambiance!</td>', 'for some reason, the graininess of this photo really appeals to me.  it''s a photo i wish i could be inside of--great ambiance!', '2005-10-06 00:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763416, 240117, 37875, '<td valign="top">love this photo.  love the concept, the model with the straw, her lying sideways, the star effects in the lights.  nicely done!</td>', 'love this photo.  love the concept, the model with the straw, her lying sideways, the star effects in the lights.  nicely done!', '2005-10-06 00:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763417, 239531, 41574, '<td valign="top">Didn''t this seem out-of-focus to you? Really, just a bad photo.</td>', 'Didn''t this seem out-of-focus to you? Really, just a bad photo.', '2005-10-06 00:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763419, 240216, 37875, '<td valign="top">love the amber color and condensation.  nice composition of the carafe.</td>', 'love the amber color and condensation.  nice composition of the carafe.', '2005-10-06 00:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763420, 240348, 40355, '<td valign="top">really like this one.  The blow-out area is a tad distracting, but okay.  Overall, the sense of motion rocks.  Well done.</td>', 'really like this one.  The blow-out area is a tad distracting, but okay.  Overall, the sense of motion rocks.  Well done.', '2005-10-06 00:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763422, 239819, 41574, '<td valign="top">It''s a great picture of a baseball, but it totally disregards the demand of the challenge ("coffee shop"). I''m being generous only because it really is an excellent photograph.</td>', 'It''s a great picture of a baseball, but it totally disregards the demand of the challenge ("coffee shop"). I''m being generous only because it really is an excellent photograph.', '2005-10-06 00:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763423, 238736, 37875, '<td valign="top">the thing i really like about this is the feet.  keeping the feet in the shot really conveys that absorption in thought...almost like watching someone playing with their hair while reading.  like the composition and the slight desaturation too.</td>', 'the thing i really like about this is the feet.  keeping the feet in the shot really conveys that absorption in thought...almost like watching someone playing with their hair while reading.  like the composition and the slight desaturation too.', '2005-10-06 00:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763425, 240536, 41574, '<td valign="top">Please, no more Starbucks. A tip for the future: if you think many other people will have the same idea as you, do something else.</td>', 'Please, no more Starbucks. A tip for the future: if you think many other people will have the same idea as you, do something else.', '2005-10-06 00:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763429, 240427, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  10  Only suggestion, a black border might look nice.</td>', 'Very cool.  10  Only suggestion, a black border might look nice.', '2005-10-06 00:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763430, 239126, 37875, '<td valign="top">so simple, such great curves and lines and color contrasts.  the cup and background feel a bit blurred, making it hard for my eye to focus on the photo for very long, though.</td>', 'so simple, such great curves and lines and color contrasts.  the cup and background feel a bit blurred, making it hard for my eye to focus on the photo for very long, though.', '2005-10-06 00:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763435, 240082, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the choice of hue, like the composition, really like the hand placement and level of coffee.  nicely done.  i''ve been in that same study situation many times, myself!</td>', 'like the choice of hue, like the composition, really like the hand placement and level of coffee.  nicely done.  i''ve been in that same study situation many times, myself!', '2005-10-06 00:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
