(1763478, 240175, 37875, '<td valign="top">such a nice composition!  the warmth of the background color is getting picked up in the spoon, though, and the spoon''s kind of melting into the background.  for me, that detracts from the impact of the picture.  and this simple, clean image deserves to just pop!  : )</td>', 'such a nice composition!  the warmth of the background color is getting picked up in the spoon, though, and the spoon''s kind of melting into the background.  for me, that detracts from the impact of the picture.  and this simple, clean image deserves to just pop!  : )', '2005-10-06 00:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763480, 240411, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the hue, like the composition!  i find the reflection in the carafe to be a bit distracting...</td>', 'like the hue, like the composition!  i find the reflection in the carafe to be a bit distracting...', '2005-10-06 00:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763484, 240595, 37875, '<td valign="top">love this composition!  it appears that the contrast is turning your beans into something unidentifyable, and the inside of the cup ends up looking overly bright.  which is a shame, because the image could really pop imo...</td>', 'love this composition!  it appears that the contrast is turning your beans into something unidentifyable, and the inside of the cup ends up looking overly bright.  which is a shame, because the image could really pop imo...', '2005-10-06 00:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763486, 240473, 37875, '<td valign="top">i love the fact that he''s got his shoes off.  it''s an unexpected element that really endears this photo to me.</td>', 'i love the fact that he''s got his shoes off.  it''s an unexpected element that really endears this photo to me.', '2005-10-06 00:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763487, 240141, 37875, '<td valign="top">the composition of this shot is great!  the overexposure/contrast makes the model''s face appear blotchy, though, even after playing with monitor settings.</td>', 'the composition of this shot is great!  the overexposure/contrast makes the model''s face appear blotchy, though, even after playing with monitor settings.', '2005-10-06 00:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763490, 240439, 37875, '<td valign="top">i like the pairing of the sugar cubes and the squares in the background.  i also like the reversal of colors in the sugar cup and coffee cup.  there''s something about the composition, though, that feels a hair off.  wish i could articulate that better...maybe it''s the proportion of cups displayed in the shot?</td>', 'i like the pairing of the sugar cubes and the squares in the background.  i also like the reversal of colors in the sugar cup and coffee cup.  there''s something about the composition, though, that feels a hair off.  wish i could articulate that better...maybe it''s the proportion of cups displayed in the shot?', '2005-10-06 00:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763493, 240427, 33672, '<td valign="top">This looks like a Scalvert.  (One of the best compliments I can give)</td>', 'This looks like a Scalvert.  (One of the best compliments I can give)', '2005-10-06 00:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763496, 240194, 37875, '<td valign="top">the fabric background feels distracting to me--i think it''s where the white shows through the blue.  the plate, cookies, and cup are lovely in their arrangement, and i like the swatch of wood table exposed, too.</td>', 'the fabric background feels distracting to me--i think it''s where the white shows through the blue.  the plate, cookies, and cup are lovely in their arrangement, and i like the swatch of wood table exposed, too.', '2005-10-06 00:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763500, 240545, 37875, '<td valign="top">hiiii, peet!  : )<br/>this is an interesting composition, with the spill and the lay of the hand.  that hand really relays the addict theme to me, for some reason.  very unusual hand positioning, and i like it.</td>', 'hiiii, peet!  : )this is an interesting composition, with the spill and the lay of the hand.  that hand really relays the addict theme to me, for some reason.  very unusual hand positioning, and i like it.', '2005-10-06 00:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763506, 237893, 37875, '<td valign="top">love the glow to the cup.  nice rich color tones.</td>', 'love the glow to the cup.  nice rich color tones.', '2005-10-06 00:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763507, 238783, 37875, '<td valign="top">this feels like something i''d see on a saturday morning walking along the beach boardwalk, by the folks having their breakfasts and gazing at the ocean.  nicely composed.  like the b&amp;w tones.</td>', 'this feels like something i''d see on a saturday morning walking along the beach boardwalk, by the folks having their breakfasts and gazing at the ocean.  nicely composed.  like the b&w tones.', '2005-10-06 00:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763511, 238915, 37875, '<td valign="top">the composition of this photo is really appealing!  the beans appear a bit overlit or bleached out, which detract from the impact of this photo for me.  i''d love to see this with richer tones and less light bouncing off the beans.  perhaps even a color shot to show off those lovely browns in the beans and creme.</td>', 'the composition of this photo is really appealing!  the beans appear a bit overlit or bleached out, which detract from the impact of this photo for me.  i''d love to see this with richer tones and less light bouncing off the beans.  perhaps even a color shot to show off those lovely browns in the beans and creme.', '2005-10-06 00:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763514, 240509, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the angle of the shot, like the action in the shot, like the composition!  the lighting on the table (reflected in the plates) is a bit distracting at their current levels, though.</td>', 'like the angle of the shot, like the action in the shot, like the composition!  the lighting on the table (reflected in the plates) is a bit distracting at their current levels, though.', '2005-10-06 00:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763517, 240526, 37875, '<td valign="top">mmmm....caramel....<br/>made me drool.  nice composition!</td>', 'mmmm....caramel....made me drool.  nice composition!', '2005-10-06 00:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763519, 240419, 37875, '<td valign="top">the more i look at this photo, the more i like it.  i like the range of focus and composition, and i really like those warm colors in the background contrasted against the green and white.</td>', 'the more i look at this photo, the more i like it.  i like the range of focus and composition, and i really like those warm colors in the background contrasted against the green and white.', '2005-10-06 00:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763522, 239949, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice composition, very simple, with nice warm cast.  i feel like i want to see something else going on in the picture, though...something to add energy and interest.</td>', 'nice composition, very simple, with nice warm cast.  i feel like i want to see something else going on in the picture, though...something to add energy and interest.', '2005-10-06 00:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763525, 240458, 37875, '<td valign="top">i really am growing to love this picture!  love the colors, love the lighting, love the beatnick coffeehouse feel, love the ciggy, love your model!  wish i could read the title of that book, though.  this may have to end up as a favorite!  sheesh!  <br/>: )</td>', 'i really am growing to love this picture!  love the colors, love the lighting, love the beatnick coffeehouse feel, love the ciggy, love your model!  wish i could read the title of that book, though.  this may have to end up as a favorite!  sheesh!  : )', '2005-10-06 00:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763530, 239622, 37875, '<td valign="top">all the asian signs contrasting with the java city sign make for an interesting composition.  like the colors as well.</td>', 'all the asian signs contrasting with the java city sign make for an interesting composition.  like the colors as well.', '2005-10-06 00:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763531, 240502, 37875, '<td valign="top">i love this concept! every time i look at this photo, though, i want to reverse that rear left cup with the front left cup, so that the shorter one appears in front...guess it''s my OCD peeking through!  : )</td>', 'i love this concept! every time i look at this photo, though, i want to reverse that rear left cup with the front left cup, so that the shorter one appears in front...guess it''s my OCD peeking through!  : )', '2005-10-06 00:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763537, 239747, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the cascade of beans from the cup.  the picture has an overall feeling of being a bit overexposed, though, which washes out that nice rich color of the beans and the cup.  i''d be interested in seeing richer colors.</td>', 'like the cascade of beans from the cup.  the picture has an overall feeling of being a bit overexposed, though, which washes out that nice rich color of the beans and the cup.  i''d be interested in seeing richer colors.', '2005-10-06 00:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763539, 238473, 37875, '<td valign="top">you know, i read "the good stuff", i look at the contents of the glass, and I think "guinness!"  shows where my mind is at!  : )<br/>The peppers in the background are an interesting choice...they add nice color.</td>', 'you know, i read "the good stuff", i look at the contents of the glass, and I think "guinness!"  shows where my mind is at!  : )The peppers in the background are an interesting choice...they add nice color.', '2005-10-06 00:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763545, 240415, 37875, '<td valign="top">such a lovely composition, with rich earthy pieces.  i feel that the whiteness of the background actually detracts from the picture, because it weakens the feel of the pottery and ironware.  i would be interested in seeing the background in a different color, to add more visual weight and add to the earthiness of the piece.</td>', 'such a lovely composition, with rich earthy pieces.  i feel that the whiteness of the background actually detracts from the picture, because it weakens the feel of the pottery and ironware.  i would be interested in seeing the background in a different color, to add more visual weight and add to the earthiness of the piece.', '2005-10-06 00:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763550, 240509, 13688, '<td valign="top">i really like the angles created by the body positions and how the outstreched arm and leg play off each other.  i''m not sure about the 3rd person as it takes away from the symbiosis of the twosome...or maybe i just wanted to use the word symbiosis.  i guess you sometimes have to just deal with the distractions if the right moment presents itself in your focal point.  the table items do feel a wee bit oversharpened.</td>', 'i really like the angles created by the body positions and how the outstreched arm and leg play off each other.  i''m not sure about the 3rd person as it takes away from the symbiosis of the twosome...or maybe i just wanted to use the word symbiosis.  i guess you sometimes have to just deal with the distractions if the right moment presents itself in your focal point.  the table items do feel a wee bit oversharpened.', '2005-10-06 00:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763551, 238218, 37875, '<td valign="top">such pretty warm tones, and interesting use of reflections.  i would be interested in seeing what the inclusion of people and activity could add to this composition.<br/>...REALLY clean counters!  : )</td>', 'such pretty warm tones, and interesting use of reflections.  i would be interested in seeing what the inclusion of people and activity could add to this composition....REALLY clean counters!  : )', '2005-10-06 00:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763556, 238114, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice interior shot, and nice b&amp;w tones.  i would be interested in seeing what the addition of customers or activity would bring to the visual interest of this composition.</td>', 'nice interior shot, and nice b&w tones.  i would be interested in seeing what the addition of customers or activity would bring to the visual interest of this composition.', '2005-10-06 00:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763561, 237485, 37875, '<td valign="top">i have to tell you, i LOVE this picture.  i love the composition, i love the interior environment, i love the energy and activity.  there is a big pixilation effect going on with the picture, though...where i can see the pixils in the forward face, the wittenberg sign, and throughout.  and the pixilization really detracts from the power of this image.  which sucks for me, because this would have been my 10 had it been a clear shot, i love it so much!  dang!</td>', 'i have to tell you, i LOVE this picture.  i love the composition, i love the interior environment, i love the energy and activity.  there is a big pixilation effect going on with the picture, though...where i can see the pixils in the forward face, the wittenberg sign, and throughout.  and the pixilization really detracts from the power of this image.  which sucks for me, because this would have been my 10 had it been a clear shot, i love it so much!  dang!', '2005-10-06 00:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763562, 240292, 37875, '<td valign="top">i like this picture, with the focus and colors and composition.  very nice!</td>', 'i like this picture, with the focus and colors and composition.  very nice!', '2005-10-06 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763564, 240063, 37875, '<td valign="top">the only fork in this challenge!  congrats!  nice image, interesting angle for composition.  it almost feels like it''s a bit overexposed, but i''m a gal that likes rich tones and some contrast...<br/>like the shot!</td>', 'the only fork in this challenge!  congrats!  nice image, interesting angle for composition.  it almost feels like it''s a bit overexposed, but i''m a gal that likes rich tones and some contrast...like the shot!', '2005-10-06 01:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763565, 239485, 13688, '<td valign="top">odd that you chose to turn this on it''s side.  i find the reflection itself extremely interesting and might have chosen to focus more on that as more of an abstract composition.  the fact that you have decided to go a different angle and show more of the outside of the cup, i do like the fact that there is another item (even if it is a partial piece) to help the eye move around the pic and make the shot a bit more dynamic</td>', 'odd that you chose to turn this on it''s side.  i find the reflection itself extremely interesting and might have chosen to focus more on that as more of an abstract composition.  the fact that you have decided to go a different angle and show more of the outside of the cup, i do like the fact that there is another item (even if it is a partial piece) to help the eye move around the pic and make the shot a bit more dynamic', '2005-10-06 01:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763566, 240603, 37875, '<td valign="top">party like a rock star.  drink coffee to get you going the next day!  : )<br/>i like this composition!  very interesting visually.  fun, too!</td>', 'party like a rock star.  drink coffee to get you going the next day!  : )i like this composition!  very interesting visually.  fun, too!', '2005-10-06 01:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763572, 239578, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the dirty coffee setting!  the white background feels a bit too white to me, though.  i would be interested in seeing the shadows played up a bit more to give some additional contrast and visual interest.</td>', 'like the dirty coffee setting!  the white background feels a bit too white to me, though.  i would be interested in seeing the shadows played up a bit more to give some additional contrast and visual interest.', '2005-10-06 01:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
