(1763607, 240394, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is fun and cute and all, but not at all something you''d see in a coffee shop (realistically speaking, but then. hmmmmm who knows what happens after hours).  No, seriously.  This is way too busy.  Your eye doesn''t have a place to rest. I say take away some of the props and try a simpler version.  The clarity is there. The originality is definitely there.</td>', 'This is fun and cute and all, but not at all something you''d see in a coffee shop (realistically speaking, but then. hmmmmm who knows what happens after hours).  No, seriously.  This is way too busy.  Your eye doesn''t have a place to rest. I say take away some of the props and try a simpler version.  The clarity is there. The originality is definitely there.', '2005-10-06 01:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763610, 240401, 37875, '<td valign="top">fun angle for the shot.  like how the cup handles frame the logo on the water kettle.</td>', 'fun angle for the shot.  like how the cup handles frame the logo on the water kettle.', '2005-10-06 01:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763615, 238396, 15711, '<td valign="top">This suits the challenge and isn''t a pot of coffee or a mug, but overall, it isn''t that interesting.  I think part of the problem was the challenge category wasn''t either.  The color of the floor with the blue of the metal poles is good.  The glare on the man''s right show is a tad distracting.  Also, the pole being dead in the center kind of gives it that bulls eye effect. Maybe shot from a different perspective???</td>', 'This suits the challenge and isn''t a pot of coffee or a mug, but overall, it isn''t that interesting.  I think part of the problem was the challenge category wasn''t either.  The color of the floor with the blue of the metal poles is good.  The glare on the man''s right show is a tad distracting.  Also, the pole being dead in the center kind of gives it that bulls eye effect. Maybe shot from a different perspective???', '2005-10-06 01:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763616, 240348, 37875, '<td valign="top">the cascading beans are a nice touch to the composition.  the photo appears to be a bit overexposed with the white on the left side, and that causes your jar to disappear on that side.  the light reflections are quite pretty.</td>', 'the cascading beans are a nice touch to the composition.  the photo appears to be a bit overexposed with the white on the left side, and that causes your jar to disappear on that side.  the light reflections are quite pretty.', '2005-10-06 01:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763618, 240292, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a very snap shot feel to me.  Not very artful or creative.  Sure, you''d see it in a coffee shop, but that''s kind of where it stops for me.</td>', 'This has a very snap shot feel to me.  Not very artful or creative.  Sure, you''d see it in a coffee shop, but that''s kind of where it stops for me.', '2005-10-06 01:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763623, 239732, 37875, '<td valign="top">interesting composition for this photo.  the leather strap running through the coffee is a bit distracting in the composition for me.  maybe it''s because it''s the same color as the coffee, so my eye keeps thinking it''s an odd ribbon of coffee?  i really like the use of the map and canvas bag in the picture, and like the copper accent pieces in the background.  the picture has a nice rich tone to it.</td>', 'interesting composition for this photo.  the leather strap running through the coffee is a bit distracting in the composition for me.  maybe it''s because it''s the same color as the coffee, so my eye keeps thinking it''s an odd ribbon of coffee?  i really like the use of the map and canvas bag in the picture, and like the copper accent pieces in the background.  the picture has a nice rich tone to it.', '2005-10-06 01:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763627, 240280, 37875, '<td valign="top">that''s the vortex i get sucked into every morning!  : )<br/>beautiful picture.  simple, elegantly composed.  rich colors.  like the angle of the handle.  quite nice.</td>', 'that''s the vortex i get sucked into every morning!  : )beautiful picture.  simple, elegantly composed.  rich colors.  like the angle of the handle.  quite nice.', '2005-10-06 01:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763628, 240436, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is more an atrium with somebody looking like Snow White than a coffee shop to me.  The idea is cute, but a bit too contrived for my taste. Visually, it''s not that interesting.  The focus is ok and the stop action is fine.  Just sort of uninteresting. I''d like to see the figure sitting at a single bistro table maybe with fishnets and high heels, or something eye catching. Maybe a big hat and sunglasses with a cup of coffee as if she''s waiting for somebody.  Just a thought.</td>', 'This is more an atrium with somebody looking like Snow White than a coffee shop to me.  The idea is cute, but a bit too contrived for my taste. Visually, it''s not that interesting.  The focus is ok and the stop action is fine.  Just sort of uninteresting. I''d like to see the figure sitting at a single bistro table maybe with fishnets and high heels, or something eye catching. Maybe a big hat and sunglasses with a cup of coffee as if she''s waiting for somebody.  Just a thought.', '2005-10-06 01:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763630, 240224, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this could be more artfully done if there were more negative space and possibly higher contrast in black and white.</td>', 'I think this could be more artfully done if there were more negative space and possibly higher contrast in black and white.', '2005-10-06 01:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763631, 239129, 15711, '<td valign="top">This just looks kind of like a dirty kitchen to me.  I think the composition isn''t very artful.  Possibly have less props.</td>', 'This just looks kind of like a dirty kitchen to me.  I think the composition isn''t very artful.  Possibly have less props.', '2005-10-06 01:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
