(1763633, 240113, 15711, '<td valign="top">This isn''t that bad of a photo really, but just not very interesting.  Granted, neither is the challenge, but Hmmmm - this just kind of leaves me a bit blah.  The detail is good but sugar in a mug of capuccino just isn''t much for eye candy in my book.</td>', 'This isn''t that bad of a photo really, but just not very interesting.  Granted, neither is the challenge, but Hmmmm - this just kind of leaves me a bit blah.  The detail is good but sugar in a mug of capuccino just isn''t much for eye candy in my book.', '2005-10-06 01:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763634, 240511, 37875, '<td valign="top">i keep looking at this photo, and can''t quite apply it for the theme.  it''s such a neat picture, but perhaps more appropriate for a different challenge?</td>', 'i keep looking at this photo, and can''t quite apply it for the theme.  it''s such a neat picture, but perhaps more appropriate for a different challenge?', '2005-10-06 01:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763636, 238935, 15711, '<td valign="top">I would find this much more interesting if shot from the level of the table and the diner was behind you with empty chairs, or people eating.  AS it is, it just looks like it was shot over grandma''s plate in the kitchen.  I''d like the plate to just be solid white as the floral desigh is a tad distracting. The focus is good. The composition really isn''t that bad, but those aerial type shots just sort of leave me uninterested.</td>', 'I would find this much more interesting if shot from the level of the table and the diner was behind you with empty chairs, or people eating.  AS it is, it just looks like it was shot over grandma''s plate in the kitchen.  I''d like the plate to just be solid white as the floral desigh is a tad distracting. The focus is good. The composition really isn''t that bad, but those aerial type shots just sort of leave me uninterested.', '2005-10-06 01:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1763638, 240572, 15711, '<td valign="top">Not interesting at all. Kind of like dead roaches in a heap (sorry).  An artfully created pyramid (sort of like when you stack up charcoal briquettes to barbeque) on a solid white surface with maybe a spoon and lots of negative space would make the beans more interesting.</td>', 'Not interesting at all. Kind of like dead roaches in a heap (sorry).  An artfully created pyramid (sort of like when you stack up charcoal briquettes to barbeque) on a solid white surface with maybe a spoon and lots of negative space would make the beans more interesting.', '2005-10-06 01:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
