(1763643, 240413, 37875, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and composition of this photo.  the thing that doesn''t work for me is the way the color works.  this may be intentional, but the colors are blotchy throughout, with the blue based tones appearing as a blue/green blotchy camoflage, and the red based tones appearing as a purple/red blotchy camoflage.  coupled with the graininess of the image, i find it detracting from the photo.</td>', 'I like the subject and composition of this photo.  the thing that doesn''t work for me is the way the color works.  this may be intentional, but the colors are blotchy throughout, with the blue based tones appearing as a blue/green blotchy camoflage, and the red based tones appearing as a purple/red blotchy camoflage.  coupled with the graininess of the image, i find it detracting from the photo.', '2005-10-06 01:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
