(1763806, 240427, 33826, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  I like it.  Look forward to hearing about the set up for this one.  I imagine countless shots while holding a photo in one hand and a camera in the other trying to line it up, just so :)  You got it "just so".  Great photo,</td>', 'Clever idea.  I like it.  Look forward to hearing about the set up for this one.  I imagine countless shots while holding a photo in one hand and a camera in the other trying to line it up, just so :)  You got it "just so".  Great photo,', '2005-10-06 02:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
