(1764145, 238746, 36001, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this validated before I mark it properly</td>', 'I would like to see this validated before I mark it properly', '2005-10-06 07:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764147, 238144, 35602, '<td valign="top">This was a very good composition.  The only problem is that the image isn''t vibrant enough.  8</td>', 'This was a very good composition.  The only problem is that the image isn''t vibrant enough.  8', '2005-10-06 07:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764148, 239564, 26633, '<td valign="top">This one was so nearly a contender in my mind. The composition is great, I love the size and positioning of the cup or bowl. The arrangement of the berries and the cream really work well, down to the spilt cream around the base. But, (and there''s always a but isn''t there?) I feel that the lighting is a little too flat, it doesn''t lift the bowl and the cream away from the background quite enough, perhaps the background needs to be a little whiter and we need to see a little more shadow? I''m not saying I could do it of course :) It''s still a 7 anyway.</td>', 'This one was so nearly a contender in my mind. The composition is great, I love the size and positioning of the cup or bowl. The arrangement of the berries and the cream really work well, down to the spilt cream around the base. But, (and there''s always a but isn''t there?) I feel that the lighting is a little too flat, it doesn''t lift the bowl and the cream away from the background quite enough, perhaps the background needs to be a little whiter and we need to see a little more shadow? I''m not saying I could do it of course :) It''s still a 7 anyway.', '2005-10-06 07:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764152, 240508, 40819, '<td valign="top">You are kidding</td>', 'You are kidding', '2005-10-06 07:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764153, 237446, 40819, '<td valign="top">nothing to do with challenge 1</td>', 'nothing to do with challenge 1', '2005-10-06 07:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764154, 240171, 40819, '<td valign="top"><br/>too small</td>', 'too small', '2005-10-06 07:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764155, 237697, 40819, '<td valign="top">another non challenge picture</td>', 'another non challenge picture', '2005-10-06 07:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764157, 239173, 40819, '<td valign="top">too small</td>', 'too small', '2005-10-06 07:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764163, 240082, 44963, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning image in my opinion.  The clarity of the colours, the depth of focus and the story that it tells.  I could taste the coffee and totally relate to the experience.  Looking at the tones of the wood, the skin and the book.  All complementary.  Magic.  Thanks for taking the effort.</td>', 'This is a stunning image in my opinion.  The clarity of the colours, the depth of focus and the story that it tells.  I could taste the coffee and totally relate to the experience.  Looking at the tones of the wood, the skin and the book.  All complementary.  Magic.  Thanks for taking the effort.', '2005-10-06 07:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764171, 240427, 44963, '<td valign="top">The contradiction, the possible stories emerging from the image and the clarity of the photo - all attracted, and held my attention for a lot longer than most other images in the challenge.</td>', 'The contradiction, the possible stories emerging from the image and the clarity of the photo - all attracted, and held my attention for a lot longer than most other images in the challenge.', '2005-10-06 07:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764179, 240509, 26633, '<td valign="top">Excellent viewpoint. The lighting and composition are superb and the desaturation works, probably takes out a lot of horrible colours ;)<br/>The moving person adds some mystery and the other chairs just edging into the frame help establish context. Not being able to see any of the faces means that we can make up any story we like for what''s happening here. Really nice work. 9<br/>10 on my second pass. Could be a favourite.</td>', 'Excellent viewpoint. The lighting and composition are superb and the desaturation works, probably takes out a lot of horrible colours ;)The moving person adds some mystery and the other chairs just edging into the frame help establish context. Not being able to see any of the faces means that we can make up any story we like for what''s happening here. Really nice work. 910 on my second pass. Could be a favourite.', '2005-10-06 07:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764180, 240117, 26633, '<td valign="top">Weird! I''ve had so much coffee this morning this one is making my head spin...<br/>It''s not just weird, it''s also very effective. The detail is all interesting, the colours, composition and even the framing add something. 9<br/>Bumping up to 10 on second pass, after my next pint of coffee ;)</td>', 'Weird! I''ve had so much coffee this morning this one is making my head spin...It''s not just weird, it''s also very effective. The detail is all interesting, the colours, composition and even the framing add something. 9Bumping up to 10 on second pass, after my next pint of coffee ;)', '2005-10-06 07:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764182, 239484, 26633, '<td valign="top">Light, tones, composition, content all great. No other comment than, 9 ;)</td>', 'Light, tones, composition, content all great. No other comment than, 9 ;)', '2005-10-06 08:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764184, 239741, 26633, '<td valign="top">Very simple but very effective. The composition is good, the colours work and that little swirl is a brilliant finishing touch. 8<br/>Bumping up to 9 on second pass ;)</td>', 'Very simple but very effective. The composition is good, the colours work and that little swirl is a brilliant finishing touch. 8Bumping up to 9 on second pass ;)', '2005-10-06 08:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
