(1764366, 239996, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the natural sense of this. I love the waitress leaning into the customer with the smile, with that easy going sense that you get in a good diner/coffee shop. The sepia is great.  The busy aspect is conveyed like everybody is bustling around, working and enjoying their drink.  Good job. Upon 2nd review, I''m upping the score.</td>', 'I love the natural sense of this. I love the waitress leaning into the customer with the smile, with that easy going sense that you get in a good diner/coffee shop. The sepia is great.  The busy aspect is conveyed like everybody is bustling around, working and enjoying their drink.  Good job. Upon 2nd review, I''m upping the score.', '2005-10-06 10:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
