(1764558, 238696, 30881, '<td valign="top">Good layout and the circles work very well together, unfortunately for me it seems too blurry and dull/drab. Theres nothing to create an interest for the viewer. You want people to stop and actually seriously look at your work. Don''t get discouraged you show great potential in layout, which many more experienced photographers still struggle with. Good luck</td>', 'Good layout and the circles work very well together, unfortunately for me it seems too blurry and dull/drab. Theres nothing to create an interest for the viewer. You want people to stop and actually seriously look at your work. Don''t get discouraged you show great potential in layout, which many more experienced photographers still struggle with. Good luck', '2005-10-06 11:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
