(1764751, 237797, 32644, '<td valign="top">I like this idea with just a few changes. A plate theat is a different color than the cookies. A smooth background and a plain coffee cup. I would have liked to see this pop with color.</td>', 'I like this idea with just a few changes. A plate theat is a different color than the cookies. A smooth background and a plain coffee cup. I would have liked to see this pop with color.', '2005-10-06 13:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
