(1764840, 238671, 32644, '<td valign="top">The pattern in the coffee is very cool. I find the background kind of distracting. Maybe cropping in would have helped.</td>', 'The pattern in the coffee is very cool. I find the background kind of distracting. Maybe cropping in would have helped.', '2005-10-06 14:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
