(1764879, 240419, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I know EXACTLY what the focus of this picture is. Neat blur in background, leaves me with a sense that he is focusing on caffine too!</td>', 'Interesting, I know EXACTLY what the focus of this picture is. Neat blur in background, leaves me with a sense that he is focusing on caffine too!', '2005-10-06 14:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
