(1764890, 240221, 42638, '<td valign="top">Ah, yes, I remember these well when I was working downtown. Only thing that saved my fingertips! Nice reminder. Even the grains of "whatever" seemed to always be there too. The bright spot on the top is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Ah, yes, I remember these well when I was working downtown. Only thing that saved my fingertips! Nice reminder. Even the grains of "whatever" seemed to always be there too. The bright spot on the top is a bit distracting though.', '2005-10-06 14:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764896, 239146, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting accessories. I don''t think I have ever seen these used with regards to coffee but, that may just be my cultural exposure. Like the dark against the bamboo and green. It really stands out and compliments the gold trim.</td>', 'Interesting accessories. I don''t think I have ever seen these used with regards to coffee but, that may just be my cultural exposure. Like the dark against the bamboo and green. It really stands out and compliments the gold trim.', '2005-10-06 14:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764901, 240197, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, The focus is a bit off and I can''t tell what these are. Interesting though.</td>', 'Nice colors, The focus is a bit off and I can''t tell what these are. Interesting though.', '2005-10-06 14:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764910, 240545, 44724, '<td valign="top">this is antique!!!! amaizing!</td>', 'this is antique!!!! amaizing!', '2005-10-06 14:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764911, 237831, 42638, '<td valign="top">Mmm....Looks inviting. Love the reflection in the kettle but the washed area above it is really distracting. The top of the glass is almost completely lost. Nice composition and use of space.</td>', 'Mmm....Looks inviting. Love the reflection in the kettle but the washed area above it is really distracting. The top of the glass is almost completely lost. Nice composition and use of space.', '2005-10-06 14:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
