(1765016, 239531, 43115, '<td valign="top">This photo suffers mightly from lack of focus and a red cast from the lights inside the store.</td>', 'This photo suffers mightly from lack of focus and a red cast from the lights inside the store.', '2005-10-06 15:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765019, 240437, 40819, '<td valign="top">gross</td>', 'gross', '2005-10-06 15:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765031, 238446, 43115, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the de-sat doesn''t add anything to this picture.  There''s no action or emotion in this photo, it doesn''t try to tell any story.  Technically it''s well composed and focused, and the DOF is right on for the desired effect.  There''s just no "wow factor" to me on this photo.</td>', 'In my opinion the de-sat doesn''t add anything to this picture.  There''s no action or emotion in this photo, it doesn''t try to tell any story.  Technically it''s well composed and focused, and the DOF is right on for the desired effect.  There''s just no "wow factor" to me on this photo.', '2005-10-06 15:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765044, 237485, 43115, '<td valign="top">Very interesting scene, just bustling with energy.  I like the composition, and the sepia, usually way over done, actually works for me on this picture.  However, the image suffers technically from JPEG over compression, digital noise, or something else that makes everything look blocky and jagged.  Look at the bottom of the "WITTENB..." sign and the guy''s chin.  Neatimage, and/or Unsharp Mask will usually clean this up to some degree.</td>', 'Very interesting scene, just bustling with energy.  I like the composition, and the sepia, usually way over done, actually works for me on this picture.  However, the image suffers technically from JPEG over compression, digital noise, or something else that makes everything look blocky and jagged.  Look at the bottom of the "WITTENB..." sign and the guy''s chin.  Neatimage, and/or Unsharp Mask will usually clean this up to some degree.', '2005-10-06 15:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765047, 240511, 33068, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this meets the challenge.  The picture is also out of focus.</td>', 'Not sure how this meets the challenge.  The picture is also out of focus.', '2005-10-06 15:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765077, 240473, 40386, '<td valign="top">OM Gosh this so reminds me of a place I used to go every Sunday when I was still living in South Africa.  Brings back good memories.  Good luck.</td>', 'OM Gosh this so reminds me of a place I used to go every Sunday when I was still living in South Africa.  Brings back good memories.  Good luck.', '2005-10-06 15:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765080, 240548, 37875, '<td valign="top">such a welcoming environment!  i like the warm golden colors and quality of light.  i would be interested in seeing this image with a clearer background, or clearer prominence of the front seating arrangement.  right now they both have a kind of dark film over them...</td>', 'such a welcoming environment!  i like the warm golden colors and quality of light.  i would be interested in seeing this image with a clearer background, or clearer prominence of the front seating arrangement.  right now they both have a kind of dark film over them...', '2005-10-06 15:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765084, 237451, 37875, '<td valign="top">what a neat subject and candid shot!  i would be interested in seeing how this would look with the lighting evened out, and then converted to black and white.  i really like the composition, but the colors are getting lost from the lighting/shadow.</td>', 'what a neat subject and candid shot!  i would be interested in seeing how this would look with the lighting evened out, and then converted to black and white.  i really like the composition, but the colors are getting lost from the lighting/shadow.', '2005-10-06 15:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765086, 240508, 31403, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photoI like the color, and love the DOF.  Maybe if we were looking down past a table with a cup of coffee on it this would be easier to link to the challenge.  I loe the technical execution though - it is nice work.  7</td>', 'This is a very nice photoI like the color, and love the DOF.  Maybe if we were looking down past a table with a cup of coffee on it this would be easier to link to the challenge.  I loe the technical execution though - it is nice work.  7', '2005-10-06 15:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765087, 239819, 31403, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo, but I don''t see how this relates to a coffee shop - if I''m missing the point please pm me 2</td>', 'This is a very nice photo, but I don''t see how this relates to a coffee shop - if I''m missing the point please pm me 2', '2005-10-06 15:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765089, 238962, 24013, '<td valign="top">great comp.  the colour of the broth is not what i personally find appealing, but i adore the way you''ve lit and especially framed it!</td>', 'great comp.  the colour of the broth is not what i personally find appealing, but i adore the way you''ve lit and especially framed it!', '2005-10-06 15:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765090, 239902, 37875, '<td valign="top">what a great sign!  because the red is so faded, and the blue sky so saturated, i would be interested in seeing how this photo would look converted to a b&amp;w.  i like the composition of the photo, but the saturated sky seems to overwhelm the picture.</td>', 'what a great sign!  because the red is so faded, and the blue sky so saturated, i would be interested in seeing how this photo would look converted to a b&w.  i like the composition of the photo, but the saturated sky seems to overwhelm the picture.', '2005-10-06 15:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765091, 239531, 33068, '<td valign="top">The picture is out of focus.  Also,  the lighting is not very flattering.  Maybe adjusting the white balance would have helped.</td>', 'The picture is out of focus.  Also,  the lighting is not very flattering.  Maybe adjusting the white balance would have helped.', '2005-10-06 15:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765094, 240609, 39088, '<td valign="top">Was this lighting intentional?  It seems distracting, perhaps a warmer "glowing" effect would have better supported your subject.</td>', 'Was this lighting intentional?  It seems distracting, perhaps a warmer "glowing" effect would have better supported your subject.', '2005-10-06 15:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765097, 240371, 39088, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2005-10-06 15:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765099, 239819, 33068, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this meets the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure how this meets the challenge.', '2005-10-06 15:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765100, 239485, 37875, '<td valign="top">what a clear and crisp reflection in that cup!  i would be interested in seeing this cup photographed from a different angle, and with a different object reflected on the surface (instead of the light bulb)...<br/>i also wonder how this photo would look in b&amp;w, with its rich variations in grays.</td>', 'what a clear and crisp reflection in that cup!  i would be interested in seeing this cup photographed from a different angle, and with a different object reflected on the surface (instead of the light bulb)...i also wonder how this photo would look in b&w, with its rich variations in grays.', '2005-10-06 15:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765102, 240060, 39088, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting I just wish I could make out the cup a little better.  Nice warming effect.</td>', 'I love the lighting I just wish I could make out the cup a little better.  Nice warming effect.', '2005-10-06 15:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765106, 237697, 37875, '<td valign="top">i like the angle for this shot.  the colors look grained out (if that''s a real term) in my eye, though. perhaps its an effect of sharpening the image?   i would be interested in seeing how this picture would look with less saturation/contrast for a smoother look, or converted to b&amp;w to play up on the contrasts.</td>', 'i like the angle for this shot.  the colors look grained out (if that''s a real term) in my eye, though. perhaps its an effect of sharpening the image?   i would be interested in seeing how this picture would look with less saturation/contrast for a smoother look, or converted to b&w to play up on the contrasts.', '2005-10-06 15:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765107, 239050, 39088, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2005-10-06 15:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765109, 240436, 39088, '<td valign="top">Cute idea but I think this photo would have a more dramatic effect if we actually saw something comming out of the cup, or perhaps just affter impact.</td>', 'Cute idea but I think this photo would have a more dramatic effect if we actually saw something comming out of the cup, or perhaps just affter impact.', '2005-10-06 15:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765111, 238446, 37875, '<td valign="top">de-sat it is!  (not decaf if i can help it!)  : )<br/>i like the color tones in this picture, and the composition.  it''s a bit difficult to see the logo on the cup against the color of the drink, so i find my eyes straining there. i would be interested in seeing this picture with the lighing adjusted (so that it''s not as bright in the display cases and behind the glass cup).  or, i wonder if this image would show richer contrast and definition converted to a b&amp;w?</td>', 'de-sat it is!  (not decaf if i can help it!)  : )i like the color tones in this picture, and the composition.  it''s a bit difficult to see the logo on the cup against the color of the drink, so i find my eyes straining there. i would be interested in seeing this picture with the lighing adjusted (so that it''s not as bright in the display cases and behind the glass cup).  or, i wonder if this image would show richer contrast and definition converted to a b&w?', '2005-10-06 15:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765112, 239938, 39088, '<td valign="top">Buetifull colors.  Nice image of fall.  I don''t understand the title though.</td>', 'Buetifull colors.  Nice image of fall.  I don''t understand the title though.', '2005-10-06 15:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765117, 240394, 33150, '<td valign="top">SOOOOOOOOO CUTE!!</td>', 'SOOOOOOOOO CUTE!!', '2005-10-06 15:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765118, 238783, 39088, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I love the oversized glasses and how they draw attention up to her eyes after pondering the cup.  I also like how the glasses obscure the eyes but not completely so that we can only just barely see her eyes, it makes me wonder all the more what she is contemplating.  Well done 8.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I love the oversized glasses and how they draw attention up to her eyes after pondering the cup.  I also like how the glasses obscure the eyes but not completely so that we can only just barely see her eyes, it makes me wonder all the more what she is contemplating.  Well done 8.', '2005-10-06 15:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765120, 238879, 37875, '<td valign="top">what a groovy neon sign!  i like the sign, and the colors.   for such a groovy sign, the straight-across photo does not lend much excitement or energy to the image.  i would be interested in seeing what this image would be like if captured from different angles. that may help to off-set the large amount of black background as well...</td>', 'what a groovy neon sign!  i like the sign, and the colors.   for such a groovy sign, the straight-across photo does not lend much excitement or energy to the image.  i would be interested in seeing what this image would be like if captured from different angles. that may help to off-set the large amount of black background as well...', '2005-10-06 15:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765123, 240009, 39088, '<td valign="top">Funny.  It would be funny to also see the one stand out bean even more orange almost nuclear.</td>', 'Funny.  It would be funny to also see the one stand out bean even more orange almost nuclear.', '2005-10-06 15:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765132, 238950, 37875, '<td valign="top">when i read "rained out", i think "black and white image"...<br/>it''s such a pretty setting, but empty--the pulled-back image lacks energy, imo.<br/>i would be interested in seeing how this image would look as a closer shot, or as it is currently set up but with someone reacting to the wet environment...that kind of thing.</td>', 'when i read "rained out", i think "black and white image"...it''s such a pretty setting, but empty--the pulled-back image lacks energy, imo.i would be interested in seeing how this image would look as a closer shot, or as it is currently set up but with someone reacting to the wet environment...that kind of thing.', '2005-10-06 15:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765137, 238211, 39088, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W really works well here.  Something about the cups bieng in the top center of the composition is distracting for me but unfortunatly I am too inexperienced to be able to make a suggestion that I can firmly stand behind.  I do really like the photo though 7.</td>', 'The B&W really works well here.  Something about the cups bieng in the top center of the composition is distracting for me but unfortunatly I am too inexperienced to be able to make a suggestion that I can firmly stand behind.  I do really like the photo though 7.', '2005-10-06 15:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765139, 240197, 37875, '<td valign="top">the colors and coffee pods in this pic are a great choice for the photo!  energetic picture, like the close-up view.  i do not know if this was intentional, but the photo appears to be out of focus (don''t know if it''s an intentional blur effect...).  if it''s a blur effect, i feel that it detracts from the photo.  i would be interested in seeing this image in sharper focus, with more diffused lighting to tone down the reflections on the pods and allow the vivid colors to shine through.<br/>really nice composition!</td>', 'the colors and coffee pods in this pic are a great choice for the photo!  energetic picture, like the close-up view.  i do not know if this was intentional, but the photo appears to be out of focus (don''t know if it''s an intentional blur effect...).  if it''s a blur effect, i feel that it detracts from the photo.  i would be interested in seeing this image in sharper focus, with more diffused lighting to tone down the reflections on the pods and allow the vivid colors to shine through.really nice composition!', '2005-10-06 15:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765144, 239237, 39088, '<td valign="top">Its a bit distracting that the horizontal lines are not straight.  Nice color contrasts.</td>', 'Its a bit distracting that the horizontal lines are not straight.  Nice color contrasts.', '2005-10-06 15:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765149, 240292, 39088, '<td valign="top">The salt and pepper shakers seem to draw my attention too much.  Perhaps if the sugar pakets were located where the salt and pepper were?</td>', 'The salt and pepper shakers seem to draw my attention too much.  Perhaps if the sugar pakets were located where the salt and pepper were?', '2005-10-06 15:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765150, 239149, 37875, '<td valign="top">my first impression is that it''s a "table for two" but the two is cut off in the photo.  this makes it feel out of balance to me.  the table setting and placement by the door is quite nice.  i would be interested in seeing this image including more of the second chair, with a filter over the lens to remove the reflection from the picture on the wall (the reflection detracts from your image, imo).  such a lovely setting, with that yellow door and the stained glass, and the sunlight streaming in!</td>', 'my first impression is that it''s a "table for two" but the two is cut off in the photo.  this makes it feel out of balance to me.  the table setting and placement by the door is quite nice.  i would be interested in seeing this image including more of the second chair, with a filter over the lens to remove the reflection from the picture on the wall (the reflection detracts from your image, imo).  such a lovely setting, with that yellow door and the stained glass, and the sunlight streaming in!', '2005-10-06 15:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765171, 240477, 39088, '<td valign="top">Very cool and imaginative lighting.  I would like to see this in color though to warm it up.  The B&amp;W seems to make it seem more haunting and contradicts the look on subjects face and the inviting title.</td>', 'Very cool and imaginative lighting.  I would like to see this in color though to warm it up.  The B&W seems to make it seem more haunting and contradicts the look on subjects face and the inviting title.', '2005-10-06 16:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
