(1765195, 240082, 20214, '<td valign="top">Basically a nice photo, however, the shadows under the subject''s left hand are somewhat distracting to me, IMHO. Better use of lighting would improve this photo.</td>', 'Basically a nice photo, however, the shadows under the subject''s left hand are somewhat distracting to me, IMHO. Better use of lighting would improve this photo.', '2005-10-06 16:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
