(1765216, 239158, 37875, '<td valign="top">i think the condensation and light through the glass looks beautiful.  compared to the glass, the coaster looks a bit washed out and lacks the interest that the glass holds.  i would be interested in seeing how this image would look in b&amp;w, with all that groovy lighting in the glass.  i would also be interested in seeing how this image would look with richer colors in the coaster.</td>', 'i think the condensation and light through the glass looks beautiful.  compared to the glass, the coaster looks a bit washed out and lacks the interest that the glass holds.  i would be interested in seeing how this image would look in b&w, with all that groovy lighting in the glass.  i would also be interested in seeing how this image would look with richer colors in the coaster.', '2005-10-06 16:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
