(1765402, 238114, 44882, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W, good contrast, nice framing, an empty coffee shop longing for guests... I like it.</td>', 'Nice B&W, good contrast, nice framing, an empty coffee shop longing for guests... I like it.', '2005-10-06 17:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765407, 240582, 20941, '<td valign="top">focus seems a bit off too me and while your subject and background are not too imaginative, it meets the challenge and is well composed</td>', 'focus seems a bit off too me and while your subject and background are not too imaginative, it meets the challenge and is well composed', '2005-10-06 17:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765408, 240367, 44882, '<td valign="top">This one is original, I like the shadow of the cup and the beans. Depth of field could be better; I would have preferred if  the background was a little sharper.</td>', 'This one is original, I like the shadow of the cup and the beans. Depth of field could be better; I would have preferred if  the background was a little sharper.', '2005-10-06 17:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765411, 238935, 37875, '<td valign="top">i like the overhead angle of the shot, and the composition of pastries and coffee.  i would be interested in seeing how this composition would have looked on a different colored plate/background.  imo, the white on white on white gets a bit bright in the upper left section, which detracts from the photo.</td>', 'i like the overhead angle of the shot, and the composition of pastries and coffee.  i would be interested in seeing how this composition would have looked on a different colored plate/background.  imo, the white on white on white gets a bit bright in the upper left section, which detracts from the photo.', '2005-10-06 17:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765413, 240482, 20941, '<td valign="top">seems a little flat in lighting and i''n not a big fan of OOF hands in the foreground, but your subject has some interest and it meets the challenge</td>', 'seems a little flat in lighting and i''n not a big fan of OOF hands in the foreground, but your subject has some interest and it meets the challenge', '2005-10-06 17:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765415, 238142, 44882, '<td valign="top">I really good idea, but a difficult shot resluting in a too blurry picture.</td>', 'I really good idea, but a difficult shot resluting in a too blurry picture.', '2005-10-06 17:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765419, 240288, 20941, '<td valign="top">i like your composition, don''t care for the yellow around the biscuit, but meets the challenge and is well composed</td>', 'i like your composition, don''t care for the yellow around the biscuit, but meets the challenge and is well composed', '2005-10-06 17:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765421, 240550, 44882, '<td valign="top">I like the harmony of colors... but think I would have preferred the picture taken from another angle... to give some more depth to the picture. The flash seems to have been to strong.</td>', 'I like the harmony of colors... but think I would have preferred the picture taken from another angle... to give some more depth to the picture. The flash seems to have been to strong.', '2005-10-06 17:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765426, 240084, 20941, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge, but not too imaginative and would like to see better focal range, nicely composed</td>', 'meets the challenge, but not too imaginative and would like to see better focal range, nicely composed', '2005-10-06 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765431, 239578, 44882, '<td valign="top">thats not coffee !?</td>', 'thats not coffee !?', '2005-10-06 17:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765438, 240361, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice idea for your submission.  when i look at this picture, it looks like some person reading a paper more than a waiter, imo.  i like the angle of the shot, and the color treatment works with it.  i would be interested in seeing a closer shot of the person in the shadow with the table.  the guy standing in shadow with the white paper really pops out, and focusing in on him without all the empty tables could be interesting...</td>', 'nice idea for your submission.  when i look at this picture, it looks like some person reading a paper more than a waiter, imo.  i like the angle of the shot, and the color treatment works with it.  i would be interested in seeing a closer shot of the person in the shadow with the table.  the guy standing in shadow with the white paper really pops out, and focusing in on him without all the empty tables could be interesting...', '2005-10-06 17:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765439, 239129, 20941, '<td valign="top">nice in b/w, well focused and meets the challenge, maybe i would have cropped a little more off the bottom, but generally a nice composition IMO</td>', 'nice in b/w, well focused and meets the challenge, maybe i would have cropped a little more off the bottom, but generally a nice composition IMO', '2005-10-06 17:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765445, 239622, 20941, '<td valign="top">pleasant and meets the challenge although not wild with imagination its a nice composition</td>', 'pleasant and meets the challenge although not wild with imagination its a nice composition', '2005-10-06 17:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765447, 239435, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice collection of bean bags!  : )<br/>i would be interested in seeing how this image would look with less brightness in the upper right part of the picture.  imo, the staircase white appears to get blown out, which detracts from the nice, soft tones of the rest of the picture.</td>', 'nice collection of bean bags!  : )i would be interested in seeing how this image would look with less brightness in the upper right part of the picture.  imo, the staircase white appears to get blown out, which detracts from the nice, soft tones of the rest of the picture.', '2005-10-06 17:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765448, 238783, 20941, '<td valign="top">very nice b/w</td>', 'very nice b/w', '2005-10-06 17:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765454, 239453, 20941, '<td valign="top">more of the coffee shop and less bridge would have been better for me, but a nice shot</td>', 'more of the coffee shop and less bridge would have been better for me, but a nice shot', '2005-10-06 17:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765457, 239747, 20941, '<td valign="top">good composition, lighting and focus, very nice</td>', 'good composition, lighting and focus, very nice', '2005-10-06 17:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765458, 239152, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the idea with the writing in coffee grounds, and the sugar bowl.  <br/>really bright white, feels overexposed or overly-brightened.  The extreme whiteness and glare off of the sugar bowl detracts from the photo.  i would be interested in seeing how this image would look converted to a b&amp;w with all the contrast, or how it would look with softer lighting.</td>', 'like the idea with the writing in coffee grounds, and the sugar bowl.  really bright white, feels overexposed or overly-brightened.  The extreme whiteness and glare off of the sugar bowl detracts from the photo.  i would be interested in seeing how this image would look converted to a b&w with all the contrast, or how it would look with softer lighting.', '2005-10-06 17:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765462, 239484, 20941, '<td valign="top">cool in b/w, maybe not the best perspective, but the image creates a nice late nite coffee shop ambiance</td>', 'cool in b/w, maybe not the best perspective, but the image creates a nice late nite coffee shop ambiance', '2005-10-06 17:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765464, 240084, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice close up of the bean.  i would be interested to see how this image would look with richer, deeper brown tones and softer lighting...or, how this image would look with its current lighting but converted to b&amp;w for all the detail and contrast to pop out.</td>', 'nice close up of the bean.  i would be interested to see how this image would look with richer, deeper brown tones and softer lighting...or, how this image would look with its current lighting but converted to b&w for all the detail and contrast to pop out.', '2005-10-06 17:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
