(1765497, 240171, 40718, '<td valign="top">this would have been a much better picture if it were bigger.  You should learn how to make the pics 640 pixels at least (unless this was a cell camera or something).  I''ll still give you a 6, but I bet you would have done a ton better with a bigger picture.</td>', 'this would have been a much better picture if it were bigger.  You should learn how to make the pics 640 pixels at least (unless this was a cell camera or something).  I''ll still give you a 6, but I bet you would have done a ton better with a bigger picture.', '2005-10-06 17:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765498, 240394, 20941, '<td valign="top">lol... cute, imaginative and original.... looks like you had fun with this</td>', 'lol... cute, imaginative and original.... looks like you had fun with this', '2005-10-06 17:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765501, 240511, 20941, '<td valign="top">interesting choice of subject for this challenge, but certainly creative!</td>', 'interesting choice of subject for this challenge, but certainly creative!', '2005-10-06 17:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765505, 240117, 20941, '<td valign="top">very cool shot! You certainly met the challenge with this one. nice work</td>', 'very cool shot! You certainly met the challenge with this one. nice work', '2005-10-06 17:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765527, 238746, 37875, '<td valign="top">cool concept for a photo!  i''ve felt like that many a time...<br/>the image inside of the french press feels rough and two-dimensional in comparison to the rest of the photograph...i would be interested in seeing how this image would look with softer edges around the squishy guy, but i''m not sure how to approach that within the basic editing rules.</td>', 'cool concept for a photo!  i''ve felt like that many a time...the image inside of the french press feels rough and two-dimensional in comparison to the rest of the photograph...i would be interested in seeing how this image would look with softer edges around the squishy guy, but i''m not sure how to approach that within the basic editing rules.', '2005-10-06 17:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765539, 240084, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great macro DOF and all!</td>', 'Great macro DOF and all!', '2005-10-06 17:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765542, 238211, 37875, '<td valign="top">i like the composition of this shot!  i wish i could see the newsprint on the tables more clearly...<br/>i would also be interested in seeing how this image would look with someone sitting at the table, smoking and reading the table top....</td>', 'i like the composition of this shot!  i wish i could see the newsprint on the tables more clearly...i would also be interested in seeing how this image would look with someone sitting at the table, smoking and reading the table top....', '2005-10-06 17:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765544, 239531, 37875, '<td valign="top">such a pretty pose, and such warm colors.  i do not know if it was intentional, but the photo appears to be out of focus (don''t know if it''s a blur effect...).  i feel that the blur detracts from the photo.</td>', 'such a pretty pose, and such warm colors.  i do not know if it was intentional, but the photo appears to be out of focus (don''t know if it''s a blur effect...).  i feel that the blur detracts from the photo.', '2005-10-06 17:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765551, 240133, 37875, '<td valign="top">mmm...cake...<br/>i would be interested in seeing how this image would look with softer spot lighting, to emphasize all the lovely colors and detail in the cake.</td>', 'mmm...cake...i would be interested in seeing how this image would look with softer spot lighting, to emphasize all the lovely colors and detail in the cake.', '2005-10-06 17:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765596, 239510, 37875, '<td valign="top">i like the coffee sign amd the chocolate o''hara sign.  i would be interested in seeing how these elements could be featured more prominently in the picture...by picking one sign to focus on, showing a tighter shot of the crowd, interesting angle for the shot, etc.</td>', 'i like the coffee sign amd the chocolate o''hara sign.  i would be interested in seeing how these elements could be featured more prominently in the picture...by picking one sign to focus on, showing a tighter shot of the crowd, interesting angle for the shot, etc.', '2005-10-06 18:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765598, 240178, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice soft b&amp;w tones.  like the effect of the light through the blinds.  the coffee cup seems to disappear against the blinds, imo.  i would be interested in seeing this image with a cup or mug that has stronger visual impact that can hold its own against those blinds.</td>', 'nice soft b&w tones.  like the effect of the light through the blinds.  the coffee cup seems to disappear against the blinds, imo.  i would be interested in seeing this image with a cup or mug that has stronger visual impact that can hold its own against those blinds.', '2005-10-06 18:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765626, 240458, 43828, '<td valign="top">Cool pic, needs more lighting to show the hand reaching for the cup.</td>', 'Cool pic, needs more lighting to show the hand reaching for the cup.', '2005-10-06 18:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765680, 240216, 44882, '<td valign="top">I just adore the light and the colors of this photo, maybe the framing is a little bit too narrow ? Great picture.</td>', 'I just adore the light and the colors of this photo, maybe the framing is a little bit too narrow ? Great picture.', '2005-10-06 18:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765682, 240070, 44882, '<td valign="top">Great picture, I love the effect of the light, good harmony.</td>', 'Great picture, I love the effect of the light, good harmony.', '2005-10-06 18:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765685, 239996, 40644, '<td valign="top">This was the shot I was looking for. Something that showed real people and a real coffee shop/diner. This is the shot I would''ve taken. Great shot showing real people and real expressions!</td>', 'This was the shot I was looking for. Something that showed real people and a real coffee shop/diner. This is the shot I would''ve taken. Great shot showing real people and real expressions!', '2005-10-06 18:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
