(1766301, 240601, 40868, '<td valign="top">Good reaction, I know exactly how you feel.  But, before you say espresso really is a horrible drink, realize that almost no one makes espresso well.  Check out these sites for kicks:<br/> <br/>www.coffeegeek.com<br/>www.home-barista.com<br/>www.baristaguild.org<br/> <br/>Espresso''s a tricky drink to get down right, and when it''s not done right, it''s catastrophic.  <br/> <br/>Now, to the picture, eh?<br/> <br/>The coffee cup looks like it''s awkwardly held, almost as though you folded your arm straight up, and it makes the picture a little weird.  The change in background is distracting.  Finally, the face looks emotionless.  But the reaction is excellent and the moment is well-caught.</td>', 'Good reaction, I know exactly how you feel.  But, before you say espresso really is a horrible drink, realize that almost no one makes espresso well.  Check out these sites for kicks: www.coffeegeek.comwww.home-barista.comwww.baristaguild.org Espresso''s a tricky drink to get down right, and when it''s not done right, it''s catastrophic.   Now, to the picture, eh? The coffee cup looks like it''s awkwardly held, almost as though you folded your arm straight up, and it makes the picture a little weird.  The change in background is distracting.  Finally, the face looks emotionless.  But the reaction is excellent and the moment is well-caught.', '2005-10-06 22:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766343, 240293, 31403, '<td valign="top">needs a little more shadow to tie it into the background - looks like a levitating cup of coffee at first what is there is lit well 6</td>', 'needs a little more shadow to tie it into the background - looks like a levitating cup of coffee at first what is there is lit well 6', '2005-10-06 22:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766350, 238114, 44118, '<td valign="top">Nice interior and image</td>', 'Nice interior and image', '2005-10-06 22:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766353, 239597, 44304, '<td valign="top">This was nicely done.  One of the better pics, but I think a little more light in the shadowed area on the left could have helped.  Overall I find it interesting, and that''s a big plus.</td>', 'This was nicely done.  One of the better pics, but I think a little more light in the shadowed area on the left could have helped.  Overall I find it interesting, and that''s a big plus.', '2005-10-06 22:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766359, 240197, 44304, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge, but not exactly tack sharp.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge, but not exactly tack sharp.', '2005-10-06 22:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766363, 239902, 44304, '<td valign="top">Color of the sky strikes me as a little too deep of a blue, giving away it''s photoshopped nature.  At least I assume that''s photoshop...if not, I want to move to where you took the picture.  But overall this is one of the better pics in the challenge.  I give it a 7.</td>', 'Color of the sky strikes me as a little too deep of a blue, giving away it''s photoshopped nature.  At least I assume that''s photoshop...if not, I want to move to where you took the picture.  But overall this is one of the better pics in the challenge.  I give it a 7.', '2005-10-06 22:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766370, 240572, 44304, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but nothing really grabs my attention and makes me want to look at the picture and study it.  But just meeting the challenge puts you ahead of most in this one! :)</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but nothing really grabs my attention and makes me want to look at the picture and study it.  But just meeting the challenge puts you ahead of most in this one! :)', '2005-10-06 22:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766372, 239152, 44304, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little blown in the bottom right, but still one of the more interesting photos of this challenge.  I think this one will definately do well.  Good luck!</td>', 'Perhaps a little blown in the bottom right, but still one of the more interesting photos of this challenge.  I think this one will definately do well.  Good luck!', '2005-10-06 22:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766379, 239726, 44304, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, and very fitting for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice tones, and very fitting for the challenge.', '2005-10-06 22:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766382, 240545, 44304, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'Good idea, and interesting take on the challenge.', '2005-10-06 22:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766387, 238736, 44304, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge.  Great take on the challenge, and great photo overall.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge.  Great take on the challenge, and great photo overall.', '2005-10-06 22:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766389, 240603, 44304, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the cop of coffee seems to have been done to make sure you met the challenge.  However, I think that the focus of this photo is the witty saying on the t-shirt, which in itself, isn''t really what the challenge is about.</td>', 'The inclusion of the cop of coffee seems to have been done to make sure you met the challenge.  However, I think that the focus of this photo is the witty saying on the t-shirt, which in itself, isn''t really what the challenge is about.', '2005-10-06 22:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766393, 240141, 44304, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit blown in places and a bit underexposed in others, but they seem to balance each other out.  I like the high contrast feel and the take you had on the challenge.</td>', 'Seems a bit blown in places and a bit underexposed in others, but they seem to balance each other out.  I like the high contrast feel and the take you had on the challenge.', '2005-10-06 22:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766394, 240566, 22734, '<td valign="top">A good and funny statement with slick graphics and attractive composition.</td>', 'A good and funny statement with slick graphics and attractive composition.', '2005-10-06 22:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766399, 238783, 22734, '<td valign="top">Stylish and crisp in presentation.</td>', 'Stylish and crisp in presentation.', '2005-10-06 22:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766402, 240371, 44304, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, and does so in an artistic fashion.  Enough to bump you ahead of the crowd, but to take top 10 I think you''re going to need something captivating that holds the attention of the onlooker and draws interest.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, and does so in an artistic fashion.  Enough to bump you ahead of the crowd, but to take top 10 I think you''re going to need something captivating that holds the attention of the onlooker and draws interest.', '2005-10-06 22:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766403, 238962, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice splash!</td>', 'Very nice splash!', '2005-10-06 22:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766404, 238736, 22734, '<td valign="top">Pleasant in feeling.</td>', 'Pleasant in feeling.', '2005-10-06 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766406, 239173, 44304, '<td valign="top">Borderlines on a snapshot sort of feel.  Meets the challenge, just doesn''t have anything to really spawn interest.</td>', 'Borderlines on a snapshot sort of feel.  Meets the challenge, just doesn''t have anything to really spawn interest.', '2005-10-06 22:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766412, 237485, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice feel as one can almost hear the voices and the clatter of cups and sugar jars.</td>', 'Very nice feel as one can almost hear the voices and the clatter of cups and sugar jars.', '2005-10-06 22:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766413, 239532, 44304, '<td valign="top">This is my pick so far.  Great take on the challenge.  You''ve managed to not only meet the challenge requirements, but also done so in a way that keeps my looking at the photograph for more than a glimpse and attracting my interest.  Congrats!</td>', 'This is my pick so far.  Great take on the challenge.  You''ve managed to not only meet the challenge requirements, but also done so in a way that keeps my looking at the photograph for more than a glimpse and attracting my interest.  Congrats!', '2005-10-06 22:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766415, 240550, 22734, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition with great dof to make background a great support.</td>', 'Interesting composition with great dof to make background a great support.', '2005-10-06 22:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766417, 240508, 44304, '<td valign="top">While this does, to me, meet the challenge requirements, I don''t find it standing out among the crowd.  It is technically fine, with good composition, but maybe if you had someone playing the guitar in a dimly lit "coffee house" kind of mood it would have scored better.</td>', 'While this does, to me, meet the challenge requirements, I don''t find it standing out among the crowd.  It is technically fine, with good composition, but maybe if you had someone playing the guitar in a dimly lit "coffee house" kind of mood it would have scored better.', '2005-10-06 22:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766418, 240397, 43334, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot.  Unique and creative.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot.  Unique and creative.', '2005-10-06 22:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766419, 240060, 37893, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. The tonalities are just perfect.</td>', 'Lovely image. The tonalities are just perfect.', '2005-10-06 22:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766420, 237485, 18349, '<td valign="top">One of my personal favorites thus far... wonderful capture, full of energy and depth.  :)</td>', 'One of my personal favorites thus far... wonderful capture, full of energy and depth.  :)', '2005-10-06 22:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766421, 238915, 22734, '<td valign="top">Not happy with frame but the capture has enough charm to outride it. The detail and dof lend a seamless visual.</td>', 'Not happy with frame but the capture has enough charm to outride it. The detail and dof lend a seamless visual.', '2005-10-06 22:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766422, 240474, 37893, '<td valign="top">This image could use some contrast to bring out the tonality.</td>', 'This image could use some contrast to bring out the tonality.', '2005-10-06 22:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766423, 238189, 44304, '<td valign="top">This was a nice way to jazz up a shot that can be expected to be overdone in a competition about coffee shops.</td>', 'This was a nice way to jazz up a shot that can be expected to be overdone in a competition about coffee shops.', '2005-10-06 22:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766424, 240070, 18349, '<td valign="top">Excellent... love the colors...can almost feel the smoothness of the steel.  :)</td>', 'Excellent... love the colors...can almost feel the smoothness of the steel.  :)', '2005-10-06 23:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766428, 240280, 44304, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  Stands out from the crowd of coffee cup shots in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  Stands out from the crowd of coffee cup shots in this challenge.', '2005-10-06 23:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766429, 240117, 37893, '<td valign="top">Had you not mentioned what this image was, i would have never figured it out. But now I see it. The nose pads and the brim of the lens. Such a fun and light hearted image. 7</td>', 'Had you not mentioned what this image was, i would have never figured it out. But now I see it. The nose pads and the brim of the lens. Such a fun and light hearted image. 7', '2005-10-06 23:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766430, 238746, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well done and quite funny.</td>', 'Very well done and quite funny.', '2005-10-06 23:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766431, 240082, 44304, '<td valign="top">I''ve been there!  Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve been there!  Nice take on the challenge.', '2005-10-06 23:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766432, 238189, 37893, '<td valign="top">I''ll repeat what others have said - image is too small.</td>', 'I''ll repeat what others have said - image is too small.', '2005-10-06 23:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766438, 239902, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think the use of a CPL (if you did use one) is a bit too much in this image. The sky is eerily smooth and uniform. This could have probably used a bit of contrast or elevsl to bring some colors out. 6</td>', 'I think the use of a CPL (if you did use one) is a bit too much in this image. The sky is eerily smooth and uniform. This could have probably used a bit of contrast or elevsl to bring some colors out. 6', '2005-10-06 23:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766439, 240120, 18349, '<td valign="top">I love this, blown highlights and all.... great work, great dof, great everything.  :)</td>', 'I love this, blown highlights and all.... great work, great dof, great everything.  :)', '2005-10-06 23:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766441, 240511, 44304, '<td valign="top">I''m having trouble fitting this into the boundary of this competition, but aside from that the sun has blown out a good portion of the background.  I think this shot could benefit from a smaller aperture to keep the background in at least slightly better focus and the sun a bit more tame.</td>', 'I''m having trouble fitting this into the boundary of this competition, but aside from that the sun has blown out a good portion of the background.  I think this shot could benefit from a smaller aperture to keep the background in at least slightly better focus and the sun a bit more tame.', '2005-10-06 23:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766442, 239510, 44304, '<td valign="top">Well....not exactly a coffee shop, but more of a shop that happens to sell coffee.  Aside from that, I''m having trouble finding a center of focus that is very captivating.</td>', 'Well....not exactly a coffee shop, but more of a shop that happens to sell coffee.  Aside from that, I''m having trouble finding a center of focus that is very captivating.', '2005-10-06 23:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766445, 240009, 44304, '<td valign="top">This was an intersting way to jazz up a bean shot.  It stands out from the crowd.  Nice DOF, and good job overall.</td>', 'This was an intersting way to jazz up a bean shot.  It stands out from the crowd.  Nice DOF, and good job overall.', '2005-10-06 23:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766447, 238211, 18349, '<td valign="top">Well seen...very nice, simplistic, and emotive.  :)</td>', 'Well seen...very nice, simplistic, and emotive.  :)', '2005-10-06 23:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766451, 238935, 44304, '<td valign="top">This looks delicious, meets the challenge, and will be pushed ahead of the crowd in this competition.  However, lack of a captivating feature that leaves me looking for a long time will probably keep it out of the top 10.  Nice shot though!</td>', 'This looks delicious, meets the challenge, and will be pushed ahead of the crowd in this competition.  However, lack of a captivating feature that leaves me looking for a long time will probably keep it out of the top 10.  Nice shot though!', '2005-10-06 23:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766452, 240411, 44304, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, interesting angle, and nice choice of title.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, interesting angle, and nice choice of title.', '2005-10-06 23:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766453, 237467, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like this one quite a bit... good sharpness and detail.  Nice tonal range as well.  :)</td>', 'I like this one quite a bit... good sharpness and detail.  Nice tonal range as well.  :)', '2005-10-06 23:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766457, 240373, 44304, '<td valign="top">This was an interesting choice.  Although it may not be popular, I like the blur you created and will score accordingly.</td>', 'This was an interesting choice.  Although it may not be popular, I like the blur you created and will score accordingly.', '2005-10-06 23:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766460, 240582, 44304, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but leaves me wanting more.  Not a bad shot, just needs something to hold the interest of the viewer.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but leaves me wanting more.  Not a bad shot, just needs something to hold the interest of the viewer.', '2005-10-06 23:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766461, 240401, 18349, '<td valign="top">Interesting setup and POV.  A bit dark, or muddy at least...maybe a slight boost in contrast?  I like the grain.  :)</td>', 'Interesting setup and POV.  A bit dark, or muddy at least...maybe a slight boost in contrast?  I like the grain.  :)', '2005-10-06 23:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766463, 240482, 44304, '<td valign="top">The ring is a tad distracting from the goal of the photo, but I like what you''ve done with the photo in general.  Good job.</td>', 'The ring is a tad distracting from the goal of the photo, but I like what you''ve done with the photo in general.  Good job.', '2005-10-06 23:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766465, 240342, 44304, '<td valign="top">This is interesting... stands out from the crowd of normal cups/bowls/etc</td>', 'This is interesting... stands out from the crowd of normal cups/bowls/etc', '2005-10-06 23:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766467, 239949, 44304, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  This is a very interesting place.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  This is a very interesting place.', '2005-10-06 23:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766469, 240458, 44304, '<td valign="top">I think a more creative title could have pushed this shot into the top.  As it stands it is still an interesting photo and a creative take on the challenge.</td>', 'I think a more creative title could have pushed this shot into the top.  As it stands it is still an interesting photo and a creative take on the challenge.', '2005-10-06 23:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766471, 240579, 44304, '<td valign="top">I love the idea.  Nice take on the challenge.  I just think the critical focus should have been on the model''s face and not the cup.</td>', 'I love the idea.  Nice take on the challenge.  I just think the critical focus should have been on the model''s face and not the cup.', '2005-10-06 23:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766473, 240292, 18349, '<td valign="top">One of my personal favorites... I love the opened sugar packets and the sugar on the table.  Great use of DOF to create interest and depth.  Nice warm tones as well.  :)</td>', 'One of my personal favorites... I love the opened sugar packets and the sugar on the table.  Great use of DOF to create interest and depth.  Nice warm tones as well.  :)', '2005-10-06 23:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766474, 240563, 44304, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, but nothing to really hold the interest of the viewer.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, but nothing to really hold the interest of the viewer.', '2005-10-06 23:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766476, 240084, 44304, '<td valign="top">Good macro shot of a coffee bean.  Meets the challenge, and stands out from the crowd of normal bean shots.</td>', 'Good macro shot of a coffee bean.  Meets the challenge, and stands out from the crowd of normal bean shots.', '2005-10-06 23:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766479, 240346, 44304, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge, but I''m feeling that this is more of a snapshot than a captivating photograph.  Nevertheless, still interesting and ahead of the crowd in this competition.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge, but I''m feeling that this is more of a snapshot than a captivating photograph.  Nevertheless, still interesting and ahead of the crowd in this competition.', '2005-10-06 23:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766482, 238783, 18349, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image... I like the DOF you''ve chosen.  Nice pose, great exposure and tonal range.  :)</td>', 'Wonderful image... I like the DOF you''ve chosen.  Nice pose, great exposure and tonal range.  :)', '2005-10-06 23:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766483, 239137, 44304, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the challenge.  I like the set-up and execution.</td>', 'Excellent take on the challenge.  I like the set-up and execution.', '2005-10-06 23:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766486, 240060, 44304, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark...</td>', 'A bit too dark...', '2005-10-06 23:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766488, 238107, 44304, '<td valign="top">Nice title, and nice take on the challenge, but it lacks that something special that keeps you staring and captivated.</td>', 'Nice title, and nice take on the challenge, but it lacks that something special that keeps you staring and captivated.', '2005-10-06 23:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766490, 240063, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple composition.  Light a bit too harsh for my taste and I think it needs something to give the photo more impact.  Don;t have any suggestions as to what that might be I''m afraid.</td>', 'Nice and simple composition.  Light a bit too harsh for my taste and I think it needs something to give the photo more impact.  Don;t have any suggestions as to what that might be I''m afraid.', '2005-10-06 23:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766491, 238473, 44304, '<td valign="top">I would like to have had a larger field of vision in this one, but it is a nice photo.</td>', 'I would like to have had a larger field of vision in this one, but it is a nice photo.', '2005-10-06 23:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766492, 239996, 18349, '<td valign="top">Excellent slice-of-life candid...love the expression!  Wonderful moment to capture of real people doing real things in the real world.  :)</td>', 'Excellent slice-of-life candid...love the expression!  Wonderful moment to capture of real people doing real things in the real world.  :)', '2005-10-06 23:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766493, 240113, 44304, '<td valign="top">Looks tasty... this is one of those photos that can invoke emotion...thirst!</td>', 'Looks tasty... this is one of those photos that can invoke emotion...thirst!', '2005-10-06 23:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766497, 237831, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Items a bit too crowded together and strong backlighting creates many shadows.  I wonder what this would have looked light shot from a higher angle.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Items a bit too crowded together and strong backlighting creates many shadows.  I wonder what this would have looked light shot from a higher angle.', '2005-10-06 23:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766498, 239732, 44304, '<td valign="top">One of the few bean shots that I''ve really liked.  This was well done with the burlap sack and ground beans.  The map really adds to the effect you were going for.  Nice...</td>', 'One of the few bean shots that I''ve really liked.  This was well done with the burlap sack and ground beans.  The map really adds to the effect you were going for.  Nice...', '2005-10-06 23:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766502, 240348, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice, amusing and clever.  A bit too bright on the left but overall a very pleasing effect.</td>', 'Nice, amusing and clever.  A bit too bright on the left but overall a very pleasing effect.', '2005-10-06 23:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766503, 239231, 35218, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Ah! If only this were advanced editing, you could have got rid of those reflections and then everything would have looked like floating in blackness.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Ah! If only this were advanced editing, you could have got rid of those reflections and then everything would have looked like floating in blackness.', '2005-10-06 23:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766506, 240526, 35218, '<td valign="top">Very effective.  I wonder if it would have looked better stood on a dark surface.</td>', 'Very effective.  I wonder if it would have looked better stood on a dark surface.', '2005-10-06 23:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766508, 237446, 10432, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo - not a bad subject matter.  However, I think I am missing the connection to coffee shop.</td>', 'Interesting photo - not a bad subject matter.  However, I think I am missing the connection to coffee shop.', '2005-10-06 23:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766511, 239747, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice detail.  Photo lacks a bit of oomph for me but I don;t know why I say that.  Maybe it''s too brightly lit.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice detail.  Photo lacks a bit of oomph for me but I don;t know why I say that.  Maybe it''s too brightly lit.  Nice composition.', '2005-10-06 23:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766513, 240545, 35218, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2005-10-06 23:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766519, 240601, 35218, '<td valign="top">You really should try a different coffee shop.</td>', 'You really should try a different coffee shop.', '2005-10-06 23:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766520, 240536, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition.  Not the most exciting maybe but well executed.</td>', 'Nice simple composition.  Not the most exciting maybe but well executed.', '2005-10-06 23:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766522, 240609, 44304, '<td valign="top">Good focus, and meets the challenge, but doesn''t hold interest for very long.  Good photo though.</td>', 'Good focus, and meets the challenge, but doesn''t hold interest for very long.  Good photo though.', '2005-10-06 23:26:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1766523, 240133, 44304, '<td valign="top">I can see one of these on the counter at a coffee shop.  Looks tasty!</td>', 'I can see one of these on the counter at a coffee shop.  Looks tasty!', '2005-10-06 23:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766524, 238746, 35218, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2005-10-06 23:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766525, 240474, 44304, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge, and the creative title helps.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge, and the creative title helps.', '2005-10-06 23:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766531, 240194, 44304, '<td valign="top">The interesting fabric in the back and coffee paraphanalia in the saucer keep this shot from falling into the "another shot of a cup of coffee" catagory.  Stands out from the crowd.</td>', 'The interesting fabric in the back and coffee paraphanalia in the saucer keep this shot from falling into the "another shot of a cup of coffee" catagory.  Stands out from the crowd.', '2005-10-06 23:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766532, 239741, 35218, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Nice and simple but very nicely balanced composition.  A drop of swirling cream in the coffee might have set this off nicely.</td>', 'I like it.  Nice and simple but very nicely balanced composition.  A drop of swirling cream in the coffee might have set this off nicely.', '2005-10-06 23:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766535, 240427, 35218, '<td valign="top">Very cleverly done.  Nice composition, nice lighting.  One of my favs so far.</td>', 'Very cleverly done.  Nice composition, nice lighting.  One of my favs so far.', '2005-10-06 23:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766538, 238746, 44304, '<td valign="top">This is an impressive shot to do if it was done without spot editing (as the rules stipulate).  Other than the questionable editing, I love the concept.</td>', 'This is an impressive shot to do if it was done without spot editing (as the rules stipulate).  Other than the questionable editing, I love the concept.', '2005-10-06 23:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766543, 240363, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the tilt, and the color....but I am quite distracted by the sugar container..perhaps if it were more to the right or not there at all... the eye naturally goes to the brightest area of an image first, so it''s taking away from the tab and the change, and even the green on the mug.  Overall, however, it''s nice and vibrant, and a good change from many of the other entries.  :)</td>', 'I like the composition, the tilt, and the color....but I am quite distracted by the sugar container..perhaps if it were more to the right or not there at all... the eye naturally goes to the brightest area of an image first, so it''s taking away from the tab and the change, and even the green on the mug.  Overall, however, it''s nice and vibrant, and a good change from many of the other entries.  :)', '2005-10-06 23:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766544, 240120, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.  I like the B&amp;W and the toning.  Creates a nice atmosphere.  I feel the cup is too intrusive.  Maybe a bit smaller and off to one side.  A cup without a prominent brand name may have also been more in keeping with the general feel of the photo.  Very nice entry.</td>', 'Nice effect.  I like the B&W and the toning.  Creates a nice atmosphere.  I feel the cup is too intrusive.  Maybe a bit smaller and off to one side.  A cup without a prominent brand name may have also been more in keeping with the general feel of the photo.  Very nice entry.', '2005-10-06 23:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766548, 239938, 44304, '<td valign="top">I just got out my chair to give this one a standing ovation.  I didn''t think it was possible to see 100 shots of a cup of coffee in a saucer and find one that really stands out from the all the others.  Excellent job with the backdrop and the matching items in the saucer.  You have taken a shot you knew would be lost in the confusion of all those similiar and made it stand out.  10.</td>', 'I just got out my chair to give this one a standing ovation.  I didn''t think it was possible to see 100 shots of a cup of coffee in a saucer and find one that really stands out from the all the others.  Excellent job with the backdrop and the matching items in the saucer.  You have taken a shot you knew would be lost in the confusion of all those similiar and made it stand out.  10.', '2005-10-06 23:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
