(1766688, 240413, 35602, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of artifacts in the background.  That is the green and pink colors that are on the wall, which occur when a photo is not sharp to begin with, and in the process of trying to sharpen it, the colors are created.  It also may occur in compression.  Most likely, an exposure compensation of a few steps  up would help to add more light when the picture is taken.</td>', 'There is a lot of artifacts in the background.  That is the green and pink colors that are on the wall, which occur when a photo is not sharp to begin with, and in the process of trying to sharpen it, the colors are created.  It also may occur in compression.  Most likely, an exposure compensation of a few steps  up would help to add more light when the picture is taken.', '2005-10-07 00:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766702, 239938, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I like all the colors. center composition is ok, but would like see how it would look with the coffee cup move to the left and having the colors take you out of the shot...........6</td>', 'Nice image, I like all the colors. center composition is ok, but would like see how it would look with the coffee cup move to the left and having the colors take you out of the shot...........6', '2005-10-07 00:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766720, 237893, 28359, '<td valign="top">With the dark backgroud and how the coffee cup starts darker at the top and lighter as it goes down really helps this shot, looks like the plate maybe a little over exposed. Doesn''t look real sharp, but not soft focus either.........4 imo.</td>', 'With the dark backgroud and how the coffee cup starts darker at the top and lighter as it goes down really helps this shot, looks like the plate maybe a little over exposed. Doesn''t look real sharp, but not soft focus either.........4 imo.', '2005-10-07 00:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766730, 240415, 28359, '<td valign="top">They have tea at our local shop. Image is well done, clean good back ground, sharp, well composed.......maybe more color???....Nice image....7</td>', 'They have tea at our local shop. Image is well done, clean good back ground, sharp, well composed.......maybe more color???....Nice image....7', '2005-10-07 00:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766752, 238288, 29240, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, very creative composition.  The lighting works really well highlighting the beans to the side and leaving the ones in the back of the cup to almost look like liquid.  There is a lot of really uninteresting photos in this challenge but this definetly is one of the best. Well done, I am envious</td>', 'Love this shot, very creative composition.  The lighting works really well highlighting the beans to the side and leaving the ones in the back of the cup to almost look like liquid.  There is a lot of really uninteresting photos in this challenge but this definetly is one of the best. Well done, I am envious', '2005-10-07 00:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766774, 240060, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice image....like the dark tone, well composed....7</td>', 'Nice image....like the dark tone, well composed....7', '2005-10-07 00:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766779, 240511, 44963, '<td valign="top">This is one of those wonderful shots that I''m not sure what to see in it - Love the colour and the content.  I think I know what I''m looking at but I''m not sure.  Each time I look up I see something new.  this comment is unlikely to be helpful but ... I like the image.</td>', 'This is one of those wonderful shots that I''m not sure what to see in it - Love the colour and the content.  I think I know what I''m looking at but I''m not sure.  Each time I look up I see something new.  this comment is unlikely to be helpful but ... I like the image.', '2005-10-07 00:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
