(1766827, 240427, 40718, '<td valign="top">Bumping to a 10 because that reflection is  just tripping me out.  It should be upside down so either the image is flipped or the girl is upside down (or you cheated, but I won''t assume that).  But neither of those make sense to me.  The girl upside down would be very difficult.<br/> <br/>UPDATE: OK, I think I figured it out... :)<br/> <br/>Ok, here''s my guess (is this the longest comment ever?).  The image is upside down.  The girl is on the same side as the arm, but the arm is provided by another person.  Dang, I don''t think that''s right either...</td>', 'Bumping to a 10 because that reflection is  just tripping me out.  It should be upside down so either the image is flipped or the girl is upside down (or you cheated, but I won''t assume that).  But neither of those make sense to me.  The girl upside down would be very difficult. UPDATE: OK, I think I figured it out... :) Ok, here''s my guess (is this the longest comment ever?).  The image is upside down.  The girl is on the same side as the arm, but the arm is provided by another person.  Dang, I don''t think that''s right either...', '2005-10-07 01:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
