(1769169, 240175, 43115, '<td valign="top">A nice crisp macro shot.  I like the coloration of the background, and even the border works for me.  The composition is spot on too.  Nicely done.</td>', 'A nice crisp macro shot.  I like the coloration of the background, and even the border works for me.  The composition is spot on too.  Nicely done.', '2005-10-07 23:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
