(1769456, 239747, 29658, '<td valign="top">Nice macro work!</td>', 'Nice macro work!', '2005-10-08 04:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769457, 239531, 29658, '<td valign="top">Picture is not sharp because of your shutter speed.</td>', 'Picture is not sharp because of your shutter speed.', '2005-10-08 04:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769466, 238783, 22856, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Love the refelection in her sunglases.</td>', 'Great picture. Love the refelection in her sunglases.', '2005-10-08 04:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769468, 240397, 22856, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but it dosent look to much like coffee.</td>', 'Nice picture, but it dosent look to much like coffee.', '2005-10-08 05:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769560, 240175, 26679, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourite compositions, I would however prefer to see a whiter background rather thean the cream. I suspect a whit ballance issue,</td>', 'This is one of my favourite compositions, I would however prefer to see a whiter background rather thean the cream. I suspect a whit ballance issue,', '2005-10-08 08:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769572, 240361, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea but I would have liked this more if the vertical line (I guess it´s a railing) were lower in the frame and the whole shot was brighter, the whole section where the waiter is is very dark and it´s very hard to make out any details.  4 from me.</td>', 'Not a bad idea but I would have liked this more if the vertical line (I guess it´s a railing) were lower in the frame and the whole shot was brighter, the whole section where the waiter is is very dark and it´s very hard to make out any details.  4 from me.', '2005-10-08 08:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769574, 240511, 27482, '<td valign="top">I can see where you were going with this but to be honest I don´t really like the outcome, take that with a grain of salt though as I really HATE lens flare and in this picture it isn´t flattering at all IMHO.  I like the idea though, having a sunset in the backround but next time I would suggest you meter the whole scene according to the sun so that it´s not as overexposed and use a flash to light up the spoon to get a more balanced outcome.  Also, if I might make a suggestion I would compose this almost the same but have the sun in the lower right corner instead of the middle but I like the placement of the spoon.  4 from me this time but I encourage you to try something like this again and experiment more with fill flash.</td>', 'I can see where you were going with this but to be honest I don´t really like the outcome, take that with a grain of salt though as I really HATE lens flare and in this picture it isn´t flattering at all IMHO.  I like the idea though, having a sunset in the backround but next time I would suggest you meter the whole scene according to the sun so that it´s not as overexposed and use a flash to light up the spoon to get a more balanced outcome.  Also, if I might make a suggestion I would compose this almost the same but have the sun in the lower right corner instead of the middle but I like the placement of the spoon.  4 from me this time but I encourage you to try something like this again and experiment more with fill flash.', '2005-10-08 08:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769577, 238696, 27482, '<td valign="top">A little bit grainy and dark for my taste but otherwise decent, I like the composition and DOF.  However, it´s a bit flat, wouldn´t a small "s-curve" improve this shot heaps?  5 from me.</td>', 'A little bit grainy and dark for my taste but otherwise decent, I like the composition and DOF.  However, it´s a bit flat, wouldn´t a small "s-curve" improve this shot heaps?  5 from me.', '2005-10-08 08:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769581, 240133, 27482, '<td valign="top">Jummy cake, wouldn´t mind a taste of that.  However, this shot could use some sharpening, either that or it´s slightly out of focus and I gave a 4 because of that, I would have given a 5 if it were tack sharp.</td>', 'Jummy cake, wouldn´t mind a taste of that.  However, this shot could use some sharpening, either that or it´s slightly out of focus and I gave a 4 because of that, I would have given a 5 if it were tack sharp.', '2005-10-08 08:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769583, 239995, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well, this shot is a bit hit and miss for me.  I like the use of a slow shutterspeed but the fact that her head is motion blurred is "off" for me, if her head would have been still and her hands more moved I would have liked this shot heaps more.  I like the composition though and the muted colours are fitting on one hand but on the other the backround with the people are too bright for my taste and draw too much attention.  I was going to give this shot a 5 but I liked the "feel" of it and bumped to 6.</td>', 'Well, this shot is a bit hit and miss for me.  I like the use of a slow shutterspeed but the fact that her head is motion blurred is "off" for me, if her head would have been still and her hands more moved I would have liked this shot heaps more.  I like the composition though and the muted colours are fitting on one hand but on the other the backround with the people are too bright for my taste and draw too much attention.  I was going to give this shot a 5 but I liked the "feel" of it and bumped to 6.', '2005-10-08 08:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769591, 240367, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the coffee is well exosed and the backround is fitting, nicely lit and well composed. <br/> <br/> I have to say though that I STRONGLY dislike the strong white frame with this relatively dark shot, it does nothing but draw my eye away from the shot.  I know I am being anal and I normally frown on people that comment on frames but I just think this one is way overboard...  I tried to ignore it for the vote though but I have a feeling I might have liked this shot more without the frame (or at least with a smaller frame...)  6 from me.</td>', 'Nice shot, the coffee is well exosed and the backround is fitting, nicely lit and well composed.   I have to say though that I STRONGLY dislike the strong white frame with this relatively dark shot, it does nothing but draw my eye away from the shot.  I know I am being anal and I normally frown on people that comment on frames but I just think this one is way overboard...  I tried to ignore it for the vote though but I have a feeling I might have liked this shot more without the frame (or at least with a smaller frame...)  6 from me.', '2005-10-08 08:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769596, 240397, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well... I must admit, this doesn´t really scream "coffee shop" to me as they are not normally placed on the beach under the open sky where I come from but of course I am going to give you the benefit of the doubt and assume that this is taken at an actual coffee shop.  I kindof like this shot but it could have been so much better if you did 2 things different (of course just my opinion)<br/> <br/>1.  Stood up just a little bit more and composed this more according to the rule of thirds, having the mounds the bottom third, the water the middle third and the sky the top third.<br/> <br/>2.  Had the whole shot in focus, having the sky out of the DOF is just distracting me, I would have wanted to see this whole shot within the DOF.<br/> <br/>Don´t get me wrong, I still like this shot and I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Well... I must admit, this doesn´t really scream "coffee shop" to me as they are not normally placed on the beach under the open sky where I come from but of course I am going to give you the benefit of the doubt and assume that this is taken at an actual coffee shop.  I kindof like this shot but it could have been so much better if you did 2 things different (of course just my opinion) 1.  Stood up just a little bit more and composed this more according to the rule of thirds, having the mounds the bottom third, the water the middle third and the sky the top third. 2.  Had the whole shot in focus, having the sky out of the DOF is just distracting me, I would have wanted to see this whole shot within the DOF. Don´t get me wrong, I still like this shot and I gave it a 7.', '2005-10-08 08:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769600, 239146, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, nice job, gives the shot some nice texture.  I am still not really fond of the cramped composition, I think I would have liked this shot more if it were further away or with a wider focal length, I can´t help being curious about the surroundings of the bowl and cup, especially since you placed that wierd object in the upper left corner that is out of focus.<br/> <br/>One of the better shots in the challenge, I gave it a 7.</td>', 'I like the lighting, nice job, gives the shot some nice texture.  I am still not really fond of the cramped composition, I think I would have liked this shot more if it were further away or with a wider focal length, I can´t help being curious about the surroundings of the bowl and cup, especially since you placed that wierd object in the upper left corner that is out of focus. One of the better shots in the challenge, I gave it a 7.', '2005-10-08 09:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769618, 237446, 31776, '<td valign="top">How does this relate to the challeng Coffee Shop, other than that nice photo</td>', 'How does this relate to the challeng Coffee Shop, other than that nice photo', '2005-10-08 09:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769624, 240060, 31776, '<td valign="top">I think the photo is a little too dark and out of focus</td>', 'I think the photo is a little too dark and out of focus', '2005-10-08 09:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769633, 240116, 25355, '<td valign="top">What? Seven people have to share this cup? ;-)</td>', 'What? Seven people have to share this cup? ;-)', '2005-10-08 09:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769637, 240288, 25355, '<td valign="top">And there I always thought a constitutional was a walk one takes for one''s health.</td>', 'And there I always thought a constitutional was a walk one takes for one''s health.', '2005-10-08 09:46:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1769642, 239819, 25355, '<td valign="top">That''s the most brilliant photo  I''ve ever seen of a baseball. I just wished it brought to mind coffee shops. I''ll try again ... oh, maybe some specialist baseball themed coffee shop, but it doesn''t quite fit this challenge.</td>', 'That''s the most brilliant photo  I''ve ever seen of a baseball. I just wished it brought to mind coffee shops. I''ll try again ... oh, maybe some specialist baseball themed coffee shop, but it doesn''t quite fit this challenge.', '2005-10-08 09:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769644, 240415, 25355, '<td valign="top">Well taken shot, but I fear that many voters will vote it down because they won''t associate green tea with coffee shops.</td>', 'Well taken shot, but I fear that many voters will vote it down because they won''t associate green tea with coffee shops.', '2005-10-08 09:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769646, 240427, 44829, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting!</td>', 'I love the lighting!', '2005-10-08 09:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769854, 239226, 45618, '<td valign="top">wonderfully kitchy</td>', 'wonderfully kitchy', '2005-10-08 12:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769949, 240601, 45615, '<td valign="top">A dramatic picture, lucky there''s a void to the right ;-)</td>', 'A dramatic picture, lucky there''s a void to the right ;-)', '2005-10-08 13:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769951, 239996, 45616, '<td valign="top">Capturing a moment... Black and white -- good to use in this scene - comforting, home.</td>', 'Capturing a moment... Black and white -- good to use in this scene - comforting, home.', '2005-10-08 13:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769953, 238746, 45615, '<td valign="top">Reluctant coffe?</td>', 'Reluctant coffe?', '2005-10-08 13:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769954, 239129, 45615, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white approach, it doesn''t look as "messy" that way.</td>', 'I like the black and white approach, it doesn''t look as "messy" that way.', '2005-10-08 13:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769956, 238144, 45615, '<td valign="top">Nice colors although I somewhat miss that some cups have been "cut" off the picture.</td>', 'Nice colors although I somewhat miss that some cups have been "cut" off the picture.', '2005-10-08 13:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769957, 239726, 45616, '<td valign="top">Neat - original to theme.   Like the milk/cream clouds ( predicting the uncertain day!)Window frame/ - pottery cup - nice old /comfort feel.</td>', 'Neat - original to theme.   Like the milk/cream clouds ( predicting the uncertain day!)Window frame/ - pottery cup - nice old /comfort feel.', '2005-10-08 13:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769960, 238962, 45615, '<td valign="top">Cool picture.  Only thing is I keep getting distracted by the bubble in the top left.</td>', 'Cool picture.  Only thing is I keep getting distracted by the bubble in the top left.', '2005-10-08 13:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769962, 239819, 45615, '<td valign="top">Not being american i find it a stretch to see the connection to coffee ;-)</td>', 'Not being american i find it a stretch to see the connection to coffee ;-)', '2005-10-08 13:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769964, 240437, 45615, '<td valign="top">There''s something to this image but I can''t really figure it out. Could be the grain or just that it isn''t very polished...</td>', 'There''s something to this image but I can''t really figure it out. Could be the grain or just that it isn''t very polished...', '2005-10-08 13:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
