(1769968, 239049, 45615, '<td valign="top">An instant in a café... doesn''t it tilt to the left?</td>', 'An instant in a café... doesn''t it tilt to the left?', '2005-10-08 13:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769972, 240177, 45615, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I like the contrast, I like the blue color!</td>', 'Nice shot! I like the contrast, I like the blue color!', '2005-10-08 13:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769973, 240427, 45616, '<td valign="top">Cool - interesting and unique concept.</td>', 'Cool - interesting and unique concept.', '2005-10-08 13:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769976, 238736, 45615, '<td valign="top">There''s an air to this image, well framed also!</td>', 'There''s an air to this image, well framed also!', '2005-10-08 13:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769977, 240346, 45615, '<td valign="top">I like it, I''d like it more without the date...</td>', 'I like it, I''d like it more without the date...', '2005-10-08 13:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769978, 238211, 45615, '<td valign="top">I think I would have avoided the people in the background.</td>', 'I think I would have avoided the people in the background.', '2005-10-08 13:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769980, 240014, 45616, '<td valign="top">Nice - crisp, use of red cup/saucer - the anticipation of being able to sip a coffee and have a great read.</td>', 'Nice - crisp, use of red cup/saucer - the anticipation of being able to sip a coffee and have a great read.', '2005-10-08 13:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769981, 239949, 45615, '<td valign="top">Nice. To be critical.... I miss the last inch or so in the right chair... ;-)</td>', 'Nice. To be critical.... I miss the last inch or so in the right chair... ;-)', '2005-10-08 13:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769982, 240509, 45615, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this photo!</td>', 'I like the perspective of this photo!', '2005-10-08 13:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769986, 239050, 45616, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clean</td>', 'Crisp, clean', '2005-10-08 13:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769987, 240394, 45616, '<td valign="top">Very cute -- made me smile.  Very creative.</td>', 'Very cute -- made me smile.  Very creative.', '2005-10-08 13:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769990, 239658, 45616, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot - the mirror reflection - the motion/movement</td>', 'Interesting shot - the mirror reflection - the motion/movement', '2005-10-08 13:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769991, 240293, 45615, '<td valign="top">Very clean.</td>', 'Very clean.', '2005-10-08 13:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769992, 240171, 45616, '<td valign="top">Neat shot - title - a common feel for a lot of people.  Original</td>', 'Neat shot - title - a common feel for a lot of people.  Original', '2005-10-08 13:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769993, 239049, 45616, '<td valign="top">Interesting - capturing a moment - can even be in it... nice use of black and white</td>', 'Interesting - capturing a moment - can even be in it... nice use of black and white', '2005-10-08 13:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769994, 239137, 45615, '<td valign="top">The title made me smile, and made me like the picture more ;-) I like the colors... and the mug!</td>', 'The title made me smile, and made me like the picture more ;-) I like the colors... and the mug!', '2005-10-08 13:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769995, 238746, 45616, '<td valign="top">Cool - original</td>', 'Cool - original', '2005-10-08 13:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769997, 239440, 45616, '<td valign="top">Talk about serving coffee with a fine art.    Neat place - neat shot</td>', 'Talk about serving coffee with a fine art.    Neat place - neat shot', '2005-10-08 13:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770001, 240009, 45615, '<td valign="top">Good idea!</td>', 'Good idea!', '2005-10-08 13:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770009, 240070, 45615, '<td valign="top">Great picture! I like the colors!</td>', 'Great picture! I like the colors!', '2005-10-08 13:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770012, 240502, 45615, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the backround material, it gives more life to the image.</td>', 'Nice. I like the backround material, it gives more life to the image.', '2005-10-08 13:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770053, 240437, 27482, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this shot a whole lot better if the hand and cup were in the same focus as the coins, just having them slightly out of focus like that makes me want to squint my eyes just to see them better and it irritates me.  Having said that though I like everything else about the shot, the lighting, the composition, the "feel" and colouration and gave this a 7.</td>', 'I would have liked this shot a whole lot better if the hand and cup were in the same focus as the coins, just having them slightly out of focus like that makes me want to squint my eyes just to see them better and it irritates me.  Having said that though I like everything else about the shot, the lighting, the composition, the "feel" and colouration and gave this a 7.', '2005-10-08 14:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770068, 237797, 27482, '<td valign="top">Two things I don´t like about the picture.<br/> <br/>1.  The cup is blocking the lightsource from getting to the cookies and that makes them a bit drab and lacking in texture, I would have liked this shot better if the cup were in the top right corner, not the top left.<br/> <br/>2.  The backround isn´t exactly fitting with the challenge theme, makes it pretty obvious that you took this at home since it´s just a wrinkled sheet but I didn´t vote as it was off topic.<br/> <br/>I like the rest, the lighting is good (if you exclude the cup in front of the lightsource bit), the image quality is good, the colours, sharpness and contrast and composition is above average.  Gave this a 6.</td>', 'Two things I don´t like about the picture. 1.  The cup is blocking the lightsource from getting to the cookies and that makes them a bit drab and lacking in texture, I would have liked this shot better if the cup were in the top right corner, not the top left. 2.  The backround isn´t exactly fitting with the challenge theme, makes it pretty obvious that you took this at home since it´s just a wrinkled sheet but I didn´t vote as it was off topic. I like the rest, the lighting is good (if you exclude the cup in front of the lightsource bit), the image quality is good, the colours, sharpness and contrast and composition is above average.  Gave this a 6.', '2005-10-08 14:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770083, 239819, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge?  A shame cause this shot is well lit, makes an boring baseball a bit interesting and makes me wonder about the history behind the ball but sorry, I don´t get how this ties in with "coffee shop" at all so I only gave it a 2, would probably have given this a 7 if it fitted the challenge IMHO.</td>', 'Wrong challenge?  A shame cause this shot is well lit, makes an boring baseball a bit interesting and makes me wonder about the history behind the ball but sorry, I don´t get how this ties in with "coffee shop" at all so I only gave it a 2, would probably have given this a 7 if it fitted the challenge IMHO.', '2005-10-08 14:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770085, 238915, 27482, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best "cup with coffee beans" shot in the challenge, I love the texture in the shot and gave this a 7.</td>', 'I think this is the best "cup with coffee beans" shot in the challenge, I love the texture in the shot and gave this a 7.', '2005-10-08 14:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770099, 238746, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lol!  Nice idea Daniel, you never cease to amaze me what you can pull out of your hat withi these basic editing rules, my hat goes off to you and I wouldn´t be surprised to see this close to, or even on top of this challenge.  Gave this an 8.  However, I must make one slight comment about the contrast in the image, to me it seems a bit flat, perhaps a slight "s-curve" would improve this a little bit?</td>', 'Lol!  Nice idea Daniel, you never cease to amaze me what you can pull out of your hat withi these basic editing rules, my hat goes off to you and I wouldn´t be surprised to see this close to, or even on top of this challenge.  Gave this an 8.  However, I must make one slight comment about the contrast in the image, to me it seems a bit flat, perhaps a slight "s-curve" would improve this a little bit?', '2005-10-08 14:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770107, 240603, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, one of the best entries in the challenge and I gave this an 8 in accordance with that and this is pretty flawless as an image, could very well be in a commercial as far as I am concerned, except for one thing.  I don´t know what it is specifically but the skintone isn´t very flattering, either it´s noise or wrong WB or something, it just looks oddly reddish, especially the hands, did you underexpose this shot and bring it back with shadow/highlights cause that might explain it?  Everything else is spot on, the focus, sharpness, colours and composition.</td>', 'Nice, one of the best entries in the challenge and I gave this an 8 in accordance with that and this is pretty flawless as an image, could very well be in a commercial as far as I am concerned, except for one thing.  I don´t know what it is specifically but the skintone isn´t very flattering, either it´s noise or wrong WB or something, it just looks oddly reddish, especially the hands, did you underexpose this shot and bring it back with shadow/highlights cause that might explain it?  Everything else is spot on, the focus, sharpness, colours and composition.', '2005-10-08 14:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770112, 240177, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry, gives those beans some interest apart from the tons of other shots with beans in them.  Lighting is a bit harsh though for my taste as you have some overexposed glare on some of the beans and also a shame this is a basic editing rules challenge as the white stuff on the backround is a bit distracting but other than that, very cool and one of the best in the challenge, gave this a 7.</td>', 'Nice symmetry, gives those beans some interest apart from the tons of other shots with beans in them.  Lighting is a bit harsh though for my taste as you have some overexposed glare on some of the beans and also a shame this is a basic editing rules challenge as the white stuff on the backround is a bit distracting but other than that, very cool and one of the best in the challenge, gave this a 7.', '2005-10-08 14:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770120, 240427, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wow, at first I didn´t notice the face in the coffee, I just clicked on "6" and went on to the next image but I felt I missed something so I came back and there it was and it really makes this image "pop".  Bumped up to 8 and well if the WB wasn´t so yellowish and the lighting a bit softer I might very well have given this a 10...  Nice work, hope most people noticed the face in the coffee, I have a feeling this might not score so well if they don´t notice it...</td>', 'Wow, at first I didn´t notice the face in the coffee, I just clicked on "6" and went on to the next image but I felt I missed something so I came back and there it was and it really makes this image "pop".  Bumped up to 8 and well if the WB wasn´t so yellowish and the lighting a bit softer I might very well have given this a 10...  Nice work, hope most people noticed the face in the coffee, I have a feeling this might not score so well if they don´t notice it...', '2005-10-08 14:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770131, 240070, 27482, '<td valign="top">Painted with light?  Anyway, however you did this I like the look, wether that be from painting with light or PP.  8 from me.</td>', 'Painted with light?  Anyway, however you did this I like the look, wether that be from painting with light or PP.  8 from me.', '2005-10-08 14:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770204, 239954, 43024, '<td valign="top">too much negative space in the upper part</td>', 'too much negative space in the upper part', '2005-10-08 15:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770209, 240117, 43024, '<td valign="top">coffee shop...camera..sun glasses...bored... not quite appealing to me, I say you could have done better, it is however interesting how you managed to take the picture without the reflection of the camera</td>', 'coffee shop...camera..sun glasses...bored... not quite appealing to me, I say you could have done better, it is however interesting how you managed to take the picture without the reflection of the camera', '2005-10-08 15:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770211, 239152, 43024, '<td valign="top">if sure had had better detail, this photo would have been much better, unfortunately Im not sure if sure is in fact sugar or milk or a defective spoon</td>', 'if sure had had better detail, this photo would have been much better, unfortunately Im not sure if sure is in fact sugar or milk or a defective spoon', '2005-10-08 15:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770213, 240063, 43024, '<td valign="top">nice light... but fork is not very clean and too centered. Good idea</td>', 'nice light... but fork is not very clean and too centered. Good idea', '2005-10-08 15:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770215, 239531, 43024, '<td valign="top">Sharpness</td>', 'Sharpness', '2005-10-08 15:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
