(1770713, 238783, 27482, '<td valign="top">Composition a bit too cramped for my taste, I would have liked to see a little bit more space around her head, specifically above it and to her right but other than that, very nice work.  Excellent job on the b/w conversion, the skin tone is good and technically everything is good.  7 from me.</td>', 'Composition a bit too cramped for my taste, I would have liked to see a little bit more space around her head, specifically above it and to her right but other than that, very nice work.  Excellent job on the b/w conversion, the skin tone is good and technically everything is good.  7 from me.', '2005-10-08 22:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770764, 240121, 10261, '<td valign="top">This would be a stronger photo if the woman was in focus rather than the image on the wall.</td>', 'This would be a stronger photo if the woman was in focus rather than the image on the wall.', '2005-10-08 23:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770773, 238181, 10261, '<td valign="top">Although the cup is positioned well against the tablecloth, I find the overall effect distracting. Perhaps having the scene lit only by the light reflected in the coffee and the rest painted with light would have created a more striking image.<br/></td>', 'Although the cup is positioned well against the tablecloth, I find the overall effect distracting. Perhaps having the scene lit only by the light reflected in the coffee and the rest painted with light would have created a more striking image.', '2005-10-08 23:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770785, 238736, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that a shallower DoF would have served you well here, helping to both freeze the motion of the author as well as blurring the shop across the street. Aside from the flowers and the red neon sign, the colors here are fairly unsaturated. While selective desaturation can serve as a powerful compositional aid, I can''t see any reason for it here. If it was intentional, having some clue in your title would help to bring it out. If not, reducing the saturation on at least the red/magenta channels would help to make the image look more uniform. See [url=//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=25]this[/url tutorial for info on how to selectively desaturate under Basic Editing rules.</td>', 'I think that a shallower DoF would have served you well here, helping to both freeze the motion of the author as well as blurring the shop across the street. Aside from the flowers and the red neon sign, the colors here are fairly unsaturated. While selective desaturation can serve as a powerful compositional aid, I can''t see any reason for it here. If it was intentional, having some clue in your title would help to bring it out. If not, reducing the saturation on at least the red/magenta channels would help to make the image look more uniform. See [url=//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=25]this[/url tutorial for info on how to selectively desaturate under Basic Editing rules.', '2005-10-08 23:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770790, 240609, 10261, '<td valign="top">Without the context of the challenge and the title, this looks rather unappealing. This looks like it was an attempt at a macro shot, but it''s not quite large enough to feel right. Having the bubbles lit more form the side would give them more depth. which would help this to look more dramatic.<br/></td>', 'Without the context of the challenge and the title, this looks rather unappealing. This looks like it was an attempt at a macro shot, but it''s not quite large enough to feel right. Having the bubbles lit more form the side would give them more depth. which would help this to look more dramatic.', '2005-10-08 23:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770794, 240259, 44202, '<td valign="top">Is this related to a coffee shop?</td>', 'Is this related to a coffee shop?', '2005-10-08 23:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770797, 240508, 44202, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch on the theme.</td>', 'A bit of a stretch on the theme.', '2005-10-08 23:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770804, 239995, 44202, '<td valign="top">One of the better photographs for catching the essence of the coffee shop.  I would have like to have seen the woman''s face without the motion.</td>', 'One of the better photographs for catching the essence of the coffee shop.  I would have like to have seen the woman''s face without the motion.', '2005-10-08 23:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770805, 240455, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure what this is, but I''m not a coffee drinker, so I may just be unfamiliar with this device. I think the shot would have been more interesting if you''d have cropped the image to focus on the wavy rings around the vertical bar on the right, removing everything but this and the surrounding chrome. This would have rendered the image more abstract and minimalistic. which I like, but often isn''t well received by the voters here.</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure what this is, but I''m not a coffee drinker, so I may just be unfamiliar with this device. I think the shot would have been more interesting if you''d have cropped the image to focus on the wavy rings around the vertical bar on the right, removing everything but this and the surrounding chrome. This would have rendered the image more abstract and minimalistic. which I like, but often isn''t well received by the voters here.', '2005-10-08 23:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770812, 240294, 44202, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot and while it has coffee in it I''m not getting the feeling of a coffee shop.</td>', 'This is a great shot and while it has coffee in it I''m not getting the feeling of a coffee shop.', '2005-10-08 23:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770816, 239531, 41675, '<td valign="top">I have given this photo a low score due to the blurriness and overcast yellow tones. Compared to other entries in this challenge, it doesn''t hold up as well for me. Looks like she has a pretty smile though.</td>', 'I have given this photo a low score due to the blurriness and overcast yellow tones. Compared to other entries in this challenge, it doesn''t hold up as well for me. Looks like she has a pretty smile though.', '2005-10-08 23:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770819, 237446, 41675, '<td valign="top">Uhmmm, I''m really trying to figure out what this has to do with coffee shops...and I have no idea. Therefore I have given it a low score.</td>', 'Uhmmm, I''m really trying to figure out what this has to do with coffee shops...and I have no idea. Therefore I have given it a low score.', '2005-10-08 23:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770821, 238142, 41675, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept, I just wish it was more in focus and less yellow/orange in color. Shows me you have creativity though.</td>', 'An interesting concept, I just wish it was more in focus and less yellow/orange in color. Shows me you have creativity though.', '2005-10-08 23:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770822, 240502, 10261, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W treatment does a good job of highlighting the texture in this shot, but I''m afraid that a lot of your texture is in the background, so your intended subject looks relatively flat and uninteresting. The thick border does a nice job of emphasizing the subject. The different shades of the coffee and the contrasting cups are a nice touch, but I think that it''d be more interesting if you added something to the cups to give them interest (e.g. a sugar cube floating in one, a sprig of mint in another, a cinnamon stick in the third, and a spoon in the fourth). The different cups and colors suggest similar variety in their users; seeing the hands of the drinkers might make this an interesting character study.</td>', 'The B&W treatment does a good job of highlighting the texture in this shot, but I''m afraid that a lot of your texture is in the background, so your intended subject looks relatively flat and uninteresting. The thick border does a nice job of emphasizing the subject. The different shades of the coffee and the contrasting cups are a nice touch, but I think that it''d be more interesting if you added something to the cups to give them interest (e.g. a sugar cube floating in one, a sprig of mint in another, a cinnamon stick in the third, and a spoon in the fourth). The different cups and colors suggest similar variety in their users; seeing the hands of the drinkers might make this an interesting character study.', '2005-10-08 23:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770825, 239158, 41675, '<td valign="top">If someone showed me this photo and asked me to guess the topic, I honestly don''t think the word coffee shop would ever come to me. Sorry.</td>', 'If someone showed me this photo and asked me to guess the topic, I honestly don''t think the word coffee shop would ever come to me. Sorry.', '2005-10-08 23:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770827, 239237, 44202, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and I like the contrasting colors with just a "hint" of the coffee shop in the back.  The shadow lines of the siding have such a pronounced role that I would like to have seen them in a purely horizontal position.</td>', 'Interesting shot and I like the contrasting colors with just a "hint" of the coffee shop in the back.  The shadow lines of the siding have such a pronounced role that I would like to have seen them in a purely horizontal position.', '2005-10-08 23:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770828, 239819, 41675, '<td valign="top">While this is a nice shot of a baseball, and even though I rarely go into coffee shops, I''m not sure this would be found in one. Kind of scratching my head on your choice of entries - hence my low score. Sorry.</td>', 'While this is a nice shot of a baseball, and even though I rarely go into coffee shops, I''m not sure this would be found in one. Kind of scratching my head on your choice of entries - hence my low score. Sorry.', '2005-10-08 23:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770832, 239996, 44202, '<td valign="top">You have captured life in the coffee shop - great job.</td>', 'You have captured life in the coffee shop - great job.', '2005-10-08 23:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770833, 240259, 41675, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s that I don''t go into that many coffee shops, but if someone showed me this photo and told me to guess the topic, I would never come up with the coffee shop. That''s why I''ve given you a low score. Sorry.</td>', 'Maybe it''s that I don''t go into that many coffee shops, but if someone showed me this photo and told me to guess the topic, I would never come up with the coffee shop. That''s why I''ve given you a low score. Sorry.', '2005-10-08 23:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770834, 237665, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, if your photo had been more in focus I would have scored it a point or two higher. I like the off centered composition though.</td>', 'For me, if your photo had been more in focus I would have scored it a point or two higher. I like the off centered composition though.', '2005-10-08 23:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770839, 240511, 41675, '<td valign="top">Uhmmm...if someone showed me this photo and asked me to guess the topic, I quite honestly would never guess "coffee shop" Therefore I have given you a low score.</td>', 'Uhmmm...if someone showed me this photo and asked me to guess the topic, I quite honestly would never guess "coffee shop" Therefore I have given you a low score.', '2005-10-08 23:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770842, 240413, 41675, '<td valign="top">In a coffee shop, perhaps, but with the overall grain and lack of focus, I have given you a low score. Sorry.</td>', 'In a coffee shop, perhaps, but with the overall grain and lack of focus, I have given you a low score. Sorry.', '2005-10-08 23:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770845, 240419, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''d like this a lot better if I had a stronger impression of what the figure in the background was like. While the person does make this more interesting, the extreme emphasis that the DoF places on that ubiquitous logo makes this look more like a piece of Starbucks promotional material than a photo most people would choose to look at. The logo is so large that I think that the DoF could be placed a bit farther back in the image and still keep the text legible. If the focus fell on a pencil poised over a piece of paper, a stack of textbooks, or a pair of reading glasses on the table in front of the figure this would have a lot more character.<br/></td>', 'I''d like this a lot better if I had a stronger impression of what the figure in the background was like. While the person does make this more interesting, the extreme emphasis that the DoF places on that ubiquitous logo makes this look more like a piece of Starbucks promotional material than a photo most people would choose to look at. The logo is so large that I think that the DoF could be placed a bit farther back in the image and still keep the text legible. If the focus fell on a pencil poised over a piece of paper, a stack of textbooks, or a pair of reading glasses on the table in front of the figure this would have a lot more character.', '2005-10-08 23:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770851, 238396, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge, but I don''t find the subject matter holds my interest as well as other entries. Perhaps if the table itself wasn''t in the middle of the photo or if there were spilled coffee by his feet, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge, but I don''t find the subject matter holds my interest as well as other entries. Perhaps if the table itself wasn''t in the middle of the photo or if there were spilled coffee by his feet, I would have scored it higher.', '2005-10-08 23:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770856, 240517, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is nicely done, but the back 2/3rds of the image seems rather crowded, while the front is entirely empty. I think that either cropping out the dead space, or moving the paper down to the bottom edge would help this feel much more balanced.<br/></td>', 'This is nicely done, but the back 2/3rds of the image seems rather crowded, while the front is entirely empty. I think that either cropping out the dead space, or moving the paper down to the bottom edge would help this feel much more balanced.', '2005-10-08 23:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770858, 240373, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, all I see in this shot are the lights...then my eyes go "oh look, there''s a man." Compared with other entries in the challenge, I don''t get the feel of a coffee shop. Sorry.</td>', 'For me, all I see in this shot are the lights...then my eyes go "oh look, there''s a man." Compared with other entries in the challenge, I don''t get the feel of a coffee shop. Sorry.', '2005-10-08 23:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770863, 240292, 10261, '<td valign="top">Nothing in this image seems to be in sharp focus. With such a narrow DoF this is particularly important.</td>', 'Nothing in this image seems to be in sharp focus. With such a narrow DoF this is particularly important.', '2005-10-08 23:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770866, 240197, 41675, '<td valign="top">This photo is so tight to the subjects I have a hard time discerning what they were. I now know they are disposed/dirty cups. The glare from the lighting it a bit harsh and for me, pulling back a bit further would help the viewer more easily recognize the subject.</td>', 'This photo is so tight to the subjects I have a hard time discerning what they were. I now know they are disposed/dirty cups. The glare from the lighting it a bit harsh and for me, pulling back a bit further would help the viewer more easily recognize the subject.', '2005-10-08 23:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770871, 238042, 41675, '<td valign="top">I Like the lighting in this photo. I wish there was a cup of coffee or something to help the viewer realize this was in a coffee shop of some sort. Also, my eyes keep drifting over to the person in the car outside the window - it''s kind of distracting, but I know you couldn''t help that.</td>', 'I Like the lighting in this photo. I wish there was a cup of coffee or something to help the viewer realize this was in a coffee shop of some sort. Also, my eyes keep drifting over to the person in the car outside the window - it''s kind of distracting, but I know you couldn''t help that.', '2005-10-08 23:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770874, 240361, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, had more of the foreground been cropped out I would have scored this better. I like your angle and concept though.</td>', 'For me, had more of the foreground been cropped out I would have scored this better. I like your angle and concept though.', '2005-10-08 23:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770875, 239453, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that this may have been stronger if everything to the right of the word "java" was cropped out, and more space given either to the sky above or the bridge to the left.<br/></td>', 'I think that this may have been stronger if everything to the right of the word "java" was cropped out, and more space given either to the sky above or the bridge to the left.', '2005-10-08 23:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770881, 240582, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the light highlights on the beans are a bit too harsh, plus the beans themselves appear out of focus to me. That''s why compared to other entries in this challenge I have chosen to give you a lower score. Sorry.</td>', 'For me, the light highlights on the beans are a bit too harsh, plus the beans themselves appear out of focus to me. That''s why compared to other entries in this challenge I have chosen to give you a lower score. Sorry.', '2005-10-08 23:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770885, 239510, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this is a nice snapshot of what looks to be a fun festival or celebration of some sort. My eyes kind of wander all over, but compared with other entries in this challenge, doesn''t hold my attention as well.</td>', 'For me, this is a nice snapshot of what looks to be a fun festival or celebration of some sort. My eyes kind of wander all over, but compared with other entries in this challenge, doesn''t hold my attention as well.', '2005-10-08 23:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770886, 240579, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if it either looked less posed or of it was hammed up quite a bit more. As it is, the model doesn''t seem quite committed enough to conveying the necessary mood for this to work as well as it might.<br/></td>', 'I would like this better if it either looked less posed or of it was hammed up quite a bit more. As it is, the model doesn''t seem quite committed enough to conveying the necessary mood for this to work as well as it might.', '2005-10-08 23:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770888, 239597, 41675, '<td valign="top">With a bit more focus, I would have scored this better. I like the variety of elements and your composition.</td>', 'With a bit more focus, I would have scored this better. I like the variety of elements and your composition.', '2005-10-08 23:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770890, 240609, 41675, '<td valign="top">While this isn''t a bad photo to me, it''s just such a tight closeup, I personally don''t find it all that appealing. If your shot showed a bit more or some of the cup/mug I would have scored it better. I do like the lighting though. :)</td>', 'While this isn''t a bad photo to me, it''s just such a tight closeup, I personally don''t find it all that appealing. If your shot showed a bit more or some of the cup/mug I would have scored it better. I do like the lighting though. :)', '2005-10-08 23:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770891, 238473, 41675, '<td valign="top">With a bit more focus I would have scored this higher. I like your composition and concept.</td>', 'With a bit more focus I would have scored this higher. I like your composition and concept.', '2005-10-08 23:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770892, 240548, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''ve chosen to give your photo a 4 because of the orange/yellow coloring, and I wish there was a coffee cup, mug or something on the table in the front to add a bit more interest. I do like your title - it made me smile.</td>', 'I''ve chosen to give your photo a 4 because of the orange/yellow coloring, and I wish there was a coffee cup, mug or something on the table in the front to add a bit more interest. I do like your title - it made me smile.', '2005-10-08 23:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770899, 239152, 10261, '<td valign="top">While the white background is okay, the sugar has crossed the line between high-key and overexposed. In general I think if you have to include text to make your image work, you should probably reconsider your approach to the subject. This might have been more interesting if it was more minimalistic; a B&amp;W shot of a single coffee bean half-buried in the sugar, for instance.</td>', 'While the white background is okay, the sugar has crossed the line between high-key and overexposed. In general I think if you have to include text to make your image work, you should probably reconsider your approach to the subject. This might have been more interesting if it was more minimalistic; a B&W shot of a single coffee bean half-buried in the sugar, for instance.', '2005-10-08 23:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770901, 239173, 41675, '<td valign="top">I wish the photo were a bit larger. The maximum to submit is 640 pixels and I think it helps the viewer when voting. Also, your title says boiling hot, but the man in your shot in no way expresses anything to go along with your title, so I found that a bit...odd.</td>', 'I wish the photo were a bit larger. The maximum to submit is 640 pixels and I think it helps the viewer when voting. Also, your title says boiling hot, but the man in your shot in no way expresses anything to go along with your title, so I found that a bit...odd.', '2005-10-08 23:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770903, 239237, 41675, '<td valign="top">Well, if I squint inside I do see the coffee pots, but it''s the blue frame and brown building that capture my focus. Compared with other entries in this challenge, it doesn''t hold my interest as much. 4</td>', 'Well, if I squint inside I do see the coffee pots, but it''s the blue frame and brown building that capture my focus. Compared with other entries in this challenge, it doesn''t hold my interest as much. 4', '2005-10-08 23:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770906, 240371, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and the composition isn''t too bad. Perhaps even keeping it a bit more off centered work help? Also, the lighting seems a bit bright to me, and if it was a bit more in focus all around (I like sharp pictures) I would have scored it better.</td>', 'I like your idea and the composition isn''t too bad. Perhaps even keeping it a bit more off centered work help? Also, the lighting seems a bit bright to me, and if it was a bit more in focus all around (I like sharp pictures) I would have scored it better.', '2005-10-08 23:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770907, 239173, 10261, '<td valign="top">The very small size of this image serves as a strike against it even before assessing the content, which isn''t particularly interesting. Filling the frame with the cup and the man''s face and using a shallow DoF to focus on one of these components would have been a good start.</td>', 'The very small size of this image serves as a strike against it even before assessing the content, which isn''t particularly interesting. Filling the frame with the cup and the man''s face and using a shallow DoF to focus on one of these components would have been a good start.', '2005-10-08 23:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770912, 237485, 41675, '<td valign="top">An interesting looking coffee shop. The first things my eyes went to when I look at your photo is the gentleman in the foreground. Then I follow his eyes and that leads me right out of the photo completely - thereby ignoring 2/3rds of your picture, and your photo appears pixelated on my screen. I do like the sepia tone you chose though.</td>', 'An interesting looking coffee shop. The first things my eyes went to when I look at your photo is the gentleman in the foreground. Then I follow his eyes and that leads me right out of the photo completely - thereby ignoring 2/3rds of your picture, and your photo appears pixelated on my screen. I do like the sepia tone you chose though.', '2005-10-08 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770918, 238260, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image is rather busy, and there doesn''t seem to be a strong payoff. Trading the contents of the bottom 2/3rds of the image with an attractive person behind the window sipping coffee in the clouds would have made this a dramatically more interesting composition.<br/></td>', 'This image is rather busy, and there doesn''t seem to be a strong payoff. Trading the contents of the bottom 2/3rds of the image with an attractive person behind the window sipping coffee in the clouds would have made this a dramatically more interesting composition.', '2005-10-08 23:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770922, 240508, 41675, '<td valign="top">While guitars can be found in coffee shops, this photo doesn''t appeal to me as well as others in the challenge. Perhaps I''m too much of a traditionalist. I do like the overall blue tones, it''s just something about the overwhelming sense of blurriness that I don''t care for. Sorry.</td>', 'While guitars can be found in coffee shops, this photo doesn''t appeal to me as well as others in the challenge. Perhaps I''m too much of a traditionalist. I do like the overall blue tones, it''s just something about the overwhelming sense of blurriness that I don''t care for. Sorry.', '2005-10-09 00:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770928, 240363, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the red is a bit too saturated overall, and I wonder if the cup itself was really that green color or more yellow? I like your concept though.</td>', 'For me, the red is a bit too saturated overall, and I wonder if the cup itself was really that green color or more yellow? I like your concept though.', '2005-10-09 00:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770929, 239149, 10261, '<td valign="top">The illumination here is odd, as though you played with the curves a bit too much and then oversharpened. The light in this scene exceeds the dynamic range of your camera; a tighter crop which focused on the table would have helped. A polarizing filter would have cut through the glare on the glass and allowed the painting to be visible to the camera.</td>', 'The illumination here is odd, as though you played with the curves a bit too much and then oversharpened. The light in this scene exceeds the dynamic range of your camera; a tighter crop which focused on the table would have helped. A polarizing filter would have cut through the glare on the glass and allowed the painting to be visible to the camera.', '2005-10-09 00:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770931, 240221, 41675, '<td valign="top">While this is definitely found in a coffee shop, it doesn''t hold the overall appeal to me as other entries in this challenge. Perhaps if there was a cup somewhere nearby, or maybe the brown item at the left completely cropped out, I would score it better.</td>', 'While this is definitely found in a coffee shop, it doesn''t hold the overall appeal to me as other entries in this challenge. Perhaps if there was a cup somewhere nearby, or maybe the brown item at the left completely cropped out, I would score it better.', '2005-10-09 00:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770933, 240361, 10261, '<td valign="top">The angled railing in the foreground adds compositional interest, but I think that too much space was given to it and not quite enough to the waiter; his head is uncomfortably close to the edge of the frame.<br/></td>', 'The angled railing in the foreground adds compositional interest, but I think that too much space was given to it and not quite enough to the waiter; his head is uncomfortably close to the edge of the frame.', '2005-10-09 00:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770935, 240458, 41675, '<td valign="top">Someone must really like this doll as I have seen it in a few recent challenges. Guess it''s kind of like the person who uses those wood figures. Anyhow, if someone presented me this photo and asked me to guess the topic, I don''t think I would ever guess coffee shop. Yes, I do see the coffee, but for me, my eyes stay focused on the doll. Sorry.</td>', 'Someone must really like this doll as I have seen it in a few recent challenges. Guess it''s kind of like the person who uses those wood figures. Anyhow, if someone presented me this photo and asked me to guess the topic, I don''t think I would ever guess coffee shop. Yes, I do see the coffee, but for me, my eyes stay focused on the doll. Sorry.', '2005-10-09 00:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770936, 239564, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this photo is way too overblown with the whites. Perhaps you intended for the very high contrast, but personally I''m not a fan of those photos. Sorry.</td>', 'For me, this photo is way too overblown with the whites. Perhaps you intended for the very high contrast, but personally I''m not a fan of those photos. Sorry.', '2005-10-09 00:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770939, 239152, 41675, '<td valign="top">If the white wasn''t quite so bright (donning my sunglasses) :-) I would have scored this higher. I like your idea alot though. Shows creativity.</td>', 'If the white wasn''t quite so bright (donning my sunglasses) :-) I would have scored this higher. I like your idea alot though. Shows creativity.', '2005-10-09 00:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770942, 240474, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the tones you chose for this photo, but I wish the grinder itself wasn''t cut off. Also, the table covering is distracting to me. Nice to see something a bit different from coffee beans though.</td>', 'I like the tones you chose for this photo, but I wish the grinder itself wasn''t cut off. Also, the table covering is distracting to me. Nice to see something a bit different from coffee beans though.', '2005-10-09 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770943, 237485, 10261, '<td valign="top">Compression artifacts and halos from sharpening are clearly visible in this image, which detracts from an otherwise solid shot. Selecting an area of interest and cropping more tightly would have removed a lot of the high-contrast edges (one of the factors which will cause a jpeg to quickly increase in size) and allowed you to use a lower compression.<br/></td>', 'Compression artifacts and halos from sharpening are clearly visible in this image, which detracts from an otherwise solid shot. Selecting an area of interest and cropping more tightly would have removed a lot of the high-contrast edges (one of the factors which will cause a jpeg to quickly increase in size) and allowed you to use a lower compression.', '2005-10-09 00:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770948, 239741, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image seems to be lacking something. The strong contrast between the cup and the background is quite striking, but this high contrast seems to break down inside the cup. Perhaps rich, brown coffee with a sugar cube or mint sprig floating in it would have helped to complete the composition. Even so, this is my favorite image in the challenge so far.</td>', 'This image seems to be lacking something. The strong contrast between the cup and the background is quite striking, but this high contrast seems to break down inside the cup. Perhaps rich, brown coffee with a sugar cube or mint sprig floating in it would have helped to complete the composition. Even so, this is my favorite image in the challenge so far.', '2005-10-09 00:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770953, 240562, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this photo is a bit bright. (Too much flash?) I do like the angle though</td>', 'For me, this photo is a bit bright. (Too much flash?) I do like the angle though', '2005-10-09 00:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770955, 239158, 10261, '<td valign="top">If this were sharper (allowing the features to be more readily identifiable) or more abstract this would work much better. As it is, it has enough recognizable features to make me try for a literal interpretation, and nothing I can identify is particularly interesting.</td>', 'If this were sharper (allowing the features to be more readily identifiable) or more abstract this would work much better. As it is, it has enough recognizable features to make me try for a literal interpretation, and nothing I can identify is particularly interesting.', '2005-10-09 00:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770968, 240177, 10261, '<td valign="top">The speck in the bottom right corner is distracting, as is the obvious over-sharpening. The leading lines make for a strong composition. The odd shadows suggest that this was painted with light, which I think worked well. I wouldn''t be surprised to see this in the top ten once the challenge ends. I think that a little more attention to detail could have made this a shoe-in for a ribbon.<br/> <br/></td>', 'The speck in the bottom right corner is distracting, as is the obvious over-sharpening. The leading lines make for a strong composition. The odd shadows suggest that this was painted with light, which I think worked well. I wouldn''t be surprised to see this in the top ten once the challenge ends. I think that a little more attention to detail could have made this a shoe-in for a ribbon. ', '2005-10-09 00:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1770984, 240536, 10261, '<td valign="top">I love the bokeh and the indistinct contour along the bottom edge. The only things I''d change would be to (1) remove the white part of the border (or make it a less pure white - it creates too much tension between it and the off-white cup) and (2) alter the focus on the cup (either softer or tack-sharp focus would work, but as it is this looks just far enough from focus to look unintentional). I love the subtle interplay of warm and cool colors in the background. I don''t normally go for anything that consists almost exclusively of a company logo, but you nailed everything else so well that I can''t help but love this. This is easily my favorite image so far in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the bokeh and the indistinct contour along the bottom edge. The only things I''d change would be to (1) remove the white part of the border (or make it a less pure white - it creates too much tension between it and the off-white cup) and (2) alter the focus on the cup (either softer or tack-sharp focus would work, but as it is this looks just far enough from focus to look unintentional). I love the subtle interplay of warm and cool colors in the background. I don''t normally go for anything that consists almost exclusively of a company logo, but you nailed everything else so well that I can''t help but love this. This is easily my favorite image so far in the challenge.', '2005-10-09 00:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771002, 239581, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''m curious to know how you did the skull &amp; crossbones effect, but somehow the image looks too staged to effectively tell the intended story. The model''s lack of strong expression would be fine if she weren''t making eye contact with the camera, but a stronger look is required from someone caught poisoning someone''s coffee.<br/> <br/>The bright white of the coffee cup and the edge of the counter top draw unnecessary attention to them. Using a brighter light from farther away or softening up the light that fell on those objects would have helped to reduce this distraction. I would have liked the border better if it were darker (closer to a forest green).</td>', 'I''m curious to know how you did the skull & crossbones effect, but somehow the image looks too staged to effectively tell the intended story. The model''s lack of strong expression would be fine if she weren''t making eye contact with the camera, but a stronger look is required from someone caught poisoning someone''s coffee. The bright white of the coffee cup and the edge of the counter top draw unnecessary attention to them. Using a brighter light from farther away or softening up the light that fell on those objects would have helped to reduce this distraction. I would have liked the border better if it were darker (closer to a forest green).', '2005-10-09 00:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771005, 237467, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''d like this image better if it were a little less crowded.</td>', 'I''d like this image better if it were a little less crowded.', '2005-10-09 00:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771018, 240562, 10261, '<td valign="top">The salt is overexposed; placing it behind the pepper would have helped. I''m intrigued by the reflections in the silver caps on these containers; a shot from above of this reflection might have been quite interesting.</td>', 'The salt is overexposed; placing it behind the pepper would have helped. I''m intrigued by the reflections in the silver caps on these containers; a shot from above of this reflection might have been quite interesting.', '2005-10-09 00:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771019, 239658, 10261, '<td valign="top">The reflection adds a lot to this image.</td>', 'The reflection adds a lot to this image.', '2005-10-09 00:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771031, 240437, 10261, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know that Joey Lawrence operated a coffee shop. I can''t say that this looks like someplace where I''d purchase something to consume, but it''s a striking photo. The film grain and dirt contribute nicely to the grunge effect, but I think that higher contrast might have given this enough of a kick to push it into ribbon territory. I find both the gold ring and the lipstick on the cup intriguing elements, and I think that either removing them or emphasizing them a bit more could make this interesting image that much better.</td>', 'I didn''t know that Joey Lawrence operated a coffee shop. I can''t say that this looks like someplace where I''d purchase something to consume, but it''s a striking photo. The film grain and dirt contribute nicely to the grunge effect, but I think that higher contrast might have given this enough of a kick to push it into ribbon territory. I find both the gold ring and the lipstick on the cup intriguing elements, and I think that either removing them or emphasizing them a bit more could make this interesting image that much better.', '2005-10-09 00:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771037, 240548, 10261, '<td valign="top">The closest table leg and the legs and seat of the table occupy much more of the image than their contribution to the scene justify. The orange cast would look more like atmosphere than a technical problem if it weren''t so pervasive; adding an oasis or two of cool colors would add a lot of balance.</td>', 'The closest table leg and the legs and seat of the table occupy much more of the image than their contribution to the scene justify. The orange cast would look more like atmosphere than a technical problem if it weren''t so pervasive; adding an oasis or two of cool colors would add a lot of balance.', '2005-10-09 00:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771042, 239049, 10261, '<td valign="top">Harsher, less diffused light on the man''s face and sharper focus would give this photo a big kick.</td>', 'Harsher, less diffused light on the man''s face and sharper focus would give this photo a big kick.', '2005-10-09 00:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771051, 239590, 10261, '<td valign="top">This would feel more like your art than a picture of someone else''s if there was a more human touch to it. A hand, a shadow, a reflection, or a touch of handwriting on the back of a postcard would have made this much more interesting.</td>', 'This would feel more like your art than a picture of someone else''s if there was a more human touch to it. A hand, a shadow, a reflection, or a touch of handwriting on the back of a postcard would have made this much more interesting.', '2005-10-09 00:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771056, 238746, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the illusion would be much more engaging if the little man didn''t look so flat.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the illusion would be much more engaging if the little man didn''t look so flat.', '2005-10-09 01:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771058, 240117, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that this would be more interesting if the girl looked more flirtatious and less tired. The POV is interesting.</td>', 'I think that this would be more interesting if the girl looked more flirtatious and less tired. The POV is interesting.', '2005-10-09 01:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771062, 238189, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would like this a lot better if the image were larger and didn''t look oversharpened. I appreciate your novel approach to the challenge; a flower who''s petals contrasted more with the color of the beans (yellow, for example) might have had more of an impact.</td>', 'I would like this a lot better if the image were larger and didn''t look oversharpened. I appreciate your novel approach to the challenge; a flower who''s petals contrasted more with the color of the beans (yellow, for example) might have had more of an impact.', '2005-10-09 01:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771065, 240294, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''d like this better if it looked more like it was taken in a coffee shop than in a studio.</td>', 'I''d like this better if it looked more like it was taken in a coffee shop than in a studio.', '2005-10-09 01:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771066, 240280, 37392, '<td valign="top">Good  Concept, i think than this is a good picture</td>', 'Good  Concept, i think than this is a good picture', '2005-10-09 01:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771070, 240397, 37392, '<td valign="top">pefect Idea, but  its  unfocus, just a 6</td>', 'pefect Idea, but  its  unfocus, just a 6', '2005-10-09 01:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771093, 240585, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''d like this a lot better if the barrista''s eyes weren''t covered by her hair. The overexposed metal in the bottom left and the milk jug along the bottom edge are somewhat distracting.</td>', 'I''d like this a lot better if the barrista''s eyes weren''t covered by her hair. The overexposed metal in the bottom left and the milk jug along the bottom edge are somewhat distracting.', '2005-10-09 01:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771094, 240171, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks like it''s one of the stronger photos in the challenge. If it were larger I''d be better able to determine it''s quality.</td>', 'This looks like it''s one of the stronger photos in the challenge. If it were larger I''d be better able to determine it''s quality.', '2005-10-09 01:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771109, 239996, 10261, '<td valign="top">The freckles on the arm of the woman on the bottom left seem to contain the constellation Scorpio. I find this far more meaningful than any horoscope that I''ve ever read. I can''t see anything wrong with this image, but there''s also nothing about it that suggests that it wasn''t taken by someone''s grandmother with a point and shoot camera.</td>', 'The freckles on the arm of the woman on the bottom left seem to contain the constellation Scorpio. I find this far more meaningful than any horoscope that I''ve ever read. I can''t see anything wrong with this image, but there''s also nothing about it that suggests that it wasn''t taken by someone''s grandmother with a point and shoot camera.', '2005-10-09 01:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771116, 239564, 10261, '<td valign="top">Without the title I''d have never figured out what this was. Without the cup, it would have been difficult to even judge the scale of what I''m looking at. I find the odd off-white color cast somewhat distracting. This might have been a lot more interesting if you''d have pushed the saturation much higher than it was originally rather than rendering this in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Without the title I''d have never figured out what this was. Without the cup, it would have been difficult to even judge the scale of what I''m looking at. I find the odd off-white color cast somewhat distracting. This might have been a lot more interesting if you''d have pushed the saturation much higher than it was originally rather than rendering this in B&W.', '2005-10-09 01:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771149, 240603, 14773, '<td valign="top">Great photo...very billboard.</td>', 'Great photo...very billboard.', '2005-10-09 01:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771197, 239231, 35444, '<td valign="top">I really love the lines in this photograph and the compostion.</td>', 'I really love the lines in this photograph and the compostion.', '2005-10-09 02:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771248, 238746, 42840, '<td valign="top">excellant picture.. i''ll rate it high. hope it gets the ribbon</td>', 'excellant picture.. i''ll rate it high. hope it gets the ribbon', '2005-10-09 03:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771249, 240280, 30129, '<td valign="top">Like it a lot, great use of rule of thirds.</td>', 'Like it a lot, great use of rule of thirds.', '2005-10-09 03:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771251, 238736, 30129, '<td valign="top">Framing and layout work, but image seems flat or lifeless, would like to see a little more to draw me in.</td>', 'Framing and layout work, but image seems flat or lifeless, would like to see a little more to draw me in.', '2005-10-09 03:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771252, 239485, 30129, '<td valign="top">The perspective throws me but interesting shot none the less</td>', 'The perspective throws me but interesting shot none the less', '2005-10-09 03:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
