(1771269, 240060, 41735, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting is too dark</td>', 'I think the lighting is too dark', '2005-10-09 03:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771273, 240288, 42840, '<td valign="top">boring</td>', 'boring', '2005-10-09 03:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771275, 239435, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was taken in someone''s home. Unless this person supplys a local coffee shop, buying even one of these bags is a strong indication that they have a problem.<br/> <br/>On a technical note, this seems to have been taken using a flash, which has thoroughly overexposed the banisters, walls and stairs. The composition isn''t interesting, and if not for the word "coffee" printed on one of the sacks it wouldn''t even seem relevant to the challenge (and even at that, this doesn''t seem to involve a coffee shop). Assuming that at least one of these bags contains coffee beans, a much more interesting image could have been produced by impressing the viewer with the sheer quantity of beans (a surface covered with coffee beans interrupted by a hand reaching out from underneath with a full cup, a broken piggy bank with beans spilling out, etc.).</td>', 'This looks like it was taken in someone''s home. Unless this person supplys a local coffee shop, buying even one of these bags is a strong indication that they have a problem. On a technical note, this seems to have been taken using a flash, which has thoroughly overexposed the banisters, walls and stairs. The composition isn''t interesting, and if not for the word "coffee" printed on one of the sacks it wouldn''t even seem relevant to the challenge (and even at that, this doesn''t seem to involve a coffee shop). Assuming that at least one of these bags contains coffee beans, a much more interesting image could have been produced by impressing the viewer with the sheer quantity of beans (a surface covered with coffee beans interrupted by a hand reaching out from underneath with a full cup, a broken piggy bank with beans spilling out, etc.).', '2005-10-09 03:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771276, 237485, 42840, '<td valign="top">really nice photo.. luv the shades.. a bit too many flash marks on the wall.. but otherwise rate 8</td>', 'really nice photo.. luv the shades.. a bit too many flash marks on the wall.. but otherwise rate 8', '2005-10-09 03:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771277, 240216, 42840, '<td valign="top">beautful capture.. excellant</td>', 'beautful capture.. excellant', '2005-10-09 03:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771280, 240572, 42840, '<td valign="top">so many have used beans as a picture model. try sumthin new n innovative</td>', 'so many have used beans as a picture model. try sumthin new n innovative', '2005-10-09 03:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771284, 240511, 42840, '<td valign="top">whats that to do with coffee shop</td>', 'whats that to do with coffee shop', '2005-10-09 03:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771285, 240141, 42840, '<td valign="top">face is too dark.. cant see much of the guy.. its in the mid between clear and silhoutte.. doesnt do it justice.. can see the watch better than the face</td>', 'face is too dark.. cant see much of the guy.. its in the mid between clear and silhoutte.. doesnt do it justice.. can see the watch better than the face', '2005-10-09 03:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771286, 240436, 10261, '<td valign="top">Your model is cute, but this looks far too staged to elicit my interest in the intended narrative. Technically this is well executed, although a slightly slower shutter speed would have drawn more attention to the cup''s motion. It might have been more interesting to fill the frame with a shot of the coffee splashing as it hit the ground (although this would mean saving your model for another shoot).</td>', 'Your model is cute, but this looks far too staged to elicit my interest in the intended narrative. Technically this is well executed, although a slightly slower shutter speed would have drawn more attention to the cup''s motion. It might have been more interesting to fill the frame with a shot of the coffee splashing as it hit the ground (although this would mean saving your model for another shoot).', '2005-10-09 03:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771292, 240259, 10261, '<td valign="top">Did you really mean to submit this image to the Coffee Shop challenge? It seems like it would be a better fit for the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_results.php?CHALLENGE_ID=385" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Your Corner of the World II</a> or even the [//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_results.php?CHALLENGE_ID=387]Complementary Colors II[/url] challenge. If this really does relate to this challenge, indicating how in the title would be a good idea.<br/> <br/>On a technical note, this is a nice capture. Bouncing a little more light on the head of the lizard would have improved the image, but wild reptiles often don''t cooperate with the camera. The DoF is good, and the contrast between the subject and the background is well done. Cropping out the brown spot on the leaf in the bottom right corner would have helped to keep the viewer''s eyes from wandering out of the image. If this had been a challenge under the Advanced Editing rule set cloning out the brown thing behind the branch by the lizard''s head would have been nice.</td>', 'Did you really mean to submit this image to the Coffee Shop challenge? It seems like it would be a better fit for the Your Corner of the World II or even the [//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_results.php?CHALLENGE_ID=387]Complementary Colors II[/url] challenge. If this really does relate to this challenge, indicating how in the title would be a good idea. On a technical note, this is a nice capture. Bouncing a little more light on the head of the lizard would have improved the image, but wild reptiles often don''t cooperate with the camera. The DoF is good, and the contrast between the subject and the background is well done. Cropping out the brown spot on the leaf in the bottom right corner would have helped to keep the viewer''s eyes from wandering out of the image. If this had been a challenge under the Advanced Editing rule set cloning out the brown thing behind the branch by the lizard''s head would have been nice.', '2005-10-09 03:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771294, 238935, 10261, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be sharpest on the plate; a deeper DoF would have helped to put both the beverage and the food in focus and render the background slightly blurry. The crumbs on the plate are somewhat distracting, but mostly because they seem accidental. If there were more crumbs they wouldn''t stand out so much.</td>', 'The focus seems to be sharpest on the plate; a deeper DoF would have helped to put both the beverage and the food in focus and render the background slightly blurry. The crumbs on the plate are somewhat distracting, but mostly because they seem accidental. If there were more crumbs they wouldn''t stand out so much.', '2005-10-09 03:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771296, 239531, 10261, '<td valign="top">The motion blur and color cast wouldn''t be a problem if they looked like a creative decision, but the fact that the table and chair behind the girl appear to be in similar focus it feels more like a flaw. A crop which included only her face and the coffee cup might have made this more interesting.</td>', 'The motion blur and color cast wouldn''t be a problem if they looked like a creative decision, but the fact that the table and chair behind the girl appear to be in similar focus it feels more like a flaw. A crop which included only her face and the coffee cup might have made this more interesting.', '2005-10-09 03:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771297, 239440, 10261, '<td valign="top">Taking this from higher above the kiosk with a fisheye lens might have helped to further accentuate the circle theme.</td>', 'Taking this from higher above the kiosk with a fisheye lens might have helped to further accentuate the circle theme.', '2005-10-09 03:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771300, 240116, 10261, '<td valign="top">What significance do the names written on the side of the glass have? There are 7 names and only 6 straws, so my initial thought that this was to be split between the named individuals seems unlikely. My attempt to find a reason for these prominent elements of the composition overshadows my appreciation of the image.<br/> <br/>From a technical perspective the foam and edge of the lid are overexposed. The straws, money and cup are all well arranged and the DoF is well done.</td>', 'What significance do the names written on the side of the glass have? There are 7 names and only 6 straws, so my initial thought that this was to be split between the named individuals seems unlikely. My attempt to find a reason for these prominent elements of the composition overshadows my appreciation of the image. From a technical perspective the foam and edge of the lid are overexposed. The straws, money and cup are all well arranged and the DoF is well done.', '2005-10-09 04:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771302, 240063, 10261, '<td valign="top">I imagine that dirty forks are present in coffee shops, but this still seems too uninteresting and off topic to capture my interest.</td>', 'I imagine that dirty forks are present in coffee shops, but this still seems too uninteresting and off topic to capture my interest.', '2005-10-09 04:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771305, 240082, 39919, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this photo.  I like the lighting, I like the shadows, I like the color, I like the grain on the table, I like the amount of coffee in the cup, I like the fact that I can read the text....</td>', 'I like everything about this photo.  I like the lighting, I like the shadows, I like the color, I like the grain on the table, I like the amount of coffee in the cup, I like the fact that I can read the text....', '2005-10-09 04:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771307, 238446, 10261, '<td valign="top">The DoF is okay, but I suspect that the woodgrain in front of the cup wasn''t the intended subject. Moving the point of optical focus to the intended subject would improve this image.</td>', 'The DoF is okay, but I suspect that the woodgrain in front of the cup wasn''t the intended subject. Moving the point of optical focus to the intended subject would improve this image.', '2005-10-09 04:18:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1771308, 238396, 39919, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, pukey colors, overblown highlights</td>', 'Out of focus, pukey colors, overblown highlights', '2005-10-09 04:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771309, 239484, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast. This looks a little oversharpened though.</td>', 'I like the high contrast. This looks a little oversharpened though.', '2005-10-09 04:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771312, 239578, 10261, '<td valign="top">Did the coffee grounds intended for the left cup revolt? What''s with the debris on the otherwise white background? "Casualties of Coffeehouse Warfare" does make a catchy title though.</td>', 'Did the coffee grounds intended for the left cup revolt? What''s with the debris on the otherwise white background? "Casualties of Coffeehouse Warfare" does make a catchy title though.', '2005-10-09 04:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771313, 240175, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the border, and the speck at 3 o''clock is distracting. The brown color cast accentuates the theme of the image. The contrast between the palate of the subject and the blue reflection feels somewhat odd. You may wish to check out <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=25" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this tutorial</a> for info on removing or shifting the blue to a warmer color.<br/></td>', 'I don''t care for the border, and the speck at 3 o''clock is distracting. The brown color cast accentuates the theme of the image. The contrast between the palate of the subject and the blue reflection feels somewhat odd. You may wish to check out this tutorial for info on removing or shifting the blue to a warmer color.', '2005-10-09 04:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771314, 240511, 10261, '<td valign="top">The relationship between the subject of this image and the challenge topic seems very tenuous at best. The image is rather novel though, and the shot is reasonably well executed.</td>', 'The relationship between the subject of this image and the challenge topic seems very tenuous at best. The image is rather novel though, and the shot is reasonably well executed.', '2005-10-09 04:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771315, 240509, 10261, '<td valign="top">I really like the balance and textures in this shot. The only thing I''d change would be to remove whatever that is peeking in the frame at 12 o''clock. This is one of my top picks for a ribbon in this challenge.</td>', 'I really like the balance and textures in this shot. The only thing I''d change would be to remove whatever that is peeking in the frame at 12 o''clock. This is one of my top picks for a ribbon in this challenge.', '2005-10-09 04:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771321, 238967, 10261, '<td valign="top">Something about this scene makes everything (particularly the plant) look fake. Too much sharpening &amp;/or NeatImage, perhaps? Aside from looking artificial, I really like the composition of this shot; the only thing I think I''d change would be to make the distance between the edges of the frame and the subjects (particularly reed and the bottom corner of the trey) more even.</td>', 'Something about this scene makes everything (particularly the plant) look fake. Too much sharpening &/or NeatImage, perhaps? Aside from looking artificial, I really like the composition of this shot; the only thing I think I''d change would be to make the distance between the edges of the frame and the subjects (particularly reed and the bottom corner of the trey) more even.', '2005-10-09 04:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771327, 237918, 10261, '<td valign="top">The shadow is very well done. A catchlight in the surface of the coffee would have been nice. The faint color shadows along the bottom edge are a little distracting. Since they seem to be mostly green/yellow you might have been able to remove them with <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=25" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">selective desaturation</a>.</td>', 'The shadow is very well done. A catchlight in the surface of the coffee would have been nice. The faint color shadows along the bottom edge are a little distracting. Since they seem to be mostly green/yellow you might have been able to remove them with selective desaturation.', '2005-10-09 04:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771329, 240178, 10261, '<td valign="top">I love the shadows the blinds cast on the leaves. Seeing steam rising from the cup would have been a nice touch.</td>', 'I love the shadows the blinds cast on the leaves. Seeing steam rising from the cup would have been a nice touch.', '2005-10-09 04:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771335, 240346, 10261, '<td valign="top">The date in the bottom corner and the hanging thing by the window are distracting. The color cast does a good job of creating a feeling of atmosphere.</td>', 'The date in the bottom corner and the hanging thing by the window are distracting. The color cast does a good job of creating a feeling of atmosphere.', '2005-10-09 04:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771336, 240070, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the polished, industrial look, but something about this image make it look artificial. Too much sharpening or NeatImage perhaps?</td>', 'I like the polished, industrial look, but something about this image make it look artificial. Too much sharpening or NeatImage perhaps?', '2005-10-09 04:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771338, 238396, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you points for novelty, but aside from the geometry this isn''t a particularly interesting shot.</td>', 'I''ll give you points for novelty, but aside from the geometry this isn''t a particularly interesting shot.', '2005-10-09 04:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771341, 239902, 10261, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the sign and the deep blue sky is good, but frankly I find the color of the sky the most interesting part of this image.</td>', 'The contrast between the sign and the deep blue sky is good, but frankly I find the color of the sky the most interesting part of this image.', '2005-10-09 04:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771344, 239819, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a good studio shot of a used baseball, but I can''t imagine how this even remotely relates to the challenge.</td>', 'This is a good studio shot of a used baseball, but I can''t imagine how this even remotely relates to the challenge.', '2005-10-09 04:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771347, 237446, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely, serene shot, but I can''t see how it even remotely relates to the Coffee Shot challenge. Did you miss the deadline on the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_results.php?CHALLENGE_ID=385" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Your Corner of the World II</a> challenge?</td>', 'This is a lovely, serene shot, but I can''t see how it even remotely relates to the Coffee Shot challenge. Did you miss the deadline on the Your Corner of the World II challenge?', '2005-10-09 04:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771348, 239237, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that that thing in the left side of the bottom right pane might be a coffee pot, but even if it is the relation of this image to the challenge topic is quite a stretch.</td>', 'I think that that thing in the left side of the bottom right pane might be a coffee pot, but even if it is the relation of this image to the challenge topic is quite a stretch.', '2005-10-09 04:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771354, 237893, 21216, '<td valign="top">A little too bright which makes the cup appear a little blurred as well. But I like the idea, the cup as the mistical sense and when centered it doesn''t throw your attention at the other clutter around. Two more suggestions, the toning is too warm, adding a little blue would help and you should have included the rest of the shadow it would have added a nice touch to the picture.</td>', 'A little too bright which makes the cup appear a little blurred as well. But I like the idea, the cup as the mistical sense and when centered it doesn''t throw your attention at the other clutter around. Two more suggestions, the toning is too warm, adding a little blue would help and you should have included the rest of the shadow it would have added a nice touch to the picture.', '2005-10-09 05:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771355, 240603, 10261, '<td valign="top">Aren''t shirts like this supposed to end before the bottom of the rib cage? Maybe I''ve just never seen such a shirt intact. The combination of the light and the shirt might be responsible, but the model''s skin looks a little odd; it almost looks like you increased the saturation on the red or magenta channel to make the shirt contrast more with the coffee cup and it threw off her skin tone.<br/> <br/>The crop makes this shot interesting. A little steam rising from the cup would have been nice,  as would increasing the saturation of the cup a bit. This is one of the more memorable images in the challenge. Most of the impact is due to the subject and composition rather than the technical photographic execution; both of the former are good, but I can''t help but think that something equally striking could have been done with the execution (shooting a similar crop of the girl reflected in a coffee cup perhaps).</td>', 'Aren''t shirts like this supposed to end before the bottom of the rib cage? Maybe I''ve just never seen such a shirt intact. The combination of the light and the shirt might be responsible, but the model''s skin looks a little odd; it almost looks like you increased the saturation on the red or magenta channel to make the shirt contrast more with the coffee cup and it threw off her skin tone. The crop makes this shot interesting. A little steam rising from the cup would have been nice,  as would increasing the saturation of the cup a bit. This is one of the more memorable images in the challenge. Most of the impact is due to the subject and composition rather than the technical photographic execution; both of the former are good, but I can''t help but think that something equally striking could have been done with the execution (shooting a similar crop of the girl reflected in a coffee cup perhaps).', '2005-10-09 05:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771366, 240294, 21216, '<td valign="top">I''m loving the hat ;-) I have the sodier version. <br/> <br/>The composition is nice but I think You could have gone for something a bit more creative, this looks maybe a bit dull. The lighting could have been better, but it''s fine like this and one last itsy bitsy detail is that I may not be the biggest fan of the blue colored mug. But this still a great picture, with few adjustments it could be a ribbon.<br/> <br/>Dansvedanya!</td>', 'I''m loving the hat ;-) I have the sodier version.  The composition is nice but I think You could have gone for something a bit more creative, this looks maybe a bit dull. The lighting could have been better, but it''s fine like this and one last itsy bitsy detail is that I may not be the biggest fan of the blue colored mug. But this still a great picture, with few adjustments it could be a ribbon. Dansvedanya!', '2005-10-09 05:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771368, 240373, 21216, '<td valign="top">Lens-baby? Great picture, I love the abstract feel, it makes for a warm and nice environment, I just wish the bars weren''t there but I guess you couldn''t change that.</td>', 'Lens-baby? Great picture, I love the abstract feel, it makes for a warm and nice environment, I just wish the bars weren''t there but I guess you couldn''t change that.', '2005-10-09 05:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771372, 239152, 21216, '<td valign="top">The milk should have been in another cup. Otherwie not bad idea. Next time try not to use flash.</td>', 'The milk should have been in another cup. Otherwie not bad idea. Next time try not to use flash.', '2005-10-09 05:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771388, 239995, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really like the desaturation of colors in this photo.  It makes the customers in the background stand out better and gives it that coffee shop feel.  I don''t like, however, how the head and face is blurred on the gal in the foreground.</td>', 'I really like the desaturation of colors in this photo.  It makes the customers in the background stand out better and gives it that coffee shop feel.  I don''t like, however, how the head and face is blurred on the gal in the foreground.', '2005-10-09 05:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771389, 240595, 3669, '<td valign="top">Creative lighting.  Nice detail.</td>', 'Creative lighting.  Nice detail.', '2005-10-09 05:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771390, 239137, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting, nice composition.  What about lighting the candle?</td>', 'Excellent lighting, nice composition.  What about lighting the candle?', '2005-10-09 05:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771397, 239819, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome photo.  I really like the lighting.  Too bad it doesn''t have to do with a coffee shop.  This deserves a high score, but doesn''t meet challenge.  7</td>', 'This is an awesome photo.  I really like the lighting.  Too bad it doesn''t have to do with a coffee shop.  This deserves a high score, but doesn''t meet challenge.  7', '2005-10-09 06:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771398, 238288, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, the shadows give this shot a lot more interest and the blown highlights aren´t really noticable.  Gave this a 7.</td>', 'Nicely lit, the shadows give this shot a lot more interest and the blown highlights aren´t really noticable.  Gave this a 7.', '2005-10-09 06:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771401, 239819, 31443, '<td valign="top">Where´s the beef, I mean coffee? Quality of photo indicates strongly that you´re off for the brown!</td>', 'Where´s the beef, I mean coffee? Quality of photo indicates strongly that you´re off for the brown!', '2005-10-09 06:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771403, 240259, 31443, '<td valign="top">But why?</td>', 'But why?', '2005-10-09 06:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771422, 240511, 31443, '<td valign="top">Help, I don´t see the coffee shop!</td>', 'Help, I don´t see the coffee shop!', '2005-10-09 07:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771465, 238473, 45141, '<td valign="top">I think that the background is a little distracting. Maybe it''s just me though...</td>', 'I think that the background is a little distracting. Maybe it''s just me though...', '2005-10-09 08:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
