(1771531, 238915, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  Good feel of the texture in the beans. Good tonal range from black to white.  Composition is fine.  Well exposed.  <br/> <br/>You lost your foam!  ;^)  Hard to get the shot you want on the first take sometimes isn''t it.  He-he.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is nice.  Good feel of the texture in the beans. Good tonal range from black to white.  Composition is fine.  Well exposed.   You lost your foam!  ;^)  Hard to get the shot you want on the first take sometimes isn''t it.  He-he.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-09 09:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771535, 239152, 30049, '<td valign="top">An ''A'' for effort!  Had to have taken some time to put that together.  Fun concept with the photo.  I think your composition is fine (perhaps a bit tight), but I think you may run into some issues with the exposure as the sugar dish is a bit hot.  Overall, a good job.   Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'An ''A'' for effort!  Had to have taken some time to put that together.  Fun concept with the photo.  I think your composition is fine (perhaps a bit tight), but I think you may run into some issues with the exposure as the sugar dish is a bit hot.  Overall, a good job.   Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-09 09:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771546, 239995, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has a fun feel to it.  The slight blur adds a good sense of movement - without it she would have looked posed.  Tough lighting conditions with the darker coffee area vs the well-lit counter area.  Did pretty well with it.<br/> <br/>Well, my comment time is about up as my 3yr-old just joined me.  I asked him what he thought of the "picture" and he said "Looks pretty good" "It''s a nice shot".<br/> <br/>Like father like son!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This has a fun feel to it.  The slight blur adds a good sense of movement - without it she would have looked posed.  Tough lighting conditions with the darker coffee area vs the well-lit counter area.  Did pretty well with it. Well, my comment time is about up as my 3yr-old just joined me.  I asked him what he thought of the "picture" and he said "Looks pretty good" "It''s a nice shot". Like father like son!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-09 10:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771575, 240121, 31443, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in this one, well done...</td>', 'Love the colors in this one, well done...', '2005-10-09 10:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
