(1771845, 237485, 29009, '<td valign="top">This shot has lots of potential - the toning really works here.  My eye kind of wandered around a little too much before it settled on a focal point.  It was hard to choose between the people at the tables, and none of them have a great facial expression.  Overall, this a good shot.</td>', 'This shot has lots of potential - the toning really works here.  My eye kind of wandered around a little too much before it settled on a focal point.  It was hard to choose between the people at the tables, and none of them have a great facial expression.  Overall, this a good shot.', '2005-10-09 14:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771858, 240346, 29009, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve framed the shot so that the lines of the table point to the action.  I''m sure you''ve heard this from others:  the date stamp has to go for challenge entries.  You''ve captured the ordinariness of a morning ritual.  Unfortunately, this particular shot has a snapshot feel to it rather than an artistic interpretation of a daily event.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like how you''ve framed the shot so that the lines of the table point to the action.  I''m sure you''ve heard this from others:  the date stamp has to go for challenge entries.  You''ve captured the ordinariness of a morning ritual.  Unfortunately, this particular shot has a snapshot feel to it rather than an artistic interpretation of a daily event.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-09 14:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771871, 239996, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is just fantastic.  The toning really works well here, and the facial expression on the waitress is right on the money.  You''ve really done a great job capturing the mood and essence of the coffee shop.  Great work here!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is just fantastic.  The toning really works well here, and the facial expression on the waitress is right on the money.  You''ve really done a great job capturing the mood and essence of the coffee shop.  Great work here!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-09 14:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771873, 239954, 29009, '<td valign="top">Lovely cup.  I''m not sure about the negative space in the top of the frame.  It would have worked better if there was some steam rising from the cup.  Overall, a decent shot.</td>', 'Lovely cup.  I''m not sure about the negative space in the top of the frame.  It would have worked better if there was some steam rising from the cup.  Overall, a decent shot.', '2005-10-09 14:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771880, 239995, 29009, '<td valign="top">This shot has a lot of potential.  The motion blur in the face of the waitress doesn''t work here, although using it to show the busy motion of the hands was a good idea.  Overall, a decent shot.</td>', 'This shot has a lot of potential.  The motion blur in the face of the waitress doesn''t work here, although using it to show the busy motion of the hands was a good idea.  Overall, a decent shot.', '2005-10-09 14:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771885, 239995, 43190, '<td valign="top">I like the movement, a nice touch considering the fast pace of coffeeshops.  9</td>', 'I like the movement, a nice touch considering the fast pace of coffeeshops.  9', '2005-10-09 14:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771886, 240548, 29009, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very warm and inviting place.  The warmness of the color cast is a little overpowering, though.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a very warm and inviting place.  The warmness of the color cast is a little overpowering, though.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-09 14:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
