(1771906, 239237, 29009, '<td valign="top">Perspective is skewed, I presume to avoid flash reflection in the window?  The crooked lines are distracting, and there isn''t much inside the window with visual appeal. You''ve done a good job showing the warmth inside the building.</td>', 'Perspective is skewed, I presume to avoid flash reflection in the window?  The crooked lines are distracting, and there isn''t much inside the window with visual appeal. You''ve done a good job showing the warmth inside the building.', '2005-10-09 14:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
