(1771914, 239747, 29009, '<td valign="top">Creative composition, excellent detail on the beans.  Nice work.</td>', 'Creative composition, excellent detail on the beans.  Nice work.', '2005-10-09 14:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771917, 240427, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is just fantastic.  What a fabulous idea!  Good composition, nice setting of mood, I think this could be a winner.  Great work.  (10)</td>', 'This is just fantastic.  What a fabulous idea!  Good composition, nice setting of mood, I think this could be a winner.  Great work.  (10)', '2005-10-09 14:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771919, 239819, 29009, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t see the relevance to the challenge theme.  Overall, it''s a decent shot of a baseball.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t see the relevance to the challenge theme.  Overall, it''s a decent shot of a baseball.', '2005-10-09 14:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771921, 240601, 29009, '<td valign="top">You''ve stopped the motion effectively.  The colors are flat and the background is distracting.  If the subject had been spitting up into the air you would have had a nicer arc in the spew.  Really though, overall, this shot lacks visual appeal.  The action of spitting is distasteful and there doesn''t seem to be a good reason for it, ie. no bugs or anything in the cup.</td>', 'You''ve stopped the motion effectively.  The colors are flat and the background is distracting.  If the subject had been spitting up into the air you would have had a nicer arc in the spew.  Really though, overall, this shot lacks visual appeal.  The action of spitting is distasteful and there doesn''t seem to be a good reason for it, ie. no bugs or anything in the cup.', '2005-10-09 14:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771923, 239531, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good facial expression on the model.  Unfortunately, this shot is defeated by being out of focus and a white balance that''s off.  Better luck next time.</td>', 'Good facial expression on the model.  Unfortunately, this shot is defeated by being out of focus and a white balance that''s off.  Better luck next time.', '2005-10-09 14:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771931, 240566, 29009, '<td valign="top">You''ve shown your thoughts on a major coffee chains prices extremely well.  On my monitor I can see some wavy lines that look like noise artificats (luminance channel?) and it''s a bit distracting.  This would be in the upper right hand corner.  With that said, I love the tag line on the coffee cup and the sugar packets are priceless.  Nice satire.</td>', 'You''ve shown your thoughts on a major coffee chains prices extremely well.  On my monitor I can see some wavy lines that look like noise artificats (luminance channel?) and it''s a bit distracting.  This would be in the upper right hand corner.  With that said, I love the tag line on the coffee cup and the sugar packets are priceless.  Nice satire.', '2005-10-09 14:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771939, 239050, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent composition. The can on the furthest right doesn''t seem to be tilted in the same direction as the others, but that is a teensy thing.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is an excellent composition. The can on the furthest right doesn''t seem to be tilted in the same direction as the others, but that is a teensy thing.  Nice job.', '2005-10-09 14:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
