(1772004, 240216, 21183, '<td valign="top">Really like this photo. Lovely colours and warmth to it. Quite abstract. Artistic. Gave it 9.  Only suggestion to improve (for me, anyway) would be to crop a bit off the bottom so that the light/bright area sits a bit lower in the shot. Best of luck with this in the voting.</td>', 'Really like this photo. Lovely colours and warmth to it. Quite abstract. Artistic. Gave it 9.  Only suggestion to improve (for me, anyway) would be to crop a bit off the bottom so that the light/bright area sits a bit lower in the shot. Best of luck with this in the voting.', '2005-10-09 15:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
