(1773567, 238783, 30018, '<td valign="top">I''m going to Clarke''s!  Beautiful model/patron.  However for this image, and this challenge, I wonder if it would have been better to have the coffee cup in focus and that lovely lady just out of focus in  your DOF.  I like the shot a lot, as it very nicely depicts the coffee shop theme.  Very nicely done  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'I''m going to Clarke''s!  Beautiful model/patron.  However for this image, and this challenge, I wonder if it would have been better to have the coffee cup in focus and that lovely lady just out of focus in  your DOF.  I like the shot a lot, as it very nicely depicts the coffee shop theme.  Very nicely done  <9>', '2005-10-10 05:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
