(1775837, 237446, 39349, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the significance of this shot to a coffee shop. Guess this could be what''s outside the window? <br/> <br/>Anyway, shot is a tad flat to me. I''m wondering if maybe playing with b/c would create more impact and bring out the DOF more in this? Nice shot though I just felt it didn''t fit the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not sure the significance of this shot to a coffee shop. Guess this could be what''s outside the window?  Anyway, shot is a tad flat to me. I''m wondering if maybe playing with b/c would create more impact and bring out the DOF more in this? Nice shot though I just felt it didn''t fit the challenge.', '2005-10-11 03:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
