(1778175, 239049, 37893, '<td valign="top">Hi Jeannele :) I think this image lacked the strong story behind it. From the looks of the comments below, people seem to be at a loss of what you''re trying to convey. As far as the image is concerned, the horizon is a bit off so it''s a tad distracting. There are blown highlights probably because this was shot during the day and the sun was beating down through the windows. It''s really not a BW but a duotone. I think BW and a bump in the levels would make this image stand out a bit.</td>', 'Hi Jeannele :) I think this image lacked the strong story behind it. From the looks of the comments below, people seem to be at a loss of what you''re trying to convey. As far as the image is concerned, the horizon is a bit off so it''s a tad distracting. There are blown highlights probably because this was shot during the day and the sun was beating down through the windows. It''s really not a BW but a duotone. I think BW and a bump in the levels would make this image stand out a bit.', '2005-10-12 01:22:44.000000', NULL, 0),
