(1778704, 239050, 18663, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.<br/>This was not exactly the idea I had in mind and I believe I could have  scored a little higher with the original idea. This store had several of these coffe storage glasses all lined up and I wanted to get them all playing with depth of field.<br/>This was a nice store in a small town called Delft here in Netherlands, the place was full of people which made it very hard to get the picture. Besides, the owner didn''t seem to like me taking pictures inside her place and she was already giving me a not so friendly look :)<br/>Anyway, this was the first challenge I''ve entered and I''m already quite happy with the 12th place as a start.<br/> <br/>As for the editing part, I didn''t do much. Cropped, decreased saturation a lot, added a little yellow (nothing wrong with your monitor sodastreamer!) and sharped a bit.<br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.This was not exactly the idea I had in mind and I believe I could have  scored a little higher with the original idea. This store had several of these coffe storage glasses all lined up and I wanted to get them all playing with depth of field.This was a nice store in a small town called Delft here in Netherlands, the place was full of people which made it very hard to get the picture. Besides, the owner didn''t seem to like me taking pictures inside her place and she was already giving me a not so friendly look :)Anyway, this was the first challenge I''ve entered and I''m already quite happy with the 12th place as a start. As for the editing part, I didn''t do much. Cropped, decreased saturation a lot, added a little yellow (nothing wrong with your monitor sodastreamer!) and sharped a bit.', '2005-10-12 05:07:06.000000', NULL, 0),
