(1778829, 240427, 42792, '<td valign="top">Congratulations for an ingenious idea and for the ribbon of course!  Certainly took the hum-drum out of coffee shop with that emotive reflection.  Makes all the difference.</td>', 'Congratulations for an ingenious idea and for the ribbon of course!  Certainly took the hum-drum out of coffee shop with that emotive reflection.  Makes all the difference.', '2005-10-12 07:01:26.000000', NULL, 0),
