(1779986, 239564, 30881, '<td valign="top">Contrary to where this finished and some comments, this is a very good shot and its great to see someone stretch and climb out of the box. If you don''t experiment you''ll rapidly fall into the same rut as many others do around here. Great work and keep it up. Try a similar shot the next time there is a B&amp;W challenge and you''ll hear nothing but praises!!</td>', 'Contrary to where this finished and some comments, this is a very good shot and its great to see someone stretch and climb out of the box. If you don''t experiment you''ll rapidly fall into the same rut as many others do around here. Great work and keep it up. Try a similar shot the next time there is a B&W challenge and you''ll hear nothing but praises!!', '2005-10-12 14:42:41.000000', NULL, 0),
