(1781382, 239819, 36299, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aquarian11:</b></div><hr/><i> Well, the gals and guys in the coffee shop near me have come from the park and are carrying balls, kites, frisbees!   Another coffee shop has a ball under glass.  Another has a picture of a baseball.  So...I get it. Oops, was that a baseball that rolled out of my backpack? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Lol, just shows what people think and what is the truth can be opposite.</td>', 'Originally posted by aquarian11: Well, the gals and guys in the coffee shop near me have come from the park and are carrying balls, kites, frisbees!   Another coffee shop has a ball under glass.  Another has a picture of a baseball.  So...I get it. Oops, was that a baseball that rolled out of my backpack?   Lol, just shows what people think and what is the truth can be opposite.', '2005-10-13 02:03:59.000000', NULL, 0),
